line': {'original': 'By THE ASSOCIATED PRESS', 'person': [], 'organization': 'THE ASSOCIATED PRESS'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1d82c146-d988-5e7a-968a-b4d26283156c', 'word_count': 380, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1d82c146-d988-5e7a-968a-b4d26283156c'}, {'abstract': '“Sexual Chronicles of a French Family” tells its story in its title.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/01/movies/sexual-chronicles-of-a-french-family.html', 'snippet': '“Sexual Chronicles of a French Family” tells its story in its title.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Let’s agree that too many American movies find it hilarious when teenagers, in all sorts of crass ways, rush to lose their virginity. “Sexual Chronicles of a French Family” takes that primary objective more seriously. It aims to break the taboo and show sex as it really is: banal.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_SEXUALCHRONICLES_SPAN/01RDP_SEXUALCHRONICLES_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_SEXUALCHRONICLES_SPAN/01RDP_SEXUALCHRONICLES_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_SEXUALCHRONICLES_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 552, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_SEXUALCHRONICLES_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1035, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/a