.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/01/movies/one-day-on-earth-directed-by-kyle-ruddick.html', 'snippet': '“One Day on Earth,” video snapshots from around the world, all filmed on Oct. 10, 2010, is an inspiring visual feast that can seem a bit scattered.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The crowd-sourced global diary, a new kind of documentary in which thousands of videos shot around the world at the same time are assembled into a concise chronicle of a day in the life of the planet, is an astonishing technological and organizational achievement. The visual feast it provides is inspiring and breathtaking, introducing audiences to cultures, customs and languages while underscoring humanity’s inescapable connectedness.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1200, 'width': 1600, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/arts/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN/01RDP_ONEDAY_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai