of destructive, degenerate fraternity louts (our heroes) who battle a Nixonian dean and his minions in the supposedly innocent early 1960s, was so raunchy that only one studio would touch it, and only if the budget was kept low and the shooting schedule brief. Almost everyone involved was a Hollywood neophyte. Somehow, those unpromising elements coalesced into one of the most successful and influential comedies ever made.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '42', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/books/review/03KEEPNEWS/03KEEPNEWS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 761, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/books/review/03KEEPNEWS/03KEEPNEWS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1522, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/books/review/03KEEPNEWS/03KEEPNEWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/03/books/review/03KEEPNEWS/03KEEPNEWS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/books/review/03KEEPNEWS/03KEEPNEWS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Food Fight!', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Food Fight!', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'perso