r-planting-in-riverside-park-south/', 'snippet': 'The sculptures are part of the Model to Monument program and are to be installed this month.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Budding sculptors are welding and forging at a metal shop in Brooklyn and at the Modern Art Foundry in Queens to create monumental sculptures that will be installed in Riverside Park South and Van Cortlandt Park this month for one year. The sculptors are part of the Art Students League of New York’s Model to Monument (M2M) program, in conjunction with the New York City Parks Department. Seven sculptures will be placed in Riverside Park South and one in Van Cortlandt Park.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Giant Sculptures Grow in Brooklyn (and Queens), for Planting in Riverside Park South', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sculpture', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wyatt, Greg', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ART STUDENTS LEAGUE', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Riverside Park (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T14:32:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robin Pogrebin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pogrebin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/472d5df5-6d82-5023-a479-ef9381cddc5e', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/472d5df5-6d82-5023-a479-ef9381cddc5e'}, {'abstract': 'Vikram Gandhi talks about how he came to make his documentary “Kumaré,” about his alter ego, a yoga teacher 