pop diva who died the night before the broadcast.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Grammy Awards to Be Held on Feb. 10', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grammy Awards', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adele (Singer)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Houston, Whitney', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'CBS Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Academy of Recording Arts and Sciences', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Staples Center', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T15:41:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eee6d00f-7aff-5974-b5ef-76e60512972f', 'word_count': 114, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eee6d00f-7aff-5974-b5ef-76e60512972f'}, {'abstract': 'My soon-to-be ex turned out to be one of the few people who shared my vision of a better, more connected future — with different partners.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/fashion/happily-ever-after-divorce.html', 'snippet': 'My soon-to-be ex turned out to be one of the few people who shared my vision of a better, more connected future — with different partners.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MY husband and I started talking divorce at my friend Sara’s wedding. It was May in the Hamptons. Standing before the crashing Atlantic in her strapless gown, my friend looked vulnerable yet serene, as if she knew this man would always hold back the tide. Sara’s bridegroom read his vows, shivering a little as he promised to always listen, to make her goals his goals, to constantly improve his mind to remain interesting to her.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/fashion/03MODERNLOVE/03MODERNLOVE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 622, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/fashion/03MODERNLOVE/03MODERNLOVE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1244, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/fashion/03MODERNLOVE/03MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/03/fashion/03MODERNLOVE/03MODERNLOVE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/fashion/03MODERNLOVE/03MODERNLOVE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Happily Ever, After We Split', 'kicker': 'Modern Love', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Happily Ever, After We Split', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Divorce, Separations and Annulments', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Modern Love (Times Column)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T15:42:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Styles', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'byline': {'or