 it probably didn’t realize what a confusing mess it could create. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Securities Law Ruling Creates Unintended Problems', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Investments', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T16:25:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Steven Davidoff Solomon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Steven', 'middlename': 'Davidoff', 'lastname': 'Solomon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dda40d6e-ce50-58a9-92c4-8db8ac9ba25c', 'word_count': 1377, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dda40d6e-ce50-58a9-92c4-8db8ac9ba25c'}, {'abstract': 'After being condemned as failing to uphold Catholic doctrine, the sisters are sending representatives to Rome to speak with Vatican officials.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/us/nuns-speak-about-vatican-criticism.html', 'snippet': 'After being condemned as failing to uphold Catholic doctrine, the sisters are sending representatives to Rome to speak with Vatican officials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The American nuns who were harshly condemned by the Vatican in April as failing to uphold Catholic doctrine finally responded on Friday in their own strong terms, saying the Vatican’s assessment was based on “unsubstantiated accusations” and a “flawed process,” and has caused scandal, pain and polarization in the Roman Catholic Church.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/us/02nuns-span1/02nuns-span1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/02/us/02nuns-span1/02nuns-span1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/us/02nuns-span1/02nuns-span1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/us/02nuns-span1/02nuns-span1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/us/02nuns-span1/02nuns-span1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/02/us/02nuns-span1/02nuns-span1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/us/02nuns-span1/02nuns-span1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'American Nuns Vow to Fight Vatican Criticism', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'American Nuns Vow to Fight Vatican Criticism', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roman Catholic Church', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuns', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Leadership Conference of Women Religious', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Congregation for the Doctrine of the Faith', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T16:26:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Laurie Goodstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Laurie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goodstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/526067dc-d24a-5828-8895-bcd94eb44b87', 'word_count': 963, 'uri': 'nyt://article/526067dc-d24a-5828-8895-bcd94eb44b87'}, {'abstract': 'Russell Westbrook and Tony Parker are competing in the Western Conference finals while playing the same position, but the Thunder and Spurs have done their best to avoid a direct matchup of their two star point guards.', 'web_url': 'https://offthedribble.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/01/westbrook-parker-and-the-matchup-that-sometimes-isnt/', 'snippet': 'Russell Westbrook and Tony Parker are competing in the Western Conference finals while playing the same position, but the Thunder and Spurs have done their best to avoid a direct matchup of their two star point guards.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The star-crossed pairing of the youthful Oklahoma City Thunder and the ageless San Antonio Spurs may be a collision of ensembles rather than brilliantly talented individuals, but the occasion to see two players as spectacular as Russell Westbrook and Tony Parker work against one another nevertheless makes for a special occasion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Westbrook, Parker and the Matchup That Sometimes Isn’t', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brooks, Scott', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value'