ks at Target 2, the interbank loan system through which some central banks have fallen deeply in debt to the European Central Bank, and others — most importantly the German Bundesbank — have lent huge sums to the E.C.B.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'German Law, Not European, if a Central Bank Defaults', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T18:02:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/49a7100b-5a75-5f88-be2d-908aa14897a2', 'word_count': 284, 'uri': 'nyt://article/49a7100b-5a75-5f88-be2d-908aa14897a2'}, {'abstract': 'This spring, the American Queen welcomed its first passengers in years. As it cruised the Mississippi, things seemed fine until a “wreck” threatened to do the unthinkable: disrupt dinner.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/travel/the-american-queen-paddle-wheeler-cruises-on-the-mississippi.html', 'snippet': 'This spring, the American Queen welcomed its first passengers in years. As it cruised the Mississippi, things seemed fine until a “wreck” threatened to do the unthinkable: disrupt dinner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FEW who survived it — and, in truth, we all survived it — will soon forget the Great Yazoo Steamboat Wreck of 2012. For one thing, it seemed briefly as if it might disrupt our 5 p.m. dinner seating, which would have raised a howl loud enough to send a hog to church. For another, it was the most exciting thing that happened during our pleasantly lazy six days on the American Queen, a grand steamboat that made a much anticipated return to river cruising this spring after several years at rest.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/travel/03coversub/03coversub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/03/travel/03coversub/03coversub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/travel/03coversub/03coversub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/travel/03coversub/03coversub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/travel/03coversub/03coversub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/03/travel/03coversub/03coversub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/travel/03coversub/03coversub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'One Week on a Mississippi Steamboat Cruise', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Full Steam On the Mississippi', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None