losing-family-in-fire.html', 'snippet': 'Madonna Badger, whose three daughters and parents died, is accusing the Connecticut city of demolishing the remains of her burned house before the cause of the blaze was determined.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Madonna Badger, whose three young daughters and parents died in a fire at her waterfront house in Stamford, Conn., last Christmas morning, plans to sue the city, contending that its actions caused her to lose $3 million worth of property and hurt her chances of collecting compensation for her losses, according to a notice of claim sent to city officials this week.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/Y-STAMFORD3/Y-STAMFORD3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/Y-STAMFORD3/Y-STAMFORD3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1475, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/Y-STAMFORD3/Y-STAMFORD3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/Y-STAMFORD3/Y-STAMFORD3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/Y-STAMFORD3/Y-STAMFORD3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Woman to Sue Stamford After Losing Family in Blaze', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Woman to Sue S