e musical, which features characters and subplots from Spider-Man comics and movies. Ms. Taymor’s lawyers, who regard the outline as crucial to her copyright claims and battle for more than $1 million from the producers, countered that the document reflected what they termed originality and the singular vision that she had demonstrated as the Tony Award-winning director of “The Lion King.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lawyers in ‘Spider-Man’ Battle Spin Their Early Arguments', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cohl, Michael', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Harris, Jeremiah J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taymor, Julie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T20:35:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3d76c1b-430b-58ba-bb9d-f45c74928d6f', 'word_count': 970, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3d76c1b-430b-58ba-bb9d-f45c74928d6f'}, {'abstract': 'All the fashion news of the week that’s fit to reprint.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/01/chic-in-review-kate-moss-speaks-sort-of/', 'snippet': 'All the fashion news of the week that’s fit to reprint.', 'lead_paragraph': 'All the fashion news of the week that’s fit to reprint.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Chic in Review | Kate Moss Speaks! Sort Of …', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'k