zzard Entertainment has upgraded its Diablo franchise, including a very real capitalistic twist.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/arts/video-games/diablo-iii-video-game-from-blizzard-entertainment.html', 'snippet': 'After 12 years, Blizzard Entertainment has upgraded its Diablo franchise, including a very real capitalistic twist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A dozen years ago, if you had a second phone line dedicated to your dial-up modem so you could go online without disrupting your home telephone service, that meant you were a serious technology expert.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/arts/DIABLO/DIABLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 395, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/02/arts/DIABLO/DIABLO-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 395}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/arts/DIABLO/DIABLO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 788, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/arts/DIABLO/DIABLO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1577, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/arts/DIABLO/DIABLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/02/arts/DIABLO/DIABLO-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/arts/DIABLO/DIABLO-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height':