/artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/01/andy-samberg-confirms-hes-leaving-saturday-night-live/', 'snippet': 'Andy Samberg, who helped pioneer the popular “Saturday Night Live” digital shorts like “Lazy Sunday,” “I’m on a Boat” and “I Just Had Sex,” said that leaving the show was “one of the hardest decisions I’ve ever made.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'In one of his last appearances on the season finale of “Saturday Night Live,” a rapping Andy Samberg traded a rhyme with Chris Parnell that seemed loaded with underlying meaning: “On these New York streets I hone my fake rap penmanship / That’s how it began, and that’s how I’m-a finish it.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Andy Samberg Confirms He’s Leaving ‘Saturday Night Live’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parnell, Chris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Samberg, Andy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schaffer, Akiva', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Taccone, Jorma', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Timberlake, Justin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wiig, Kristen', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-01T22:51:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1c398095-d268-5093-80ed-4e25862d301f', 'word_count': 441, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1c398095-d268-5093-80ed-4e25862d30