rom the ground and the air, and then carried out an airstrike in Gaza against a squad that had fired a rocket at Israeli soldiers, according to military officials. A Gaza medical official said that four Palestinians were wounded in the airstrike. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Israel: Soldier and Militant Killed', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Middle East', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israel: Soldier and Militant Killed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T00:25:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/86a4c878-acdd-5af4-8426-5b95bed2bd01', 'word_count': 76, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86a4c878-acdd-5af4-8426-5b95bed2bd01'}, {'abstract': 'An Oregon woman paid $950 toward a 12-night rental on a SoHo apartment offered on Craigslist, only to find that the building it was in is nonexistent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/nyregion/falling-prey-to-a-fraudulent-vacation-rental-crime-scene.html', 'snippet': 'An Oregon woman paid $950 toward a 12-night rental on a SoHo apartment offered on Craigslist, only to find that the building it was in is nonexistent.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Now I can spot a scam a mile away,” a woman named Lisa said. She then shared her story — with the condition that her last name and the name of her employer be withheld — so that others could spot one, too. Lisa lives in Portland, Ore. In March, while planning a work trip to Manhattan, she came across a beauty of a deal on Craigslist in the increasingly competitive field of apartments for vacation rental: a two-bedroom, two-bath apartment at 98 Mercer Street, a cobblestone block of SoHo. Cost: $100 a night.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/CRIMESCENE/CRIMESCENE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 648, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/CRIMESCENE/CRIMESCENE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1296, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/CRIMESCENE/CRIMESCENE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/CRIMESCENE/CRIMESCENE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/nyregion/CRIMESCENE/CRIMESCENE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'An Absentee Landlord of an Absentee Vacation Property', 'kicker': 'Crime Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Absentee Landlord of an Absentee Vacation Property', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject',