n.html', 'snippet': 'Li Tingpang, 78, grew tired of the planned activities in his senior residence in Harlem, so he found a neglected lot near the Harlem River Drive and began tilling a garden.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Li Tingpang, 78, grew tired of the planned activities in his senior residence in Harlem, so he found a neglected lot near the Harlem River Drive and began tilling a garden.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/nyregion/video-chinesegardener/video-chinesegardener-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/01/nyregion/video-chinesegardener/video-chinesegardener-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/01/nyregion/video-chinesegardener/video-chinesegardener-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/01/nyregion/video-chinesegardener/video-chinesegardener-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Harlem, an Unlikely Garden', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T01:44:16+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'Corey Kilgannon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Corey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kilgannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/eea8a806-7505-57e1-b457-3390b8acacae', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/eea8a806-7505-57e1-b457-3390b8acacae'}, {'abstract': 'Rory Sabbatini watched a Bob Marley documentary and then played himself into the lead at the Memorial.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/01/sabbatinis-beat-is-good-so-far/', 'snippet': 'Rory Sabbatini watched a Bob Marley documentary and then played himself into the lead at the Memorial.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DUBLIN, Ohio — Because of bad weather in the morning, Rory Sabbatini didn’t start his second round at the Memorial until well after 3 p.m. To pass the time, he watched a documentary about the reggae star Bob Marley. Playing in overcast, windy conditions, Sabbatini scored so well he could be forgiven for whistling “The Sun Is Shining” from Marley’s song list.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Sabbatini’s Beat Is Good So Far', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reggae Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Marley, Bob', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sabbatini, Rory', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dublin (Ireland)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ohio', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T01:45:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b42ad689-f34f-5b94-9668-0b29b049fc3e', 'word_count': 391, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b42ad689-f34f-5b94-9668-0b29b049fc3e'}, {'abstract': 'Bored, Li Tingbang, 78, started a vegetable garden in a trash-strewn lot in his Harlem neighborhood. Now, it yields a bounty of beans, lettuce, melons and other produce.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/nyregion/li-tingbang-78-guerrilla-gardener-in-the-city.html', 'snippet': 'Bored, Li Tingbang, 78, started a vegetable garden in a trash-strewn lot in his Harlem neighborhood. Now, it yields a bounty of beans, lettuce, melons and other produce.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LI TINGBANG, a 78-year-old Chinese immigrant who grew up on a farm outside Canton, now known as Guangzhou, was always a restless type. So three years ago, bored with the dance and mah-jongg classes given in the senior residence where he lives in Harlem, he decided he needed a garden.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mr. Li’s Guerrilla Garden', 'kicker': 'Character Study', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mr. Li’s Guerrilla Garden', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vegetables', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'HARLEM (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gardens and Gardening', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T01:55:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Corey Kilgannon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Corey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kilgannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cedb1740-246b-5801-b025-8c21589b0897', 'word_count': 762, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cedb1740-246b-5801-b025-8c21589b0897'}, {'abstract': 'Ashley Parker reports on Mitt Romney’s strategy of callin