n in the wake of the financial crisis, but soon they will be subject to new federal rules.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/business/new-rules-for-money-transfers-but-few-limits.html', 'snippet': 'Money-transfer companies like Western Union largely escaped the regulatory crackdown in the wake of the financial crisis, but soon they will be subject to new federal rules.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From her job at a packaging factory in Chicago, Patricia Gonzalez cobbles together $70 a month to send to her mother in Guadalajara, Mexico, leaving her less money for groceries. In Boardman, Ore., Raul Esparza, a migrant farmworker, works as many hours as he can to send $50 a week to his children in Mexico City. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/business/TRANSFERE1/TRANSFERE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/02/business/TRANSFERE1/TRANSFERE1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/business/TRANSFERE1/TRANSFERE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 877, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/business/TRANSFERE1/TRANSFERE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1755, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/business/TRANSFERE1/TRANSFERE1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/02/business/TRANSFERE1/TRANSFERE1-