e Department has asked Florida to stop reviewing its voter rolls for potentially ineligible names, saying that the state appears to be in violation of federal election laws.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/us/justice-dept-asks-florida-to-end-voter-purge.html', 'snippet': 'The Justice Department has asked Florida to stop reviewing its voter rolls for potentially ineligible names, saying that the state appears to be in violation of federal election laws.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MIAMI — The Justice Department has asked Florida to stop searching for and purging the names of possible ineligible voters, saying that the state appears to be in violation of federal voter protection laws. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Search for Illegal Voters May Violate Federal Safeguards, U.S. Tells Florida', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Search for Illegal Voters May Violate Federal Safeguards, U.S. Tells Florida', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voter Registration and Requirements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Detzner, Ken', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voting Rights Act (1965)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Herren, T Christian Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Florida', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T03:08:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lizette Alvarez', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lizette', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alvarez', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_