V.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/sports/baseball/johan-santanas-no-hitter-went-viral-and-galactic.html', 'snippet': 'Coverage of the first no-hitter in the 51-year history of the Mets spread via Twitter, radio and TV.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A no-hitter like Johan Santana’s Friday night is, in the modern world, a viral event. Shortly after seeing messages on Twitter saying that Santana was on his way to making Mets history, a friend called to say, “Watch the top of the ninth.” In the past, that suggestion amounted to a tease. Tom Seaver lost three no-hitters in the ninth inning.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets’ Voices Make the Call', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mets’ Voices Make the Call', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cohen, Gary', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Twitter', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Santana, Johan', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T04:01:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99cf976b-d4f0-5ec1-b867-226b744bcad2', 'word_count': 419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99cf976b-d4f0-5ec1-b867-226b744bcad2'}, {'abstract': 'In a rural pocket of Wyoming, residents have long 