gger than any other on the archipelago.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Galápagos Islands, A Bigger Center for Divers', 'kicker': 'In Transit', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diving and Divers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Galapagos Islands', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T14:00:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Elaine Glusac', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Elaine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Glusac', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/48f2c43a-4086-53d8-a83d-6b99beea047c', 'word_count': 164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/48f2c43a-4086-53d8-a83d-6b99beea047c'}, {'abstract': 'A New York-bred filly that escaped horse slaughter is not sick; she is healthy and sound. She is not old and feeble; she is young and scopey. She is far from dangerous; according to her former trainer she is a “sweetheart.”', 'web_url': 'https://therail.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/a-4-year-old-filly-is-safe-and-sound/', 'snippet': 'A New York-bred filly that escaped horse slaughter is not sick; she is healthy and sound. She is not old and feeble; she is young and scopey. She is far from dangerous; according to her former trainer she is a “sweetheart.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is the face of horse slaughter. She’s a 4-year-old thoroughbred filly, a New York-bred. She was born on a beautiful farm in Westchester County. Her life on that farm would have been textbook perfect, it’s an outstanding facility, with a staff experienced in raising top-flight racehorses. Eventually, she was in training at Finger Lakes Race Track in Farmington, N.Y., but she never made a start. At the end of last year’s race meet, her owner asked her trainer to find her a home. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A 4-Year-Old Filly Is Safe, and Sound', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Slaughterhouses', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T14:08:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': "By Liz O'Connell", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liz', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Connell", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/563816db-5bca-567f-b786-d45287d7b2a3', 'word_count': 993, 'uri': 'nyt://article/563816db-5bca-567f-b786-d45287d7b2a3'}, {'abstract': 'David Kirkpatrick of The New York Times reports on the verdict finding Hosni Mubarak, the former Egyptian president, guilty of failing to stop the killing of demonstrators in last year’s uprising.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/world/middleeast/100000001583431/hosni-mubarak-sentenced-to-life-term.html', 'snippet': 'David Kirkpatrick of The New York Times reports on the verdict finding Hosni Mubarak, the former Egyptian president, guilty of failing to stop the killing of demonstrators in last year’s uprising.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Kirkpatrick of The New York Times reports on the verdict finding Hosni Mubarak, the former Egyptian president, guilty of failing to stop the killing of demonstrators in last year’s uprising.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/02/world/video-mubarak-verdict/video-mubarak-verdict-articleLarge.jpg', 