': 'nyt://article/35cd1e44-1beb-500c-8176-0a052d155d32'}, {'abstract': 'It’s not always easy to find a place to sample high-quality wines by the glass in Paris. You’re better off going to the wine-producing regions of France. Or Italy. Stephane Girard is trying to change that.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/02/tasters-choice-in-a-paris-wine-bar/', 'snippet': 'It’s not always easy to find a place to sample high-quality wines by the glass in Paris. You’re better off going to the wine-producing regions of France. Or Italy. Stephane Girard is trying to change that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Paris may be the capital of the greatest wine-producing country, but in one way it sometimes falls short. It’s not always easy to find a place to sample high-quality wines by the glass here. If tasting is your thing, you’re often better off going straight to the French wine regions. Or to Italy.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Last, Taster’s Choice in a Paris Wine Bar', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T15:57:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric Pfanner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pfanner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6cf4f505-2a3b-583d-9d32-f050905b4c1d', 'word_count': 451, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6cf4f505-2a3b-583d-9d32-f050905b4c1d'}, {'abstract': 'Evelyn Hofer brought the same quiet attention and detail to her work, whether at home or abroad. Her Ne