1268, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8eed8c2-e582-59ce-a4e3-928ab936d45d'}, {'abstract': 'Varvara Lepchenko, who never advanced beyond the second round of any previous Grand Slam tournament, moved into the fourth round Saturday by defeating Francesca Schiavone.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/sports/tennis/varvara-lepchenko-continues-surprising-run-to-french-opens-round-of-16.html', 'snippet': 'Varvara Lepchenko, who never advanced beyond the second round of any previous Grand Slam tournament, moved into the fourth round Saturday by defeating Francesca Schiavone.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The longer Varvara Lepchenko held on against Francesca Schiavone, the more Lepchenko implored herself to fight. That last word is something of a mantra for Lepchenko, a tidy way to explain an untidy narrative, the simplest way to summarize her life.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/YOPEN/YOPEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/YOPEN/YOPEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/YOPEN/YOPEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 582, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/YOPEN/YOPEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1165, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/YOPEN/YOPEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard',