action with compensation at Grand Slam tournaments, for which players said their share was as low as 5 percent to 15 percent.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/sports/tennis/grand-slam-purses-sore-point-for-players.html', 'snippet': 'Chief among player grievances is dissatisfaction with compensation at Grand Slam tournaments, for which players said their share was as low as 5 percent to 15 percent.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Donald Young lost in the first round of the French Open and pocketed 18,000 euros, or about $22,300.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/subYPLAYERS2/subYPLAYERS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 736, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/subYPLAYERS2/subYPLAYERS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1473, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Purses Are a Sore Point for Players at Majors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Purses Are a Sore Point For Players at Majors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Assn of Tennis Professionals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wages and Salaries', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadal, Rafael', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T18:22:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original':