sing of carbon paper captures in miniature the sea change sweeping today’s work force.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/opinion/sunday/carbon-paper-whats-that.html', 'snippet': 'The passing of carbon paper captures in miniature the sea change sweeping today’s work force.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not long ago, I was disgraced by a package of carbon paper. More precisely, I was disgraced by a visit to my local stationer’s, where I tried to buy a package of carbon paper. (I needed to transfer a drawing from surface A to surface B, and it seemed to me, then as now, that carbon paper has endured all these years for expressly that purpose.)', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sunday-review/03LOOSE/03LOOSE-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1782, 'width': 678, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sunday-review/03LOOSE/03LOOSE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1782, 'width': 678, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sunday-review/03LOOSE/03LOOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/03/sunday-review/03LOOSE/03LOOSE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sunday-review/03LOOSE/03LOOSE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Carbon Paper? What’s That?', 'kicker': 'Loose Ends', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline