0-c51f-5c22-b15e-febf9b7374ce'}, {'abstract': 'The stress and weariness that come with any job — even one that you enjoy — build over time, and a vacation can hit the reset button.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/jobs/balancing-your-vacation-and-a-busy-office-career-couch.html', 'snippet': 'The stress and weariness that come with any job — even one that you enjoy — build over time, and a vacation can hit the reset button.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q.  You’d like to take some vacation time this summer, but you have a heavy workload and are worried about falling behind. Should you take time off anyway?', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/business/03-CAREER/03-CAREER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1002, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/business/03-CAREER/03-CAREER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2004, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/business/03-CAREER/03-CAREER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/03/business/03-CAREER/03-CAREER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/business/03-CAREER/03-CAREER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Balancing a Vacation and a Busy Office', 'kicker': 'Career Couch', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Balancing A Vacation And a