ayed, and he shows no signs of slowing down.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/sports/rugby/brad-thorn-rugby-star-keeps-winning-titles-at-37.html', 'snippet': 'Brad Thorn, 37, has been a champion wherever he has played, and he shows no signs of slowing down.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WELLINGTON, New Zealand — The joke making the rounds after Leinster won the Heineken Cup was that Brad Thorn was going to join the soccer club Chelsea because he wanted to add the Premier League and Champions League trophies to his pool room.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/dog-rugby/dog-rugby-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 627, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/dog-rugby/dog-rugby-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1255, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/dog-rugby/dog-rugby-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/dog-rugby/dog-rugby-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/dog-rugby/dog-rugby-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Venerable New Zealand Star, Titles and Battles Keep Coming', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Venerable New Zealand Star, Titles and Battles Keep Coming', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None},