2/06/02/durably-dominant-american-view-humans-are-a-recent-divine-creation/', 'snippet': 'The dominant American view, unchanged over 30 years, is that humans are a very recent creation of God.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A fresh poll by the Gallup Organization shows that since 1982 there has been hardly a flicker in the dominance of the American view that God created humans in essentially modern form within the last 10,000 years: ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Durably Dominant American View: Humans are a Recent Divine Creation', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gallup Poll', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kloor, Keith', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-02T23:44:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/71a0f494-3bdd-50b7-acb1-9ac09891d5c3', 'word_count': 166, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71a0f494-3bdd-50b7-acb1-9ac09891d5c3'}, {'abstract': 'It wasn’t a no-hitter, but it was an impressive outing nonetheless by R. A. Dickey: 100 pitches, no walks and a complete-game shutout against the Cardinals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/sports/baseball/dickey-pitches-a-shutout-as-mets-beat-cardinals.html', 'snippet': 'It wasn’t a no-hitter, but it was an impressive outing nonetheless by R. A. Dickey: 100 pitches, no walks and a complete-game shutout against the Cardinals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'R. A. Dickey saw the ninth inning of Johan Santana’s no-hitter with a towel wrapped around his head, because he could not bring himself to watch what was unfolding. The ninth inning was too much, Dickey said, so he focused on Santana and his reactions, wanting the no-hitter so badly for both Santana and the city of New York.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/03mets-2/03mets-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/03mets-2/03mets-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1379, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/03mets-2/03mets-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/03mets-2/03mets-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/03/sports/03mets-2/03mets-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Day After No-Hitter, Dickey Puts Up More Zeros', 'kicker': 'Mets 5, Cardinals 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Day After No-Hitter, Dickey Puts Up More Zeros', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dickey, R A', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Louis Cardinals', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'person