The Sun, a brash daily tabloid, have fallen 28 percent since it first hit newsstands in February.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/business/media/sales-slip-for-the-sun-on-sunday-in-britain-murdochs-new-paper.html', 'snippet': 'Sales of the Sunday edition of The Sun, a brash daily tabloid, have fallen 28 percent since it first hit newsstands in February.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Rupert Murdoch has endured a litany of blows in the unending phone-hacking scandal at his British tabloids. But one setback isn’t happening in Parliament, but on Britain’s newsstands.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/business/SUN2/SUN2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 721, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/business/SUN2/SUN2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1442, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/business/SUN2/SUN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/04/business/SUN2/SUN2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/business/SUN2/SUN2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Tabloid by Murdoch Losing Sales', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Tabloid By Murdoch Losing Sales', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Newspapers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Murdoch, Rupert', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Sun, The (British Newspaper)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'News Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-03T22:23:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Chozick', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chozick', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ca659d9d-93d1-587c-8add-1741c4303fe1', 'word_count': 1229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ca659d9d-93d1-587c-8add-1741c4303fe1'}, {'abstract': 'The 52-board final of the Reisinger Knockout Teams took place on Thursday and Friday evenings at the Manhattan Bridge Club.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/crosswords/bridge/bridge-reisinger-knockout-teams-in-new-york-city.html', 'snippet': 'The 52-board final of the Reisinger Knockout Teams took place on Thursday and Friday evenings at the Manhattan Bridge Club.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The 52-board final of the Reisinger Knockout Teams took place on Thursday and Friday evenings at the Manhattan Bridge Club. After three low-scoring quarters Margie Gwozdzinsky, Ira Herman, Pietro Campanile, Brian Glubok, Allen Kahn and Jeffrey Rothstein led by 21 international match points.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Reisinger Knockout Teams in New York City', 'kicker': 'Bridge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-