s.com/2012/06/03/red-flags-were-raised-on-client-cash-mf-global-inquiry-is-told/', 'snippet': 'Two former MF Global employees have told federal investigators they raised red flags about the firm’s use of customer money in the final week before the bankruptcy filing, according to people briefed on the matter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Federal investigators are conducting a final round of interviews with former MF Global employees, as they weigh whether to file criminal charges against some senior executives and grant another one immunity from prosecution.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Red Flags Were Raised on Client Cash, MF Global Inquiry Is Told', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': "O'Brien, Edith", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MF Global', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T01:17:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Protess and Azam Ahmed', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Protess', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Azam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ahmed', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c0a5385-e114-595f-ad15-7a1775b97bbe', 'word_count': 983, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c0a5385-e114-595f-ad15-7a1775b97bbe'}, {'abstract': 'The military’s exclusion of women in combat doesn’t acknowledge the changing reality of warfare and unfairly denies them opportunities for advancement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/opinion/women-in-combat.html', 'snippet': 'The military’s exclusion of women in combat doesn’t acknowledge the changing reality of warfare and unfairly denies them opportunities for advancement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than 130 American women in military service have died in the Iraq and Afghanistan wars. More than 800 women have been wounded. Women make up almost 15 percent of the 1.4 million Americans on active military status and many are regularly engaged in combat activities as part of their service. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Women in Combat', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Women in Combat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Defense Department', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T01:21:14+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb2b7720-c0c2-5b3c-aa4b-f49baaa2d653', 'word_count': 389, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb2b7720-c0c2-5b3c-aa4b-f49baaa2d653'}, {'abstract': 'Tiger Woods finished at nine-under 279 to win the Memorial Tournament for his 73rd PGA Tour victory, tying him with Jack Nicklaus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/sports/golf/tiger-woods-wins-the-memorial-and-ties-jack-nicklaus-for-wins.html', 'snippet': 'Tiger Woods finished at nine-under 279 to win the Memorial Tournament for his 73rd PGA Tour victory, tying him with Jack Nicklaus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DUBLIN, Ohio — There are “safe house” signs scattered around Muirfield Village Golf Club, residences of refuge for the golfers during weather delays. The course built by Jack Nicklaus, the Memorial Tournament host, has long been a shelter for Tiger Woods. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/GOLFA1/GOLFA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/GOLFA1/GOLFA1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/GOLFA1/GOLFA1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 728, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/GOLFA1/GOLFA1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1456, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/GOLFA1/GOLFA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/GOLFA1/GOLFA1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/GOLFA1/GOLFA1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Woods, at His Best, Matches One of the Greats', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Woods, at His Best, Matches One of the Greats', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'na