d education to children as young as 11.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Are Single-Sex Groups Better for Preventing Dating Violence?', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domestic Violence', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sex Crimes', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T02:40:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jan Hoffman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hoffman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5a7e9ff7-7402-5e1c-8074-ef7ad96d1bd4', 'word_count': 792, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5a7e9ff7-7402-5e1c-8074-ef7ad96d1bd4'}, {'abstract': 'A diverse group is trying to forestall dating violence by addressing middle schoolers to educate them about relationships before they start dating in earnest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/us/middle-school-students-focus-of-anti-violence-effort.html', 'snippet': 'A diverse group is trying to forestall dating violence by addressing middle schoolers to educate them about relationships before they start dating in earnest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BOISE, Idaho — After studies emerged more than a decade ago showing that the highest rates of physical and sexual assault happen to women ages 16 to 24, programs to prevent abusive relationships have concentrated on high school and college students.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/us/TENNAGERS-2/TENNAGERS-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 674, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/us/TENNAGERS-2/TENNAGERS-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1349, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/us/TENNAGERS-2/TENNAGERS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/04/us/TENNAGERS-2/TENNAGERS-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/us/TENNAGERS-2/TENNAGERS-2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Warning to Teenagers Before They Start Dating', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Warning To Teenagers Before They Start Dating', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dating and Courtship', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Centers for Disease Control and Prevention', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Johnson, Robert Wood, Foundation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teenagers and Adolescence', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Domestic Violence', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-