'abstract': 'Germany has opposed the idea, cautiously endorsed by French and European officials, of pumping money directly from a bailout fund into troubled banks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/business/global/stocks-in-asia-fall-amid-worries-about-global-economy.html', 'snippet': 'Germany has opposed the idea, cautiously endorsed by French and European officials, of pumping money directly from a bailout fund into troubled banks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — European Union and French officials squared off against Germany on Monday over how best to help Spain’s ailing banks, drawing lines in the debate over the latest challenge to the euro zone.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Germany Resists Proposals to Aid Spain’s Banks', 'kicker': 'Euro Watch', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Latest Euro Zone Flash Point Is Direct Injection of Bailout Aid Into Banks', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Portugal', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barroso, Jose Manuel Durao', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Germany', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T03:45:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly and James Kanter