s.com/2012/06/04/hello-heterogeneity/', 'snippet': 'Will the rapidly developing political, religious and demographic changes in the United States transform the two-party system?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Between 1948, when American National Election Studies first surveyed the electorate, and 1970, the percentage of voters who were white didn’t change much, ranging from 89 to 91 percent.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hello, Heterogeneity', 'kicker': 'Campaign Stops', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T04:05:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas B. Edsall', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1384dac8-f7b3-50c6-887e-dcd380a88906', 'word_count': 795, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1384dac8-f7b3-50c6-887e-dcd380a88906'}, {'abstract': 'Results of a clinical trial, disclosed at a medical meeting in Chicago, showed that patients given trametinib lived longer than those receiving chemotherapy for advanced stages of the cancer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/health/glaxosmithkline-melanoma-drug-prolongs-patients-lives.html', 'snippet': 'Results of a clinical trial, disclosed at a medical meeting in Chicago, showed that patients given trametinib lived longer than those receiving chemotherapy for advanced stages of the cancer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — A new type of drug prolonged the lives of patients with advanced melanoma in a clinical trial, potentially adding to a growing number of therapies for a disease that was once nearly untreatable. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Drug for Advanced Melanoma Is Found to Prolong Patients’ Lives', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Drug for Advanced Melanoma Is Found to Prolong Patients’ Lives', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'GlaxoSmithKline PLC', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Melanomas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Clinical Trials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Skin Cancer', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T04:11:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c9ac4419-3e08-5ad8-b4f5-b34333106516', 'word_count': 736, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9ac4419-3e08-5ad8-b4f5-b34333106516'}, {'abstract': 'Despite an overtime loss, the Devils outshot the Kings and exhibited why they may be the most successful, best-run sports franchise in the New York area.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/sports/hockey/trailing-in-the-stanley-cup-devils-remain-ahead-of-the-game.html', 'snippet': 'Despite an overtime loss, the Devils outshot the Kings and exhibited why they may be the most successful, best-run sports franchise in the New York area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The last time the Devils won the Stanley Cup, in 2003, they held the victory parade not on Broadway but in the Meadowlands parking lot. This greatly amused some of my superior New York friends. Why not the Pulaski Skyway? one of them suggested. But at least we had a parade. How long has it been since a New York hockey team enjoyed one? ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/subYMCGRATH1/subYMCGRATH1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/subYMCGRATH1/subYMCGRATH1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/subYMCGRATH1/subYMCGRATH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/subYMCGRATH1/subYMCGRATH1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/subYMCGRATH1/subYMCGRATH1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trailing in the Finals, but Remaining Ahead of the Game', 'kicker': 'On Hockey', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Trailing in the Finals, But Remaining Ahead of the Game', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Kings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Devils', 'ra