 'nyt://article/28e6b125-9c18-57bb-be1f-0008201e5e64'}, {'abstract': 'The TV show host is the most celebrated person known to become a new partner in the baseball team with the Wilpon family, who raised $240 million from selling pieces of the team.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/sports/baseball/bill-maher-now-owns-share-of-the-mets.html', 'snippet': 'The TV show host is the most celebrated person known to become a new partner in the baseball team with the Wilpon family, who raised $240 million from selling pieces of the team.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If the comedian Bill Maher had devised any of his trademark new rules to owning a baseball team, he did not reveal any on Sunday at Citi Field when he acknowledged that he had acquired a minority share of the Mets months ago.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Bill Maher Now Owns Share of the Mets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Maher Owns Share of Mets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Maher, Bill', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T04:44:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Berman and Richard Sandomir', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Richard', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sandomir', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9be4bf1d-0108-56df-9740-26a295f47f85', 'word_count': 404, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9be4bf1d-0108-56df-9740-26a295f47f85'}, {'abstract': 'A trove of documents compiled by the father of Derek Boogaard offer a rare prescription-by-prescription history of the care given to a prominent, physically ailing athlete who struggled with addiction.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/sports/hockey/in-hockey-enforcers-descent-a-flood-of-prescription-drugs.html', 'snippet': 'A trove of documents compiled by the father of Derek Boogaard offer a rare prescription-by-prescription history of the care given to a prominent, physically ailing athlete who struggled with addiction.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his final three seasons playing in the National Hockey League, before dying last year at 28 of an accidental overdose of narcotic painkillers and alcohol, Derek Boogaard received more than 100 prescriptions for thousands of pills from more than a dozen team doctors for the Minnesota Wild and the Rangers. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/sub-boogaard-jp4/sub-boogaard-jp4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 365, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/sub-boogaard-jp4/sub-boogaard-jp4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 365}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/sub-boogaard-jp4/sub-boogaard-jp4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 668, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/04/sports/sub-boogaard-jp4/sub-boogaard-jp4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1335, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',