 runs through July 15. It’s a one-room show that features a cross-shaped arrangement of vitrines — their bases painted red to match the color of the room’s carpeting — which display some of the Vignellis’ product designs from the 1950s to the present and which amply illustrate the couple’s devotion to the idea that designers should produce things of lasting value. “We despise the culture of obsolescence, the culture of waste, the cult of the ephemeral,” they wrote in their book “The Vignelli Canon,” which you can download from the firm’s Web site.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Timeless by Design', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T14:30:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pilar Viladas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pilar', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Viladas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95b67b03-e1db-5cb6-a1b9-013b24be8d31', 'word_count': 410, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95b67b03-e1db-5cb6-a1b9-013b24be8d31'}, {'abstract': 'The pickup, a perennial best seller, receives a new grille treatment and a refreshed interior for the 2013 model year.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/2013-ford-f-series-a-facelift-for-americas-sweetheart/', 'snippet': 'The pickup, a perennial best seller, receives a new grille treatment and a refreshed interior for the 2013 model year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Ford pickup range is America’s perennial sales leader, so even a minor update warrants a visit to the heart of truck country.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '2013 Ford F-Series: a Facelift for America’s Sweetheart', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': Non