ollege-value-conversation-now/', 'snippet': 'Too many families wait too long before deciding how to figure out whether a university that charges $60,000 annually will be better than one charging $30,000.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Carl Richards is a certified financial planner in Park City, Utah, and is the director of investor education at BAM Advisor Services. His book, “The Behavior Gap,” was published earlier this year. His sketches are archived here on the Bucks blog. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Start Your College Value Conversation Now', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The College Value Conversation', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T15:05:26+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carl Richards', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carl', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Richards', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3926344-1e5d-57e9-987b-b1569be34679', 'word_count': 899, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3926344-1e5d-57e9-987b-b1569be34679'}, {'abstract': 'The new Pompidou Center in the northeastern French city of Metz is offering a rare opportunity to view Pablo Picasso’s largest known painting, a stage curtain measuring over 34 feet by 54 feet, which he created for the avant-garde ballet “Parade” in 1917.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/picassos-largest-painting-goes-on-view-in-france/', 'snippet': 'The new Pompidou Center in the northeastern French city of Metz is offering a rare opportunity to view Pablo Picasso’s largest known painting, a stage curtain measuring over 34 feet by 54 feet, which he created for the avant-garde ballet “Parade” ...', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new Pompidou Center in the northeastern French city of Metz is offering a rare opportunity to view Pablo Picasso’s largest known painting, a stage curtain measuring over 34 feet by 54 feet, which he created for the avant-garde ballet “Parade” in 1917. It is the centerpiece of “1917,” a new exhibition that explores art produced during that year.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Picasso’s Largest Painting Goes on View in France', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Picasso, Pablo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ballets Russes', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pompidou Center', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'France', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T15:08:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daphné Anglès', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daphné', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Anglès', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4404d509-47fe-5fae-ab52-078f03999dc6', 'word_count': 512, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4404d509-47fe-5fae-ab52-078f03999dc6'}, {'abstract': 'The couple were married by the bridegroom’s father.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/03/fashion/weddings/dorothy-nederman-will-hildebrandt-weddings.html', 'snippet': 'The couple were married by the bridegroom’s father.', 'lead_paragraph'