e in dissatisfaction with Wal-Mart Stores compared to last year, according to the company’s vote tally.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/business/wal-mart-vote-reflects-rise-in-shareholder-unhappiness.html', 'snippet': 'Shareholders voting at last week’s annual meeting registered a spike in dissatisfaction with Wal-Mart Stores compared to last year, according to the company’s vote tally.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Investors last week expressed dissatisfaction with members of the board of Wal-Mart Stores at some of the highest levels ever disclosed by the company in electronic filings, according to a Monday filing by the company.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Wal-Mart Vote Shows Rise in Shareholder Unrest', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wal-Mart Vote Shows Rise in Shareholder Unrest', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boards of Directors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Wal-Mart Stores Inc', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T15:50:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Clifford', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clifford', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e24dd4c8-e014-5ab4-9340-fbf58bfac786', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e24dd4c8-e014-5ab4-9340-fbf58bfac786'}, {'abstract': 'The one-time Republican presidential candidate will be offered to stations in place of “The Neal Boortz Show,” which will end at the same time.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/herman-cain-to-host-a-national-radio-show/', 'snippet': 'The one-time Republican presidential candidate will be offered to stations in place of “The Neal Boortz Show,” which will end at the same time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Herman Cain, the one-time Republican presidential candidate, will begin hosting a nationally syndicated radio talk show in January, his syndication company said Monday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Herman Cain to Host a National Radio Show', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Radio', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boortz, Neal', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cain, Herman', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T15:53:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f358240-11a7-560c-a7d4-c043cd8f03ac', 'word_count': 404, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f358240-11a7-560c-a7d4-c043cd8f03ac'}, {'abstract': 'The action widened a recall undertaken in December last year, in which 239 units of the plug-in hybrid sedan were recalled.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/fisker-recalls-19-additional-karma-sedans-for-fire-hazard/', 'snippet': 'The action widened a recall undertaken in December last year, in which 239 units of the plug-in hybrid sedan were recalled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fisker Automotive is recalling another 19 of its Karma luxury plug-in hybrid sedan because of a fire hazard, according to a report posted over the weekend on the Web site of the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration. The action widened a recall undertaken in December, which affected 239 vehicles