orted a decline in factory orders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/business/daily-stock-market-activity.html', 'snippet': 'Wall Street closed flat Monday, the first session after Friday’s sell-off, as Washington reported a decline in factory orders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Stocks reversed losses and closed nearly unchanged on Monday as analysts saw value in issues in the Standard & Poor’s 500-stock index, which on average were at their lowest level relative to their earnings in six months.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'After a Slip, Markets End Near Where They Started', 'kicker': 'Stocks & Bonds', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After a Slip, Markets End Near Where They Started', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T16:56:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bloomberg News', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bloomberg', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'News', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/41568a81-3e9b-5488-a416-31c7debe64f5', 'word_count': 596, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41568a81-3e9b-5488-a416-31c7debe64f5'}, {'abstract': 'Want to avoid applying known carcinogens to your skin and hair? A new line of body care products from Canada, called Attitude, aims to take the guesswork out of shopping for cosmetics.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/can-a-beauty-product-be-carcinogen-free/', 'snippet': 'Want to avoid applying known carcinogens to your skin 