ched in the major leagues since May 2011. His start for the Mets on Tuesday in Washington will mark the completion of a lengthy recovery from career-threatening surgery, a process with which the team is all too familiar.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets’ Young to Bring Rehab Full-Circle in First Start', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Young, Chris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T17:56:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39a585c0-4e40-58fc-8566-02b33b53a694', 'word_count': 210, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39a585c0-4e40-58fc-8566-02b33b53a694'}, {'abstract': 'The company announced a number of new partnerships and games on Monday, a day before the annual Electronic Entertainment Expo formally opens.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/microsoft-to-expand-offerings-on-xbox-live/', 'snippet': 'The company announced a number of new partnerships and games on Monday, a day before the annual Electronic Entertainment Expo formally opens.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES – On the eve of the annual E3 video game convention here, Microsoft announced on Monday that it intended to double the amount and scope of media content offered over the next year through the company’s Xbox Live online service. While games were the initial focus of Xbox Live, the recent addition of video from partners including Major League Baseball, Netflix and HBO has helped reposition the service and Microsoft’s Xbox 360 console as a hub for entertainment beyond video games.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Microsoft to Expand Offerings on Xbox Live', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Xbox 360 (Video Game System)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T18:00:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Seth Schiesel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schiesel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8204461f-b7e3-5c02-b411-6e573829133f', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8204461f-b7e3-5c02-b411-6e573829133f'}, {'abstract': 'Li Na, the defending women’s singles champion, lost to the doubles specialist Yaroslava Shvedova of Kazakhstan, and Maria Sharapova was pushed to three sets before advancing to the quarterfinals at the French Open.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/sports/tennis/2012-french-open-li-na-loses-and-sharapova-struggles-as-surprises-continue.html', 'snippet': 'Li Na, the defending women’s singles champion, lost to the doubles specialist Yaroslava Shvedova of Kazakhstan, and Maria Sharapova was pushed to three sets before advancing to the quarterfinals at the French Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Behind the microphone, Li Na sighed. She had no answers, only questions, like the reporters who packed around her, who wondered about the weather and whether she had prepared properly for this French Open.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05tennis/05tennis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 865, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05tennis/05tennis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1731, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05tennis/05tennis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05tennis/05tennis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05tennis/05tennis-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'More Jolts as Li Loses and Sharapova Labors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'More Jolts as Li Loses And Sharapova Labors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sharapova, Maria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Li Na', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shvedova, Yaroslava', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T18:00:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection