of prescription drugs that are generics versus brand-name, leading to wasteful taxpayer spending somewhere.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/cheap-vs-expensive-drugs/', 'snippet': 'Across the country, there is huge variation in the share of prescription drugs that are generics versus brand-name, leading to wasteful taxpayer spending somewhere.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There are many, many reasons why health care spending has become such a huge national burden, including overtesting, the aging and weight gain of the populace, poor communication among health care professionals and deficient information about what treatments are most effective.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cheap vs. Expensive Drugs', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Generic Brands and Products', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicare', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New England Journal of Medicine', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T19:40:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Catherine Rampell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Catherine', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rampell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/854208c0-adbe-52ab-a16b-0972dc8b24bd', 'word_count': 658, 'uri': 'nyt://article/854208c0-adbe-52ab-a16b-0972dc8b24bd'}, {'abstract': 'The Museum of Modern Art has appointed Quentin Bajac, chief curator of photography at the Pompidou Center in Paris, to be its next chief curator of photography, it announced today.', 'web_url': 'https:/