ncy programs and an economic decline.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/emissions-fell-under-cap-and-trade-program-report-says/', 'snippet': 'The decline in the nine participating Northeastern and mid-Atlantic states can be attributed not just to the carbon market, but to the cheap price of natural gas, improved energy efficiency programs and an economic decline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The cap and trade system known as the Regional Greenhouse Gas Initiative announced on Monday that carbon dioxide emissions from power plants in the nine participating states on the East Coast fell by an average of 23 percent during the first three years of the program.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Emissions Fell Under Cap and Trade Program, Report Says', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Air Pollution', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Carbon Dioxide', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coal', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric Light and Power', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Natural Gas', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Regional Greenhouse Gas Initiative', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T22:04:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mireya Navarro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mireya', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Navarro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/52e056bd-28c0-51a3-8626-779da5