ia diet, his plans for the magazine, his favorite article of all time and more.', 'web_url': 'https://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/hugo-lindgren-answers-anything/', 'snippet': 'In his Q. and A. on Reddit, the editor of The Times Magazine told readers about his media diet, his plans for the magazine, his favorite article of all time and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Last Friday, Hugo Lindgren, editor of The Times Magazine, participated in the second-ever official New York Times chat to be hosted on Reddit. After the success of Paul Krugman’s “IAmA,” the first such chat, Lindgren invited Redditors to ask him about anything — even his office full of bunnies. (These chats are sometimes referred to as an AMA, shorthand for the invitation to “Ask Me Anything.”)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hugo Lindgren Answers ‘Anything’', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lindgren, Hugo', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T22:38:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Staff', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Staff'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4d0c272c-15cc-5dc8-8f38-846eab282dce', 'word_count': 770, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4d0c272c-15cc-5dc8-8f38-846eab282dce'}, {'abstract': 'Now in its third year, prize aims to recognize women working in the theater.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/04/lilly-awards-given-to-arianda-paulus-hall-and-more/', 'snippet': 'Now in its third year, prize aims to recognize women working in the theater.', 'lead_paragraph': ' An organization that honors women working in the theater will present the third annual Lilly Awards on Monday evening to nine recipients, including the 2012 Tony-nominated actresses Cristin Milioti (“Once”) and Nina Arianda (“Venus in Fur”) and director Diane Paulus (“The Gershwins’ Porgy and Bess”). ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Lilly’ Awards Given to Arianda, Paulus, Hall  and More', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Honors for Milioti And Arianda', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Arianda, Nina', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hall, Katori', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hellman, Lillian', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Howe, Tina', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Milioti, Cristin', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parsons, Estelle', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Paulus, Diane', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Playwrights Horizons', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-04T22:38:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1be50cd2-e802-5e5e-8480-69aed0e96166', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1be50cd2-e802-5e5e-8480-69aed0e96166'}, {'abstract': 'The major domestic airlines are considering charging a $25 fee at the gate for carry-on bags that exceed size limits for an overhead bin.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/business/airlines-weighing-fee-for-oversized-carry-ons-on-the-road.html', 'snippet': 'The major domestic airlines are considering charging a $25 fee at the gate for carry-on bags that exceed size limits for an overhead bin.', 'lead_parag