7806-92bf-5277-b249-eef8b0be6830'}, {'abstract': 'Games 1 and 2 of the Stanley Cup finals drew good TV ratings in New York and Los Angeles, but if the Devils can’t mount a comeback, these finals may be the least watched in the past five years.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/sports/hockey/ratings-dont-match-intensity-of-stanley-cup-finals.html', 'snippet': 'Games 1 and 2 of the Stanley Cup finals drew good TV ratings in New York and Los Angeles, but if the Devils can’t mount a comeback, these finals may be the least watched in the past five years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The four previous Stanley Cup finals were compelling on the ice, all involving cities with deep hockey traditions and all providing the N.H.L. with a boost in television ratings. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ratings Don’t Match Intensity of Cup Finals', 'kicker': 'Stanley Cup Playoffs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ratings Are Not Matching Intensity of Cup Finals', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stanley Cup', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Devils', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Kings', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hockey, Ice', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T02:06:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Hockey', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jeff Z. Klein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jeff', 'middlename': 'Z.', 'lastname': 'Klein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e3bee0c6-aee4-5eee-adf4-882ae43233e0', 'word_count': 676, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e3bee0c6-aee4-5eee-adf4-882ae43233e0'}, {'abstract': 'The Wisconsin vote will be revealing for what it says about the public’s willingness to reverse course on our built-up tolerance of debt.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/opinion/brooks-the-debt-indulgence.html', 'snippet': 'The Wisconsin vote will be revealing for what it says about the public’s willingness to reverse course on our built-up tolerance of debt.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Every generation has an incentive to borrow money from the future to spend on itself. But, until ours, no generation of Americans has done it to the same extent. Why?', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-articleLarge-v2.png', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-articleLarge-v2.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 512, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 1000, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/04/03/opinion/david-brooks/david-brooks-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight'