 to complete a four-game sweep of the Cardinals and despite suspect statistics, the club is only a half-game out of first place in the N.L. East.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/sports/baseball/despite-loss-mets-remain-in-hunt-for-first-in-the-nl-east.html', 'snippet': 'The Mets lost a chance Monday to complete a four-game sweep of the Cardinals and despite suspect statistics, the club is only a half-game out of first place in the N.L. East.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Expectations frame every season, and the most captivating teams often seem to spring from nowhere. Suddenly, every game is relevant again, the unlikely pennant race a reward to fans for years of pain. After a certain point, the journey of the overachiever is bound to be successful, however it ends.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/JPKEPNER/JPKEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/JPKEPNER/JPKEPNER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/JPKEPNER/JPKEPNER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 880, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/JPKEPNER/JPKEPNER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1761, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/JPKEPNER/JPKEPNER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/05/