cond half and Russell Westbrook added 23 as the youth and athleticism of the Thunder overwhelmed the Spurs on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN ANTONIO — They finished the regular season with the best record in the N.B.A. They won 20 straight games, including the first 10 of the playoffs. They dazzled opponents with selflessness and precision. Just days ago, with a 2-0 lead in the Western Conference finals, a return to the N.B.A. finals appeared on the horizon for Tim Duncan and the Spurs.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05west-thunder/05west-thunder-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05west-thunder/05west-thunder-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05west-thunder/05west-thunder-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 802, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05west-thunder/05west-thunder-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1604, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05west-thunder/05west-thunder-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/05west-thunder/05west-thunder-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/sports/