es, the current Republican leadership seems much more concerned with taxing poor and low-income people, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bruce Bartlett held senior policy roles in the Reagan and George H.W. Bush administrations and served on the staffs of Representatives Jack Kemp and Ron Paul. He is the author of “The Benefit and the Burden: Tax Reform — Why We Need It and What It Will Take.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rich Nontaxpayers', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Tax', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cantor, Eric', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T10:00:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bruce Bartlett', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bruce', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bartlett', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/55bd9e4f-ac7f-5fde-bf0e-6eebb24d5460', 'word_count': 902, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55bd9e4f-ac7f-5fde-bf0e-6eebb24d5460'}, {'abstract': 'Rights restrictions can prevent international viewers from watching some BBC shows online.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/qa-bbc-video-across-the-pond/', 'snippet': 'Rights restrictions can prevent international viewers from watching some BBC shows online.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q&A: BBC Video Across the Pond', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub':