ok he wrote about Affirmed, the last Triple Crown winner.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In all my enduring years as a sportswriter and presently a full-time author, I’ve never come across a more compelling subject than the book I wrote about Affirmed, the last Triple Crown winner. Symbolically, it was my 25th tome. With the approaching Belmont on June 9 there is a prodigious feeling among the railbirds that the 34-year-old drought will be ended by a horse with the melodious moniker of “I’ll Have Another.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Rail Bookshelf: ‘Affirmed’', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Triple Crown (Horse Racing)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sahadi, Lou', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T11:54:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lou Sahadi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lou', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sahadi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/32808a4d-7939-5e71-b053-162ddbed3166', 'word_count': 852, 'uri': 'nyt://article/32808a4d-7939-5e71-b053-162ddbed3166'}, {'abstract': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'web_url': 'https://takingnote.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/opinion-report-marijuana-in-public-view/', 'snippet': 'A summary of what’s on today’s editorial page.', 'lead_paragraph': 'From the editorial page', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Opinion Report: Marijuana in Public View', 'kicker': 'Taking Note', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'val