ma, despite its image as an unwelcoming place for environmental initiatives,sets a goal of consuming no more water in 2060 than it does in 2012.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For someone who writes frequently about California’s pioneering environmental policies, it was impossible not to do a double take at the news from Oklahoma. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Oklahoma Sets Water Conservation Goal', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Fallin, Mary', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oklahoma', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T12:18:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Felicity Barringer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Felicity', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barringer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/995602ca-e249-566c-98af-1773a9ff83ac', 'word_count': 806, 'uri': 'nyt://article/995602ca-e249-566c-98af-1773a9ff83ac'}, {'abstract': 'Me me me.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/two-self-promotional-videos/', 'snippet': 'Me me me.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An embedded version of Newsnight:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Two Self-Promotional Videos', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T12:19:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title':