e, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/06/science/06recipehealth/06recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/06/science/06recipehealth/06recipehealth-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/06/science/06recipehealth/06recipehealth-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Carrot and Papaya Smoothie With Hazelnuts and Pistachios', 'kicker': 'Recipes for Health', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Recipes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T17:57:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'subsection_name': 'Fitness & Nutrition', 'byline': {'original': 'By Martha Rose Shulman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Martha', 'middlename': 'Rose', 'lastname': 'Shulman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'recipe', '_id': 'nyt://article/6c9baa9f-e89b-5479-90c6-de0c10d73a04', 'word_count': 210, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6c9baa9f-e89b-5479-90c6-de0c10d73a04'}, {'abstract': 'The new Marc Jacobs resort collection is playfully evocative of classic clown accoutrements.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/just-one-look-marc-jacobs/', 'snippet': 'The new Marc Jacobs resort collection is playfully evocative of classic clown accoutrements.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The fun-house silhouettes, prints and fabrics in Marc Jacobs’s resort collection came inspired by Cindy Sherman’s clown series: tinsel tweeds, sequin stripes, primary colors and polka dots covered many of the curious puppet-doll dresses and suits. The shoes — clunky sandals with big candy ball stones and awkward, cartoon-character loafers — looked a little too big on the models. Make no mistake, though. Jacobs wasn’t just clowning around. He knows his customers and knows that their eyes will have adjusted to ballooning skirts and funny fitting jackets (see fall) by the time resort hits stores. Jacobs also knows very well how to design commercial successes and sprinkle them between his experiments. These calf-length shifts, their fronts covered with glossy sequin florals and topped with jesters’ bows at the neck, like so, will wow and wear effortlessly.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Marc Jacobs', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T18:00:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Herman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Herman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/356a64cb-ac75-596f-9b0e-962ad6c167b2', 'word_count': 139, 'uri': 'nyt://article/356a64cb-ac75-596f-9b0e-962ad6c167b2'}, {'abstract': 'The supercar, available as a gullwing coupe or soft-top roadster, was renamed the SLS AMG GT.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/mercedes-benz-adds-power-and-a-pair-of-letters-to-sls-amg-for-2013/', 'snippet': 'The supercar, available as a gullwing coupe or soft-top roadster, was renamed the SLS AMG GT.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though they are not typically shopped against German track-day specials, the 2012 Chevrolet Camaro ZL1 and 2013 Ford Shelby GT500 are plumbing supercar depths of horsepower and performance, arguably diminishing a car like Mercedes-Benz SLS AMG, which landed like a Teutonic hammer in 2010.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mercedes-Benz Adds Power and a Pair of Letters to SLS AMG for 2013', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes-Benz', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T18:03:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Schultz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schultz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/793c4770-c41d-5d1f-81e7-62545b6d242d', 'word_count': 237, 'uri': 'nyt://article/793c4770-c41d-5d1f-81e7-62545b6d242d'}, {'abstract': 'Wisconsin voters go to the polls Tuesday in the recall election of Gov. Scott Walker, only the third such contest in the nation’s history.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/timescast-politics-wisconsin-recall/', 'snippet': 'Wisconsin voters go to the polls Tuesday in the recall election of Gov. Scott Walker, only the third such contest in the nation’s history.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Wisconsin voters go to the polls Tuesday in the recall election of Gov. Scott Walker, only the third such contest in the nation’s history.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'TimesCast Politics: Wisconsin Recall', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics 