ive the ban on large sweetened drinks, although they might be a bit parched this summer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/06/dining/debating-the-proposed-new-york-city-regulation-on-drink-size.html', 'snippet': 'Many people in New York City said they would survive the ban on large sweetened drinks, although they might be a bit parched this summer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AT a sunny street fair Sunday on the Lower East Side, students from the Ivy Smart Learning Center worked a tiny lemonade stand, jostling to be the one to add the lemon slices and pour the sugar. For the first time, New York City children were participating in Lemonade Day, a nationwide event sponsored by a Houston-based nonprofit group to encourage entrepreneurship among American children.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/06/dining/06DRINKS1_SPAN/06DRINKS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/06/dining/06DRINKS1_SPAN/06DRINKS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/06/dining/06DRINKS1_SPAN/06DRINKS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/06/dining/06DRINKS1_SPAN/06DRINKS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/06/dining/06DRINKS1_SPAN/06DRINKS1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'l