/dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/mf-global-and-the-risks-looming-in-the-repo-market/', 'snippet': 'MF Global’s crippling bets were only possible because the brokerage firm was able to borrow voraciously in a debt market that also played a big role in the collapses of Lehman Brothers and Bear Stearns.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MF Global employees are the ones responsible for the risky trades that propelled the company toward its demise. But those crippling bets were only possible because MF Global was able to borrow voraciously in a debt market that also played a big role in the collapses of Lehman Brothers and Bear Stearns.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'MF Global and the Risks Looming in the Repo Market', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bankruptcies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bear Stearns Cos', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MF Global', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T20:15:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Eavis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eavis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73671713-aa51-5d68-8b12-db5b078382d6', 'word_count': 751, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73671713-aa51-5d68-8b12-db5b078382d6'}, {'abstract': 'The National Transportation Safety Board released this video along with its findings on the 2011 crash.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/nyregion/100000001588222/ntsa-animation-of-bronx-bus-crash.html', 'snippet': 'The National Transportation Safety Board released this video along with its findings on the 2011 crash.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The National Transportation Safety Board released this video along with its findings on the 2011 crash.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/nyregion/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/05/nyregion/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/05/nyregion/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/05/nyregion/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash/video-ntsb-animation-bus-crash-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Animated Simulation of Bronx Bus Crash', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bronx (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Transportation Safety Board', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-05T20:16:55+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'National Transportation Safety', 'person': [{'firstname': 'National', 'middlename': 'Transportation', 'lastname': 'Safety', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organi