ld and batted in the cleanup spot on Tuesday night.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hideki Matsui was unemployed on opening day and seemingly undesired throughout baseball, but on Tuesday the former Yankees stalwart started in right field and batted in the cleanup spot when the Tampa Bay Rays opened a three-game series against the Yankees in the Bronx.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Matsui Back at Yankee Stadium, This Time as a Ray', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Matsui, Hideki', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Rays', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-06T00:25:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Berman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2d8f218d-90b3-53ed-94f2-ccf9aebfc533', 'word_count': 899, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2d8f218d-90b3-53ed-94f2-ccf9aebfc533'}, {'abstract': 'There was some shuffling amid the Mets pitching ranks on Tuesday, when Jon Rauch was found to have “debris” in his elbow.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/05/mets-relief-corps-is-short-handed/', 'snippet': 'There was some shuffling amid the Mets pitching ranks on Tuesday, when Jon Rauch was found to have “debris” in his elbow.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — There was some shuffling amid the Mets pitching ranks on Tuesday, including one development that will leave the team shorthanded for its three-game series here this week.', 'so