ere may be some glimmer of hope in Mr. Netanyahu’s decision to support an Israeli Supreme Court order to close an illegal neighborhood, known as Ulpana, in the West Bank settlement of Beit El. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Glimmer?', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Glimmer?', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Israeli Settlements', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Likud Party (Israel)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-06T02:15:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/41baa1a8-047a-568e-b4d8-6fa8354cde76', 'word_count': 401, 'uri': 'nyt://article/41baa1a8-047a-568e-b4d8-6fa8354cde76'}, {'abstract': 'When minors commit violent crimes, should they be treated differently from adults? Is prison effective as a punishment or a deterrent for juveniles?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2012/06/05/when-to-punish-a-young-offender-and-when-to-rehabilitate/', 'snippet': 'When minors commit violent crimes, should they be treated differently from adults? Is prison effective as a punishment or a deterrent for juveniles?', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'When to Punish, and When to Rehabilitate', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'n