 911 if necessary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a recent column, I reviewed apps that help parents keep track of their children — younger children in particular.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'AppSmart Extra: Someone to Watch Over Me', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An App Offers Someone to Watch Over You', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Emergency Telephone Numbers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nine-One-One (911) (Emergency Phone Number)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'People Guard LLC', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-06T14:32:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bob Tedeschi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bob', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Tedeschi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d5c81055-1f2b-5760-ad8c-0dce98c7a685', 'word_count': 242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d5c81055-1f2b-5760-ad8c-0dce98c7a685'}, {'abstract': 'Citigroup analysts give the stock a buy rating based on valuation and the belief that the worst could be over for the giant hedge fund manager.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/06/06/battered-man-group-shares-take-a-bounce/', 'snippet': 'Citigroup analysts give the stock a buy rating based on valuation and the belief that the worst could be over for the giant hedge fund manager.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Shares of the Man Group, the world’s largest publicly traded hedge fund company, surged in London trading on Wedn