 and losing against Novak Djokovic at the French Open was a matter of moments.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/06/breaking-it-down-djokovic-vs-tsonga/', 'snippet': 'For Jo-Wilfried Tsonga, the difference between winning and losing against Novak Djokovic at the French Open was a matter of moments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jo-Wilfried Tsonga had finally arrived at one of the most important moments in his career – his first match point three hours and eleven minutes into his French Open quarter final battle with world number one Novak Djokovic in Paris on Tuesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Breaking It Down: Djokovic vs. Tsonga', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tsonga, Jo-Wilfried', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-06T20:30:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': "By Craig O'Shannessy", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Craig', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "O'Shannessy", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/24273849-7658-50b2-b707-3af29ffd0fe6', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/24273849-7658-50b2-b707-3af29ffd0fe6'}, {'abstract': 'Students at Stuyvesant High School in Lower Manhattan expressed their objection to new rules by breaking them, wearing tank tops and spaghetti-strap blouses and pants and skirts shorter than allowed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/07/nyregion/stuyvesant-high-school-students-protest-dress-code.html', 'snippet': 'Students at Stuyvesant High School in Lower Manhattan expressed their objection to new rules by breaking them, wearing tank tops and spaghetti-strap blouses and pants and skirts shorter than allowed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The first hint of the looming rebellion came from the lips of Hao Yang, 17, as he practiced ballroom dancing outside Stuyvesant High School on Wednesday morning, the first licks of sunlight casting a long shadow that made a perfect dance partner on the wall behind him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/nyregion/STUYVESANT1/STUYVESANT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/07/nyregion/STUYVESANT1/STUYVESANT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/nyregion/STUYVESANT1/STUYVESANT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/nyregion/STUYVESANT1/STUYVESANT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1341, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/nyregion/STUYVESANT1/STUYVESANT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/07/nyregion/STUYVESANT1/STUYVESANT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/nyregion/STUYVESANT