y Leon E. Panetta brushed aside concerns that America was violating Pakistan’s sovereignty and called on India to deepen its relationship with the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/06/news-roundup-panetta-defends-drone-strikes-in-pakistan-courts-india/', 'snippet': 'Defense Secretary Leon E. Panetta brushed aside concerns that America was violating Pakistan’s sovereignty and called on India to deepen its relationship with the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gardiner Harris reports in The New York Times’ India Ink blog that Leon E. Panetta, the United States defense secretary, does not think drone strikes, like the one on Monday that killed Abu Yahya al-Libi, the Qaeda deputy leader, violate Pakistan’s sovereignty. They instead protect both Pakistan and the United States, he said on Wednesday in New Delhi.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Roundup: Panetta Defends Drone Strikes in Pakistan; Courts India', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drones (Pilotless Planes)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Targeted Killings', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Libi, Abu Yahya al-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Panetta, Leon E', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pakistan', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-06T20:45:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_