 Wednesday, a breach highlighted just how vulnerable those Web servers were.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/06/that-was-fast-criminals-exploit-linkedin-breach-for-phishing-attacks/', 'snippet': 'On Tuesday, security researchers discovered that a LinkedIn mobile app was leaking sensitive calendar information back to LinkedIn’s Web servers. On Wednesday, a breach highlighted just how vulnerable those Web servers were.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After hackers posted millions of encoded LinkedIn passwords to a Russian hacker site on Wednesday, criminals used news of the breach to trick unsuspecting users into downloading malware that can be used to extract financial gain.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'That Was Fast: Criminals Exploit LinkedIn Breach For Phishing Attacks', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'LinkedIn Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-06T23:10:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicole Perlroth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicole', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Perlroth', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d0798116-777a-55cb-8ace-9a9a51ba7224', 'word_count': 275, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0798116-777a-55cb-8ace-9a9a51ba7224'}, {'abstract': 'Outfielder Jason Bay was back in the clubhouse but not in the lineup, while Pedro Beato was in the bullpen.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/06/bay-and-beato-return-in-latest-roster-shuffle/', 'snippet': 'Outfielder Jason Bay was back in the clubhouse but not in the lineup, while Pedro Beato was in the bullpen.', 'lead_paragra