m/2012/06/07/sports/golf/yani-tseng-takes-aim-at-the-lpga-championship.html', 'snippet': 'Yani Tseng, the world’s top-ranked female golfer, is looking to defend her title at the L.P.G.A. Championship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PITTSFORD, N.Y. — Yani Tseng, the top-ranked female golfer in the world and the defending champion at this week’s L.P.G.A. Championship, acknowledges that she is motivated by chasing L.P.G.A. records. She also says that the voice she still hears in her head is that of the Hall of Famer Annika Sorenstam.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tseng Follows Sorenstam as She Pursues Another Major', 'kicker': 'L.P.G.A. Championship', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tseng Follows Sorenstam as She Pursues Another Major', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tseng, Yani', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lewis, Stacy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kerr, Cristie', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T02:44:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa D. Mickey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/323f16a8-c367-5c55-b4ba-5d17280eedc9', 'word_count': 753, 'uri': 'nyt://article/323f16a8-c367-5c55-b4ba-5d17280eedc9'}, {'abstract': 'Over a 70-year career, Ray Bradbury used his fecund storytelling talents to fashion tales that have captivated legions of young people and inspired a host of imitators.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/07/books/ray-bradbury-who-made-science-fiction-respectable.html', 'snippet': 'Over a 70-year career, Ray Bradbury used his fecund storytelling talents to fashion tales that have captivated legions of young people and inspired a host of imitators.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Martians, robots, dinosaurs, mummies, ghosts, time machines, rocket ships, carnival magicians, alarming doppelgängers who forecast murder and doom — the sort of sensational subjects that fascinate children are the stuff of Ray Bradbury’s fiction. Over a 70-year career, he used his fecund storytelling talents to fashion tales that have captivated legions of young people and inspired a host of imitators. His work informed the imagination of writers and filmmakers like Stephen King, Steven Spielberg and James Cameron, and helped transport science fiction out of the pulp magazine ghetto and into the mainstream.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/arts/appraisal/appraisal-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 933, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/arts/appraisal/appraisal-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1784, 'width': 1625, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/arts/appraisal/appraisal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/07/arts/appraisal/appraisal-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/07/arts/appraisal/appraisal-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Up From 