, 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/magazine/a-drinkers-guide-to-dublin.html', 'snippet': 'Where to find the best beer, whiskey and conversation in Ireland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m often told that I should visit a city unknown to me, branch out a bit, widen my horizons and all that. Instead, I return to Dublin as often as possible. Its familiarity is a comfort, but the city holds enough surprises to remind me that there’s always some corner I haven’t explored, a pub I haven’t tried.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '46', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10drink/10drink-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10drink/10drink-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10drink/10drnik-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10drink/10drnik-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 998, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10drink/10drink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10drink/10drink-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10drink/10drink-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTy