, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Singh, Khushwant', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Kerala (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Delhi (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T12:23:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b846808c-7eb3-57c9-9403-6c3faa81ff11', 'word_count': 405, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b846808c-7eb3-57c9-9403-6c3faa81ff11'}, {'abstract': 'After hours of interrogation that started on Wednesday, the police apprehended Giovanni Vantaggiato, a 68-year-old fuel vendor from Copertino, about 30 miles north of Brindisi.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/world/europe/italian-police-detain-suspect-in-fatal-school-bombing.html', 'snippet': 'After hours of interrogation that started on Wednesday, the police apprehended Giovanni Vantaggiato, a 68-year-old fuel vendor from Copertino, about 30 miles north of Brindisi.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ROME — Investigators in the southern Puglia region said on Thursday that they had detained a suspect in a school bombing that killed one student and injured five at a Brindisi school three weeks ago.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Italian Police Detain Suspect in Fatal School Bombing', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Italy:Man Arrested in School Bombing', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brindisi (Italy)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bombs and Explosives', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T12:23:34+0000', 'document_type': 'artic