iness/08YUAN/08YUAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1586, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'China Cuts Lending Rate as Its Economic Growth Slows', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Grappling Globally With the Economy: Exports Weak And Economy Slowing, China Reduces Rates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T12:28:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By Keith Bradsher', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Keith', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bradsher', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a8a2fbf-d973-5cec-92ad-36dbfdb0b358', 'word_count': 1308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a8a2fbf-d973-5cec-92ad-36dbfdb0b358'}, {'abstract': 'In “Prometheus,” Ridley Scott returns to the visceral dread of “Alien” as a vessel lumbers through the galactic void.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/movies/prometheus-by-ridley-scott-with-noomi-rapace.html', 'snippet': 'In “Prometheus,” Ridley Scott returns to the visceral dread of “Alien” as a vessel lumbers through the galactic void.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you grew up in the 1970s, you may have a dim memory of “Chariots of the Gods,” an international best seller by Erich von Däniken full of dubious speculation about extraterrestrial influences on ancient earthling civilizations. The book, a kind of space age “Da Vinci Code,” inspired a goofy German 