ting and Writers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Isaacson, Walter', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jackman, Hugh', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jobs, Steven P', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwartz, Stephen', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sorkin, Aaron', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wozniak, Stephen', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Home Box Office', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T13:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/372da0e4-1336-5a46-9a49-31ea06035aa8', 'word_count': 1420, 'uri': 'nyt://article/372da0e4-1336-5a46-9a49-31ea06035aa8'}, {'abstract': 'Though American racing fans have been waiting for a Triple Crown since 1978, the English have them beat. No horse has won the English Triple Crown for colts since 1970.', 'web_url': 'https://therail.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/07/the-english-are-waiting-for-a-triple-crown-winner-too/', 'snippet': 'Though American racing fans have been waiting for a Triple Crown since 1978, the English have them beat. No horse has won the English Triple Crown for colts since 1970.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Though American racing fans have been waiting for a Triple Crown since 1978, the English have them beat. No horse has won the English Triple Crown for colts since 1970.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The English Are Waiting for a Triple Crown Winner, Too', 'kicker': 'The Rail', 'content_kicker'