e no mistake about the product, however: this may be the bigges...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oracle entered the cloud computing business in a big way on Wednesday and did so in its typical fashion — with an overpowering host of hardware and software, plus bluster, misdirection and trash talking. The technology, while more of a work in progress than Oracle wants to say, appears solid.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hurd Sells Oracle’s Cloud in the Oracle Style', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cloud Computing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Enterprise Computing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ellison, Lawrence J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hurd, Mark V', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oracle Corporation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'SAP A.G', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T18:25:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Quentin Hardy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Quentin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hardy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e527820b-fba0-5f5d-9e02-a18e6184c301', 'word_count': 525, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e527820b-fba0-5f5d-9e02-a18e6184c301'}, {'abstract': 'Lively Morgue Tumblr numbers 71 to 80', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/04/18/blogs/2012LivelyMorgueTumblr7.html', 'snippet': 'Lively Morgue Tumblr numbers 71 to 80', 'lead_paragraph': 'Lively Morgue Tumblr numbers 71 to 80', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/20