', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08BOOK1/08BOOK1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1299, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08BOOK1/08BOOK1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1615, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08BOOK1/08BOOK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08BOOK1/08BOOK1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08BOOK1/08BOOK1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 173, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Elizabeth Taylor Never Visited This Italian Cliff', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Elizabeth Taylor Never Visited This Italian Cliff', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walter, Jess', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T19:06:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Janet Maslin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Janet', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Maslin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/74c46770-8eaa-5344-b8ec-be9cbbc71c45', 'word_count': 964, 'uri': 'nyt://article/74c46770-8eaa-5344-b8ec-be9cbbc71c45'}, {'abstract': 'Although Maria Sharapova, unlike Sara Errani, is a global figure, the meeting on Saturday will be the first French Open final for both of them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/sports/tennis/08iht-tennis08.html', 'snippet': 'Although Maria Sharapova, unlike Sara Errani, is a global figure, the meeting on Saturday will be the first French Open final for both of them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Born 10 days apart and once boarders at the same Florida tennis factory, Maria Sharapova and Sara Errani will play each other for the first time as professionals in the French Open final on Saturday. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/sports/08iht-tennis08-1/08iht-tennis08-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 645, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/sports/08iht-tennis08-1/08iht-tennis08-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1289, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/sports/08iht-tennis08-1/08iht-tennis08-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/08/sports/08iht-tennis08-1/08iht-tennis08-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/sports/08iht-tennis08-1/08iht-tennis08-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headl