erica.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/opinion/how-americans-feel-about-mormons.html', 'snippet': 'Readers respond to an Op-Ed article about anti-Mormonism in America.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Americans Feel About Mormons', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How Americans Feel About Mormons', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mormons (Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-Day Saints)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Religion and Belief', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Christians and Christianity', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T21:59:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Letters', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/f444929f-eeb8-5214-8824-460561c07169', 'word_count': 523, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f444929f-eeb8-5214-8824-460561c07169'}, {'abstract': 'Francisco Costa’s new resort collection for Calvin Klein balances strictness with sumptuousness in the groovy spirit of the ’70s.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/07/just-one-look-calvin-klein-2/', 'snippet': 'Francisco Costa’s new resort collection for Calvin Klein balances strictness with sumptuousness in the groovy spirit of the ’70s.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Always looking to architecture for inspiration, Calvin Klein’s Francisco Costa chose California modernism, and specifically the Eames house in Los Angeles’s Pacific Palisades, for resort. The contrast between the house’s rigid exterior and softer, more comfortable interior spoke to the designer who, too, balances similar strictness with sumptuousness in his collections. Silhouettes were all very ’70s — tunics and jackets with belts slung low around the hips and modern caftans over cropped pants. The shoes were clomping flat platforms. “It feels sort of groovy,” Costa said of the clothes, with their flowy, relaxed fits and long-over-short proportions. Case in point: this technical viscose dress worn over a black bandeau with pleated pants and a patent version of the platform.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Calvin Klein', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T22:00:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Herman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Herman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/40788904-cf81-54db-bf42-43b90c5a7ba8', 'word_count': 122, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40788904-cf81-54db-bf42-43b90c5a7ba8'}, {'abstract': '“Death of a Salesman” and Audra McDonald are locks, but not so for other Tony Award nominees, according to the polling for an unusually competitive contest.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/theater/theaterspecial/newsies-versus-once-and-other-tony-competitions.html', 'snippet': '“Death of a Salesman” and Audra McDonald are locks, but not so for other Tony Award nominees, according to the polling for an unusually competitive contest.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE new Broadway musicals “Newsies” and “Once” won’t run the table at the Tony Awards on Sunday the way “The Book of Mormon” did last year or “Billy Elliot” did in 2009, when those hits were runaway favorites in multiple categories. But the 2012 awards ceremony, the biggest night of honors for the Broadway industry, offers something even more fun than singing missionaries and pint-size ballerinas: competition.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08TONY3_SPAN/08TONY3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08TONY3_SPAN/08TONY3_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08TONY3_SPAN/JPTONY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 705, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08TONY3_SPAN/JPTONY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1410, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08TONY3_SPAN/08TONY3_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08TONY3_SPAN/08TONY3_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08TONY3_SPAN/08TONY3_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'That Tony Pool: Few Sure Bets', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'That Tony Pool: Few Sure Bets', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tony Awards (Theater Awards)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T22:00:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Tony Awards', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1ddeadfd-bf8f-5138-96e7-45988e5562d1', 'word_count': 1283, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1ddeadfd-bf8f-5138-96e7-45988e5562d1'}, {'abstract': 'A selective guide to when you might next see this year’s Tony Award nominees in action.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/theater/theaterspecial/whats-next-for-tony-nominees.html', 'snippet': 'A selective guide to when you might next see this year’s Tony Award nominees in action.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You don’t need to be a gossip hound to know how Andrew Garfield will follow up his Tony-nominated role as Biff in the recent Broadway revival of “Death of a Salesman.” As the star of “The Amazing Spider-Man,” the much-promoted movie reboot opening on July 3, he will probably be seen by more people in one day than in his entire, just-completed Broadway run.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/theater/08next-span/08next-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/08/theater/08next-span/08next-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What’s Next for Some Tony Nominees', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Waiting in the Wings: A Selective Peek at the Schedules of Nominees', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ACTORS AND ACTRESSES', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tony Awards (Theater Awards)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T22:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Tony Awards', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/96bbb7e5-847d-5903-977b-67117227a07c', 'word_count': 905, 'uri': 'nyt://article/96bbb7e5-847d-5903-977b-67117227a07c'}, {'abstract': 'Sprint said the iPhone would become available this month on Virgin Mobile USA, its service for prepaid plans, where customers pay for the service as they use it. The cost will be considerably less than the fees contract customers pay monthly to use an iPhone — once you get past the upfront price of the phone itself.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/07/apple-buddies-up-with-cheaper-wireless-partners-for-iphone/', 'snippet': 'Sprint said the iPhone would become available this month on Virgin Mobile USA, its service for prepaid plans, where customers pay for the service as they use it. The cost will be considerably less than the fees contract customers pay monthly to us...', 'lead_paragraph': ' Sprint said on Thursday that the iPhone would become available this month on Virgin Mobile USA, its service for prepaid plans, where customers pay for the service as they use it. The cost will be considerably less than the fees \xa0contract customers pay monthly to use an iPhone — once you get past the upfront price of the phone itself.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/22/technology/bits/bitpix-apple-iphone1/bitpix-apple-iphone1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/22/technology/bits/bitpix-apple-iphone1/bitpix-apple-iphone1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1536, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/22/technology/bits/bitpix-apple-iphone1/bitpix-apple-iphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/04/22/technology/bits/bitpix-apple-iphone1/bitpix-apple-iphone1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/04/22/technology/bits/bitpix-apple-iphone1/bitpix-apple-iphone1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Apple Buddies Up With Cheaper Wireless Partners for iPhone', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPhone', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AT&T Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Verizon Communications Inc', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Virgin Mobile', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T22:00:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian X. Chen', 'person': [{'firstname