contact and kept to herself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/world/asia/tokyo-gas-attack-arrest-reawakens-national-trauma.html', 'snippet': 'The suspect in the 1995 sarin attack lived with her boyfriend in a rundown barn, wearing drab clothes and no makeup, and neighbors said she avoided eye contact and kept to herself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAGAMIHARA, Japan — For two years, the woman who called herself Chizuko Sakurai lived with her boyfriend in a rundown old barn on the far western edge of Tokyo’s sprawl, where tracts of identical suburban homes fade into farms and mountains. She drew little attention, wearing drably colored clothes and no makeup. Neighbors said she avoided eye contact and kept to herself.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/world/08CULT1/08CULT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/08/world/08CULT1/08CULT1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/world/08CULT1/08CULT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/world/08CULT1/08CULT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1458, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/world/08CULT1/08CULT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/08/world/08CULT1/08CULT1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, '