m/2012/06/07/at-graduation-ohio-high-school-seniors-remember-fellow-students-killed-in-shooting/', 'snippet': 'Last weekend, seniors at Chardon High School in Ohio remembered the three students killed last February by a student who was indicted this week on charges of aggravated murder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Thomas M. Lane III, the 17-year-old accused of fatally shooting three students and wounding two others in the cafeteria at Chardon High School in Ohio last February, is scheduled to be arraigned Friday on charges of aggravated murder and attempted aggravated murder.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Graduation, Ohio High School Seniors Remember Fellow Students Killed in Shooting', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'School Shootings', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hewlin, Demetrius', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Russell Jr', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lane, T J', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Parmertor, Daniel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chardon High School (Chardon, Ohio)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Chardon (Ohio)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T23:36:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5809c314-35ec-51c4-9695-d28d3d57eae3', 'word_count': 555, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5809c314-35ec-51c4-9695-d28d3d57eae3'}, {'abstract': 'Morphy Auctions is offering the collection of George Moyer, who has long dominated the niche market of vintage firecracker packages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/arts/design/vintage-firecracker-packages-at-auction.html', 'snippet': 'Morphy Auctions is offering the collection of George Moyer, who has long dominated the niche market of vintage firecracker packages.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Lay on Ground, Light Fuse, Retire Quickly” and “Do Not Hold in Hand After Lighting” are the recurring warnings on 3,000 vintage firecracker packages for sale on June 22 and 23.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '30', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08ANTIQUES2/08ANTIQUES2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 975, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08ANTIQUES2/08ANTIQUES2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1950, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Exploding Ephemera', 'kicker': 'Antiques', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Exploding Ephemera', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fireworks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTIQUES', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-07T23:39:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eve M. Kahn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eve', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eab8d63c-d3db-5f02-8599-34b1ad06b99d', 'word_count': 986, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eab8d63c-d3db-5f02-8599-34b1ad06b99d'}, {'abstract': 'This documentary delves into the life of this singer-songwriter, who was one of the forces behind “The Rainbow Connection,” among other songs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/movies/paul-williams-still-alive-directed-by-stephen-kessler.html', 'snippet': 'This documentary delves into the life of this singer-songwriter, who was one of the forces behind “The Rainbow Connection,” among other songs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paul Williams, a singer-songwriter behind 1970s classics like “Rainy Days and Mondays,” “Evergreen” and the “Muppet Movie” anthem, “The Rainbow Connection,” was a kind of Zelig on ’70s prime-time television as well, guest-starring on seemingly everything: “Circus of the Stars,” “Police Woman,” countless “Tonight” shows. Short and bespectacled, he was an unlikely celebrity, but his romance with drugs and alcohol was all too common. After embracing sobriety he largely dropped out of the public eye to rebuild his life and counsel other substance abusers.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_PAULWILLIAMS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 302, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_PAULWILLIAMS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 302}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_PAULWILLIAMS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 695, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_PAULWILLIAMS_SPAN/FILMROUNDUP4-superJumbo.jp