ate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In another assault on President Obama’s health care law, the House passed a bill on Thursday to repeal a new tax on medical devices.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'House Acts to Repeal Medical-Device Tax', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'House Acts to Repeal Medical-Device Tax', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'House of Representatives', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medical Devices', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T00:06:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Robert Pear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Robert', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pear', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a2d51a0-ac7b-5f25-aa5f-d1c8f8043c2b', 'word_count': 512, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a2d51a0-ac7b-5f25-aa5f-d1c8f8043c2b'}, {'abstract': 'Muhammad Rashid received 15 years in prison and a $15 million fine for stealing from the Palestine Investment Fund.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/world/middleeast/sentence-for-former-adviser-to-arafat.html', 'snippet': 'Muhammad Rashid received 15 years in prison and a $15 million fine for stealing from the Palestine Investment Fund.', 'lead_paragraph': ' A Palestinian Authority anticorruption court sentenced Yasir Arafat’s former financial adviser to 15 years in prison with hard labor and a $15 million fine, according to the official Palestinian news agency, Wafa. The adviser, Muhammad Rashid, was convicted in absentia of embezzlement of public funds and money laundering from the period when he ran the Palestine Investment Fund. Mr. Rashid has denied wrongdoing in the past. He left the Palestinian territories after Mr. Arafat’s death in 2004, and his current location is unknown. His was the highest profile corruption case to have been dealt with to date by the court in the West Bank city of Ramallah. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Middle East: Sentence for Former Adviser to Arafat', 'kicker': 'World Briefing | Middle East', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sentence for Former Adviser to Arafat', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rashid, Muhammad', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Corruption (Institutional)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Money Laundering', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'INVESTMENT FUND', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Middle East', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T00:06:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Isabel Kershner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Isabel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kershner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Brief', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddaf7359-5fde-558c-af43-d73372df4c83', 'word_count': 109, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddaf7359-5fde-558c-af43-d73372df4c83'}, {'abstract': 'Given what we now know about why it takes child abuse victims so long to come forward, the law needs to be changed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/opinion/in-light-of-child-abuse.html', 'snippet': 'Given what we now know about why it takes child abuse victims so long to come forward, the law needs to be changed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE revelation this week of alleged widespread child abuse at the elite Horace Mann School in New York City, most of it occurring during the 1970s and ’80s, is only the most recent instance of men coming forward, many years after the fact, with horrific stories of sexual molesting from their childhood. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/opinion/0608OPEDfreshwater/0608OPEDfreshwater-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 768, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/opinion/0608OPEDfreshwater/0608OPEDfreshwater-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1537, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/opinion/0608OPEDfreshwater/0608OPEDfreshwater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/08/opinion/0608OPEDfreshwater/0608OPEDfreshwater-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/opinion/0608OPEDfreshwater/0608OPEDfreshwater-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Troubled Silence', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_hea