ps://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/07/ex-catcher-girardi-delivers-a-message-to-martin/', 'snippet': 'Joe Girardi had a meeting with Russell Martin, the Yankees’ No. 1 catcher, and the results seem to be impressive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a day off in Detroit, spent ruminating over recent trends with his pitching staff, Manager Joe Girardi called catcher Russell Martin into his office at Comerica Park last Saturday for a short meeting before Martin went behind the plate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ex-Catcher Girardi Delivers a Message to Martin', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Girardi, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Russell', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T02:46:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f9c85932-f819-5b03-a402-7fdcb5cc0c23', 'word_count': 691, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f9c85932-f819-5b03-a402-7fdcb5cc0c23'}, {'abstract': '“The Oregonian” is creepy, silly, startling, irritating and sometimes disgusting.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/movies/the-oregonian-by-calvin-lee-reeder.html', 'snippet': '“The Oregonian” is creepy, silly, startling, irritating and sometimes disgusting.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Refusing to slot comfortably into any recognizable genre, “The Oregonian” teases us with horror and amnesia-mystery conventions without sealing the deal either way. From a commercial standpoint this is more than a little risky, encouraging nonplused critics to dust off the “experimental” tag that sends most moviegoers running for the hills. Yet this first feature from Calvin Lee Reeder (who also wrote the story, such as it is) doesn’t feel like an experiment; it feels like a journey whose destination was firmly predetermined.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 540, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/arts/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN/08RDP_OREGONIAN_SPAN-t