ion': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b75428b-02de-5cda-b5ef-68eee30a79af', 'word_count': 382, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b75428b-02de-5cda-b5ef-68eee30a79af'}, {'abstract': 'An explosion killed at least 19 people and wounded dozens in the deadliest attack in Peshawar in months.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/09/world/asia/deadly-bombing-strikes-police-bus-in-northwest-pakistan.html', 'snippet': 'An explosion killed at least 19 people and wounded dozens in the deadliest attack in Peshawar in months.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ISLAMABAD, Pakistan — An explosion ripped through a police bus on the edge of Peshawar on Friday, killing at least 19 people and wounding dozens in the deadliest attack in months in the northwestern city. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/us/09pakistan-span/09pakistan-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 383, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/09/us/09pakistan-span/09pakistan-span-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 383}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/us/09pakistan-span/09pakistan-span-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 672, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/us/09pakistan-span/09pakistan-span-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1345, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/us/09pakistan-span/09pakistan-span-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy':