': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f4ab9ead-c888-575d-a76a-c933d3b9d49b', 'word_count': 20, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f4ab9ead-c888-575d-a76a-c933d3b9d49b'}, {'abstract': 'A new TV ad by Mitt Romney responds to claims by the Obama campaign that Mr. Romney presided over one of “the worst economic records in the country” while governor of Massachusetts.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/romney-ad-a-response-to-obama-attack/', 'snippet': 'A new TV ad by Mitt Romney responds to claims by the Obama campaign that Mr. Romney presided over one of “the worst economic records in the country” while governor of Massachusetts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Is Mitt Romney’s campaign feeling the pressure from President Obama’s attacks on his record as governor of Massachusetts? ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Romney Ad a Response to Obama Attack', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Romney Ad Responds to Obama', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T12:36:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7dcd110-f65e-5951-a735-d66acbc70091', 'word_count': 326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7dcd110-f65e-5951-a735-d66acbc70091'}, {'abstract': 'Live updates of the men’s semifinal matches at the French Open on Friday.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/live-blogging-the-french-open-4/', 'snippet': 'Live updates of the men’s semifinal matches at the French Open on Friday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No. 2 Rafael Nadal defeated No. 6 David Ferrer in Friday’s first semifinal and will have a chance to win a record seventh French Open title on Sunday. In a rematch of last year’s epic semifinal here, No. 1 Novak Djokovic defeated Roger Federer. He will play in the final on Sunday looking for a “Nole Slam” of four consecutive Slam titles. He would be the first man to achieve the feat since Rod Laver in 1969.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Blogging the French Open', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Federer, Roger', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ferrer, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadal, Rafael', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T12:47:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/69f25471-7dbd-59dc-bfad-b66a40ba9031', 'word_count': 1403, 'uri': 'nyt://article/69f25471-7dbd-59dc-bfad-b66a40ba9031'}, {'abstract': "The New York Times Magazine article about the Horace Mann School has drawn hundreds of comments from readers moved by its description of sexual abuse that took place there during the '70s and '80s. It has also drawn a letter of response from the school.", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/schoolbook/2012/06/08/at-the-horace-mann-school-tales-of-power-and-abuse/', 'snippet': "The New York Times Magazine article about the Horace Ma