0df88d06-7f7a-582d-874b-656e8510d1ee'}, {'abstract': 'The writer and star of ‘Girls’ discusses living with her parents and freaking out at her pet.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/magazine/even-lena-dunhams-dog-is-getting-frisky-with-her.html', 'snippet': 'The writer and star of ‘Girls’ discusses living with her parents and freaking out at her pet.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I was shocked to learn that you were living with your parents while you were writing, producing and starring in the first season of HBO’s “Girls.” Moving back in with Mom and Dad after school is one reason that Gen Xers like myself privately disparage people of your generation.  When I was graduating, I remember my parents’ surprise. They were like, “Do you realize that none of us would have accepted help from our parents?” They were shocked by what my friends were settling for. But I really love living with my parents. Few people who aren’t in my family understand it.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10talk/mag-10talk-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 426, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10talk/mag-10talk-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1399, 'width': 582, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10talk/10talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/10/magazine/10talk/10talk-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'typ