n’t have to be floating on a sailboat in the Caribbean to pull off. Among the best looks is this sweatshirt, brilliantly gussied up with a panel of Lurex and a multibeaded skirt. Holiday party, anyone?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Club Monaco', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T16:30:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alix Browne', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alix', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Browne', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85211c51-5a6c-5494-94c5-876acfef4283', 'word_count': 101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85211c51-5a6c-5494-94c5-876acfef4283'}, {'abstract': 'The Stamford state’s attorney said there was not sufficient evidence to charge anyone in connection with a fire that killed three girls and their grandparents.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/09/nyregion/prosecutor-wont-file-criminal-charges-in-stamford-christmas-fire.html', 'snippet': 'The Stamford state’s attorney said there was not sufficient evidence to charge anyone in connection with a fire that killed three girls and their grandparents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A Connecticut prosecutor said Friday that he would not file criminal charges in connection with the Christmas morning fire in Stamford that killed three girls and their grandparents.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/nyregion/09stamford/09stamford-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 351, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/09/nyregio