az joined other designers in the long march that is resort, that in-between season that provides stores with clothes around the time you’re carving the turkey.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/postcards-from-the-resort-collections/', 'snippet': 'On Wednesday, Mr. Elbaz joined other designers in the long march that is resort, that in-between season that provides stores with clothes around the time you’re carving the turkey.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s all about comfort,” Alber Elbaz said as he introduced his latest Lanvin collection to a small group of editors and retailers at Milk Studios. “To me, that’s the only definition of modernity.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Postcards From the Resort Collections', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Costa, Francisco', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Elbaz, Alber', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hernandez, Lazaro', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Krakoff, Reed', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Panichgul, Thakoon', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Narciso', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Calvin Klein Inc', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Lanvin', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Proenza Schouler', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T16:41:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cathy Horyn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cathy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Horyn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization'