rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pistorius, Oscar', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T17:00:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/16ab015a-4065-5213-a64e-52675e06bd25', 'word_count': 101, 'uri': 'nyt://article/16ab015a-4065-5213-a64e-52675e06bd25'}, {'abstract': 'For the first time in more than half a century, the average American is both earning less and worth less than four years earlier, when figures are adjusted for inflation.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/09/business/economy/as-recovery-drags-on-income-and-wealth-lag.html', 'snippet': 'For the first time in more than half a century, the average American is both earning less and worth less than four years earlier, when figures are adjusted for inflation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AMERICANS are used to recessions, but they are also used to relatively fast recoveries.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Income and Wealth Are Down in U.S.', 'kicker': 'Off the Charts', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Income and Wealth Are Down in U.S.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate and Housing (Residential)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T17:04:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Floyd Norris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Floyd', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Norris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fcc6faf-a026-5533-8a21-2386f234dfab', 'word_count': 597, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fcc6faf-a026-5533-8a21-2386f234dfab'}, {'abstract': 'The British Olympic Association ratified the nomination of Lutalo Muhammad to its tae kwon do team Friday, excluding Aaron Cook, who is ranked No. 1 in his weight class.', 'web_url': 'https://london2012.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/britain-confirms-tae-kwon-do-choice-is-not-no-1-fighter/', 'snippet': 'The British Olympic Association ratified the nomination of Lutalo Muhammad to its tae kwon do team Friday, excluding Aaron Cook, who is ranked No. 1 in his weight class.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The British Olympic Association ratified the nomination of Lutalo Muhammad to its tae kwon do team Friday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Britain Confirms Tae Kwon Do Choice Is Not No. 1 Fighter', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taekwondo', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cook, Aaron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Muhammad, Lutalo', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T17:04:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Pilon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pilon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/21f6c1a6-93f7-551f-bb96-24b2214229cc', 'word_count': 493, 'uri': 'nyt://article/21f6c1a6-93f7-551f-bb96-24b2214229cc'}, {'abstract': 'What do you do when a child would rather play games on a gadget than play with a visiting friend?', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/a-child-a-gadget-a-guest-and-a-question-of-etiquette/', 'snippet': 'What do you do when a child would rather play games on a gadget than play with a visiting friend?', 'lead_paragraph': '“Yesterday,” R. wrote, “my 6-year-old child and the rest of our family visited another family with a child (also 6) who spent the whole time on an iPod touch.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Child, a Gadget, a Guest and a Question of Etiquette', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T17:07:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': "By Kj Dell'Antonia", 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kj', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': "Dell'Antonia", 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de9f5282-b87a-5610-a40d-38f75a79b64d', 'word_count': 228, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de9f5282-b87a-5610-a40d-38f75a79b64d'}, {'abstract': 'Bucks readers share their thoughts on what classic cars they have coveted.', 'web_url': 'https://bucks.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/the-car-of-your-dreams/', 'snippet': 'Bucks readers share their thoughts on what classic cars they have coveted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In his Wealth Matters column this week, Paul Sullivan writes about collectors of classic cars. Like any other type of collectible, some cars — often those that were widely produced — have little value as an investment. And other cars may be falling out of favor, like sedans from the 1920s and ’30s, whose biggest fans were people who remembered riding in them as youngsters. Car collecting, in other words, needs to be done with some knowledge and, often, advice from those with experience.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Car of Your Dreams', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Antique and Classic Cars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T17:18:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bucks Editors', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bucks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Editors', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8c871fc0-843e-5825-82fa-ed653815efe2', 'word_count': 173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8c871fc0-843e-5825-82fa-ed653815efe2'}, {'abstract': 'Samuel Brittain says I’m right.', 'web_url': 'https://krugman.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/waiting-for-non-lefties/', 'snippet': 'Samuel Brittain says I’m right.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Samuel Brittain: You don’t need to be a lefty to support Krugman:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Waiting For Non-Lefties', 'kicker': 'Paul Krugman', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T17:23:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Krugman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Krugman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6f14a54c-76a3-5f1f-bbf9-a11f5c75efae', 'word_count': 160, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6f14a54c-76a3-5f1f-bbf9-a11f5c75efae'}, {'abstract': 'What started as an artistic business partnership develops into much more after a ride on a carousel.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/fashion/weddings/aurora-stokowski-and-anthony-mazzei-vows.html', 'snippet': 'What started as an artistic business partnership develops into much more after a ride on a carousel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ANTHONY MAZZEI didn’t begin his romance with Aurora Stokowski by asking her on a date. They were on the carousel at Bryant Park when, out of the blue, he confessed that he loved her — risking not only his heart, but also the business it had taken them more than a year to build. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/fashion/weddings/10VOWS1_SPAN/10VOWS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/10/fashion/weddings/10VOWS1_SPAN/10VOWS1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/fashion/weddings/10VOWS1_SPAN/10VOWS1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/fashion/weddings/10VOWS1_SPAN/10VOWS1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {