297-e1f1-5daa-b9dd-60db7aa16dba'}, {'abstract': 'Once, elite fliers belonged to something of an exclusive club. Not anymore. What happened?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/travel/have-elite-fliers-been-downgraded.html', 'snippet': 'Once, elite fliers belonged to something of an exclusive club. Not anymore. What happened?', 'lead_paragraph': 'A STEADY rain was soaking the windows of La Guardia Airport when Nancy Thode, an elite frequent flier with Delta Air Lines, approached a gate agent with a pressing question: Had her request for an upgrade cleared?', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/travel/10MAZE2/10MAZE2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 752, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/travel/10MAZE2/10MAZE2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1504, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/travel/10MAZE2/10MAZE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/10/travel/10MAZE2/10MAZE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/travel/10MAZE2/10MAZE2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 204, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Have Elite Fliers Been Downgraded?', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Upgrade Maze', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Va