ng Approaches to Delivering a Connected Drive', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wireless Communications', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mog', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Verizon Communications Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T18:17:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By John R. Quain', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Quain', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/88d50ea2-5dc0-5f6d-8912-074ba16a2bc6', 'word_count': 452, 'uri': 'nyt://article/88d50ea2-5dc0-5f6d-8912-074ba16a2bc6'}, {'abstract': 'No matter which neighborhood a Bronx resident calls home, most have been to the Hub, one of the the Bronx’s most dynamic commercial centers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/realestate/the-hub-the-bronx-living-in-people-shops-and-roads-converge-here.html', 'snippet': 'No matter which neighborhood a Bronx resident calls home, most have been to the Hub, one of the the Bronx’s most dynamic commercial centers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NO matter which neighborhood a Bronx resident calls home, most have been to the Hub, a convergence of streets in the South Bronx that is one of the borough’s most dynamic commercial centers. For Michael Reed, it was when his parents took him shopping for Easter clothes as a boy.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{