al terms, workable solutions to curb the projected oil consumption of the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/08/from-the-union-of-concerned-scientists-a-framework-for-reducing-oil-consumption/', 'snippet': 'The organization’s Half the Oil Plan outlines, in general terms, workable solutions to curb the projected oil consumption of the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Union of Concerned Scientists, a nonprofit American watchdog group, released a framework document this week for reducing the projected oil use of the United States by half over 20 years. On its Web site, the organization characterized its Half the Oil Plan as a clear, achievable road map to significantly curb the nation’s dependency on oil.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From the Union of Concerned Scientists, a Framework for Reducing Oil Consumption', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Union of Concerned Scientists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-08T21:36:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Paul Stenquist', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Paul', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stenquist', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ec5e2ccf-48c7-5c8b-8416-fd2d4103bfe3', 'word_count': 512, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ec5e2ccf-48c7-5c8b-8416-fd2d4103bfe3'}, {'abstract': 'Over the years, automakers have overcome many technological challenges to introduce their in-car information and entertainment systems. Some proved fabulous, while others were flops.', 