turing recipes brought from Iran more than 20 years ago.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SUBTLETY is the hallmark of the kind of traditional Persian cooking on the menu at Ravagh Persian Grill, a nondescript-looking place flush up against a narrow strip of River Road in Edgewater. More fragrant than spicy, long on delicate, balanced flavors and short on anything startling, it’s stoutly Old Worldish fare; the focus is on pita dips, kebabs, stews and rice, with a few seafood dishes thrown in for American diners.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/nyregion/10DINENJ2/10DineNJ2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/nyregion/10DINENJ2/10DineNJ2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/nyregion/10DINENJ2/10DINENJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/10/nyregion/10DINENJ2/10DINENJ2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/nyregion/10DINENJ2/10DINENJ2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 100, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Persian Cooking, Old-World Style', 'kicker': 'New Jersey Dining | Edgewater', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Persian Cooking, Old-World Style', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ravag