about Western-led campaigns to force leaders from power, Russia has seized the opportunity to make its point heard. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Its Unyielding Stance on Syria, Russia Takes Substantial Risks in Middle East', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Its Unyielding Stance on Syria, Russia Takes Substantial Risks in Middle East', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Moscow (Russia)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T01:51:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ellen Barry', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ellen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barry', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/c4f68805-7190-51b1-a6a0-03cc56b0125b', 'word_count': 972, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c4f68805-7190-51b1-a6a0-03cc56b0125b'}, {'abstract': 'National champion Jared McCann, 31, went from exploring the dark corners of New York City to representing the United States at the international yoga asana competition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/09/sports/jared-mccann-went-from-partying-to-national-yoga-champion.html', 'snippet': 'National champion Jared McCann, 31, went from exploring the dark corners of New York City to representing the United States at the international yoga asana competition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Jared McCann was 12, he was the only kid in his Southern Baptist church in Hawaii not to be baptized. One Sunday, during the traditional altar call, his mother whispered, “Jared, don’t you feel Jesus calling at your heart?” ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/sports/yoga1/yoga1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/09/sports/yoga1/yoga1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/sports/yoga1/yoga1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/sports/yoga1/yoga1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/sports/yoga1/yoga1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/09/sports/yoga1/yoga1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/sports/yoga1/yoga1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Twists and Turns Lead to a New Life', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Twists and Turns Lead to a New Life', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'USA Yoga', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McCann, Jared', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Yoga', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T01:52:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sara Beck', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Beck', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d7514404-0198-5425-99ff-be1322ce187b', 'word_count': 1242, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d7514404-0198-5425-99ff-be1322ce187b'}, {'abstract': 'After the bodies of three men were found inside a BMW, the police said they thought the victims were dealers who had stolen drugs from rivals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/09/nyregion/in-triple-killing-near-columbia-university-drug-link-is-eyed.html', 'snippet': 'After the bodies of three men were found inside a BMW, the police said they thought the victims were dealers who had stolen drugs from rivals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The streets surrounding Columbia University whirled with people as the evening rush hour gave way to happy hour on Thursday night. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/nyregion/SHOT-sub/SHOT-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/09/nyregion/SHOT-sub/SHOT-sub-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/09/nyregion/SHOT-sub/SHOT-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 773, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', '