section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mirnyi and Nestor Repeat as French Open Doubles Champions', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Bryans Are Beaten as Mirnyi and Nestor Retain Title', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bryan, Mike', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Paris (France)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T19:51:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a992ce16-0dc3-54da-a66c-a7bac46191f6', 'word_count': 530, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a992ce16-0dc3-54da-a66c-a7bac46191f6'}, {'abstract': 'Prospects are murky for the efforts of two prosecutors appointed by Attorney General Eric H. Holder Jr. to lead investigations into recent disclosures of government secrets.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/us/for-us-inquiries-on-leaks-a-difficult-road-to-prosecution.html', 'snippet': 'Prospects are murky for the efforts of two prosecutors appointed by Attorney General Eric H. Holder Jr. to lead investigations into recent disclosures of government secrets.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Anger over leaks of government secrets and calls for prosecution have once again engulfed the nation’s capital. Under bipartisan pressure for a crackdown, Attorney General Eric H. Holder Jr. on Friday announced the appointment of two top prosecutors to lead investigations into recent disclosures.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For U.S. Inquiries on Leaks, a Difficult Road to Prosecution', 'kicker': 'News Analysis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Finding Sources of Leaked Secrets Is Hard; Bringing a Case Is Harder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Holder, Eric H Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classified Information and State Secrets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T19:54:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News Analysis', '_id': 'nyt://article/dc4b0945-fb7a-5827-a1e5-1fcd535a84d8', 'word_count': 1086, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dc4b0945-fb7a-5827-a1e5-1fcd535a84d8'}, {'abstract': 'The chief executive of the Ciena Corporation describes how his company bounced back from the bursting of the telecom bubble in 2001.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/jobs/gary-smith-of-ciena-on-tenacity-and-teamwork.html', 'snippet': 'The chief executive of the Ciena Corporation describes how his company bounced back from the bursting of the telecom bubble in 2001.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I WAS born in Birmingham, England. My father was a machine tool fitter for the factory that produced the first Austin Mini car, and my mother was a seamstress at a factory. My parents worked hard to raise my older brother and me.', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-BOSS/10-BOSS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 790, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-BOSS/10-BOSS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1827, 'width': 1409, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-BOSS/10-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-BOSS/10-BOSS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-BOSS/10-BOSS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tenacity and Teamwork', 'kicker': 'The Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tenacity and Teamwork', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ciena Corporation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Smith, Gary B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executives and Management (Theory)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Careers and Professions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T19:56:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'SundayBusiness', 'section_name': 'Job Market', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gary B. Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de8015b8-bb38-5556-8215-9fd0df3ac700', 'word_count': 618, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de8015b8-bb38-5556-8215-9fd0df3ac700'}, {'abstract': 'In Atlanta, the writer is an executive for a construction equipment maker. In India, he has a big role in a clinic that was started in memory of his brother.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/jobs/anand-chaturvedi-at-work-on-two-sides-of-the-globe.html', 'snippet': 'In Atlanta, the writer is an executive for a construction equipment maker. In India, he has a big role in a clinic that was started in memory of his brother.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YOU could say that I was raised to be a nomad. By the 10th grade, I had attended 10 schools throughout Rajasthan, my home state in northwestern India. That’s what it’s like when your dad is a civil servant for the Rajasthan Administrative Service. The experience turned out to be good training for my current working life. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-PRE/10-PRE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 911, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-PRE/10-PRE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1821, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-PRE/10-PRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/10/business/10-PRE/10-PRE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'su