tml', 'snippet': 'Kevin Millwood pitched six no-hit innings before leaving with a groin injury, and a bevy of Seattle relievers continued to hold the Dodgers in check for the victory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SEATTLE (AP) — Mariners shortstop Brendan Ryan popped his head into the clubhouse interview room and insisted his normally stoic manager enjoyed the history that just took place.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Mariners’ Scramble Yields a No-Hitter by Committee', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mariners&#8217; Scramble Yields a No-Hitter by Committee', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Seattle Mariners', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T20:37:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By THE ASSOCIATED PRESS', 'person': [], 'organization': 'THE ASSOCIATED PRESS'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5c04ed52-2ee3-5f28-a994-90d3f5d745b3', 'word_count': 466, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5c04ed52-2ee3-5f28-a994-90d3f5d745b3'}, {'abstract': 'Even in a sport that prides itself on nuance, the pitcher’s mound is easily overlooked. Is it hard or soft? Sturdy or crumbling? Steep or flat? To the untrained eye, it is hard to tell.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/sports/baseball/baseballs-pitching-mound-is-a-work-of-art-often-abused.html', 'snippet': 'Even in a sport that prides itself on nuance, the pitcher’s mound is easily overlooked. Is it hard or soft? Sturdy or crumbling? Steep or flat? To the untrained eye, it is hard to tell.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DETROIT (AP) — The mound at Comerica Park sits under a protective tarp during batting practice. Once the game starts, the abuse begins.', 'print_section': 'S