nt Park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Giant Ryan, a 6-year-old Grade 1 stakes winner with career earnings of more than $600,000, fractured his left front leg Saturday at Belmont near the end of the True North Stakes, a few hours before the Belmont Stakes was run.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Stakes Winner Fractures Leg at Belmont', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fractured Leg In Undercard', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jockeys, Drivers and Trainers', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horse Racing', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Belmont Stakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T22:14:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'byline': {'original': 'By Claire Novak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Claire', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Novak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2180c8c4-b4bb-5360-afcd-e1e62f87e7b0', 'word_count': 384, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2180c8c4-b4bb-5360-afcd-e1e62f87e7b0'}, {'abstract': 'Latinos are not voting in numbers that fully reflect their potential strength, leaving Hispanic leaders frustrated and Democrats worried as they increase efforts to rally Latino support.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/us/politics/latino-growth-not-fully-felt-at-voting-booth.html', 'snippet': 'Latinos are not voting in numbers that fully reflect their potential strength, leaving Hispanic leaders frustrated and Democrats worried as they increase efforts to rally Latino support.', 'lead_paragraph': 'DENVER — The nation’s rapidly growing Latino population is one of the most powerful forces working in President Obama’s favor in many of the states that will deter