kees hope that the contusion he sustained on his left foot in Friday’s game against the Mets won’t keep him from his next scheduled start.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hiroki Kuroda said his sore left foot felt better Saturday after he received treatment for a contusion he sustained during his winning start on Friday against the Mets. But the Yankees still don’t know if Kuroda will be healthy enough to make his next scheduled start against the Atlanta Braves on Wednesday.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Kuroda’s Left Foot', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kuroda, Hiroki', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-09T23:32:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f324f969-48f4-5ec1-abcc-132920a62983', 'word_count': 208, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f324f969-48f4-5ec1-abcc-132920a62983'}, {'abstract': 'One group of four friends made their annual pilgrimage, which dates back more than 20 years, to Belmont Park.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/sports/for-betting-buddies-a-belmont-stakes-reunion.html', 'snippet': 'One group of four friends made their annual pilgrimage, which dates back more than 20 years, to Belmont Park.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At Belmont Park on Saturday morning, four friends met in the same spot and at the same time on Belmont Stakes day as they have for years. Over doughnuts and coffee at 9:30, ne