of Euro 2012 with a late goal by Mario Gomez, who made an unexpected start.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LVIV, Ukraine — It was the 72nd minute of a game that had grown increasingly frustrating and unproductive. Mario Gomez had labored after making an unexpected start at forward for Germany. Miroslav Klose stood at the sideline on his 34th birthday, ready to replace to him.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/sports/euro-2012-reefer/euro-2012-reefer-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/10/sports/euro-2012-reefer/euro-2012-reefer-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/sports/euro-2012-reefer/euro-2012-reefer-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 633, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/sports/euro-2012-reefer/euro-2012-reefer-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1266, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/sports/euro-2012-reefer/euro-2012-reefer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/10/sports/euro-2012-reefer/euro-2012-reefer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/10/sports/euro-2012-reefer/euro-2012-reefer-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', '