/', 'snippet': 'The decision represents an about-face for Rajat K. Gupta, a former Goldman Sachs director. Late Friday, his lawyer said it was “highly likely” that he would testify.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Rajat K. Gupta, a former director of Goldman Sachs accused of leaking secrets about the bank, will not testify at his insider trading trial, according to a letter from his lawyers that was filed with the court on Sunday. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Gupta Won’t Testify at His Insider Trading Trial', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Gupta Opting Not to Testify In His Insider Trading Trial', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insider Trading', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gupta, Rajat K', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rajaratnam, Raj', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rakoff, Jed S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Galleon Group', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-10T21:21:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e5e8ddd0-2d63-5c5a-9c7d-00f4efe85b62', 'word_count': 428, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e5e8ddd0-2d63-5c5a-9c7d-00f4efe85b62'}, {'abstract': 'Nintendo’s Wii U was the talk of this year’s E3, the Electronic Entertainment Expo, where the next big things in computer games were unveiled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/arts/video-games/nintendos-wii-u-is-the-talk-of-