fore she’s even old enough to have prepubescent hormones.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/10/she-isnt-sexy-shes-7/', 'snippet': 'I resent the pop music that has my daughter declaring her sexuality before she’s even old enough to have prepubescent hormones.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I am sitting at the dinner table with my 7-year-old daughter and my 10-year-old son. Suddenly, my daughter asks: “What’s passion mean, Mama?” My son, interrupting my chance to explain, answers, “It’s when you’re really into something.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'She Isn’t Sexy, She’s 7', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T00:45:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cori Howard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cori', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Howard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1880df7e-68bd-577b-944b-41e6cdd78ce2', 'word_count': 636, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1880df7e-68bd-577b-944b-41e6cdd78ce2'}, {'abstract': 'Italy played tight defense on Spain and the game ended 1-1, yielding few, if any, clues about whether these two leading soccer nations have another big tournament win in them.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/sports/soccer/euro-2012-tie-fails-to-settle-anything-for-spain-and-italy.html', 'snippet': 'Italy played tight defense on Spain and the game ended 1-1, yielding few, if any, clues about whether these two leading soccer nations have another big tournament win in them.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GDANSK, Poland ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'im