olice Department in the death of his wife, who was hit by a car as she crossed the street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The crash happened before his eyes, but for\xa0Jacob\xa0Stevens\xa0all that remains is the sound: the wrenching noise of the Honda sedan as it slammed into his wife, Clara Heyworth, while she walked to meet him across a Brooklyn street last July.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/11/nyregion/BIKE1/BIKE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/11/nyregion/BIKE1/BIKE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Police Unit Draws Scrutiny for Its Handling of Crashes Involving Pedestrians', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Police Unit Draws Scrutiny for Its Handling of Crashes Involving Pedestrians', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police Brutality and Misconduct', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycles and Bicycling', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lefevre, Mathieu', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Police', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T02:28:17+0000', 'document_type': 'artic