ns to announce Monday morning.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pro-Obama Ads Target Hispanics in Swing States', 'kicker': 'The Caucus', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T09:00:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By MICHAEL SHEAR', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'SHEAR', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6b8e6f5-45d8-5fe0-b7f1-058721a88110', 'word_count': 292, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6b8e6f5-45d8-5fe0-b7f1-058721a88110'}, {'abstract': 'Ebrahim Noroozi has been photographing executions in Iran, where roaring crowds gather to watch the spectacle. He said he hopes his pictures will one day be part of a broader debate: “I want to show the reality in a way that hits you in the face and threatens you severely.”', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/documenting-death-sentences-in-iran/', 'snippet': 'Ebrahim Noroozi has been photographing executions in Iran, where roaring crowds gather to watch the spectacle. He said he hopes his pictures will one day be part of a broader debate: “I want to show the reality in a way that hits you in the face a...', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Ebrahim Noroozi attended his first hanging, he left the scene covering his ears to shield them from the roar of the crowds.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Documenting Death Sentences in Iran', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Capital Punishment', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'},