onship at Roland Garros. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nadal Beats Djokovic for Record Seventh French Title', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'French Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Djokovic, Novak', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nadal, Rafael', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T11:11:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Rothenberg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rothenberg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1d17990-a230-5cf2-9f18-d4e65020682f', 'word_count': 1074, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1d17990-a230-5cf2-9f18-d4e65020682f'}, {'abstract': 'Perhaps it’s not surprising in the estrogen-challenged tech world, but Hannah Seligson reports that pregnant entrepreneurs cannot get financing, even while ensuring the continuity of markets…er, the species.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/tech-world-double-standard-for-women-entrepreneurs/', 'snippet': 'Perhaps it’s not surprising in the estrogen-challenged tech world, but Hannah Seligson reports that pregnant entrepreneurs cannot get financing, even while ensuring the continuity of markets…er, the species.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Perhaps it’s not surprising in the estrogen-challenged world of tech, but female entrepreneurs have a much harder time raising capital than their male counterparts, Hannah Seligson reports.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Tech World Double Standard for Women Entr