'', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3ca3e350-03dc-5f72-bf27-4e23267f761f', 'word_count': 334, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3ca3e350-03dc-5f72-bf27-4e23267f761f'}, {'abstract': 'Many people in the town of Yabucoa were surprised to learn that Pedro Hernandez had ended up in the center of the Etan Patz murder mystery.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/nyregion/in-puerto-rico-shock-and-anger-over-patz-murder.html', 'snippet': 'Many people in the town of Yabucoa were surprised to learn that Pedro Hernandez had ended up in the center of the Etan Patz murder mystery.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YABUCOA, P.R. — Here, on steep hills cultivated with bananas and yams, a few people had heard that a Puerto Rican man had been arrested in a 33-year-old murder of a child in New York.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/12pedro-3/12pedro-3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/12pedro-3/12pedro-3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/12pedro-3/12pedro-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/12pedro-3/12pedro-3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/12pedro-3/12pedro-3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'le