t', 'value': 'Campaign Finance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T16:26:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adam Liptak', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Liptak', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86a50175-e659-5721-96d7-9e3f5b208bed', 'word_count': 836, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86a50175-e659-5721-96d7-9e3f5b208bed'}, {'abstract': 'The Oscar-winning actress, whose 2011 memoir “Then Again” was warmly received by critics, will write a second book on “beauty, aging and being a woman.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/diane-keaton-to-write-book-on-beauty-and-aging/', 'snippet': 'The Oscar-winning actress, whose 2011 memoir “Then Again” was warmly received by critics, will write a second book on “beauty, aging and being a woman.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Less than a year after writing a well-received memoir, Diane Keaton will follow it up with another book. Ms. Keaton, the Oscar-winning actress, is working on a book about “beauty, aging and being a woman,” her publisher, Random House, said on Monday. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Diane Keaton to Write Book on Beauty and Aging', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Keaton to Write On Beauty, Aging', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beauty', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Writing and Writers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Keaton, Diane', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Random House', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-1