erate as an autonomous unit of Project WorldWide, an agency holding group.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Affinitive, New York, a social media agency, was acquired by Project WorldWide, Auburn Hills, Mich. Financial terms were not disclosed. Affinitive will operate as an autonomous unit of Project WorldWide, an agency holding group. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Accounts and People of Note in the Advertising Industry', 'kicker': 'Webdenda', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Webdenda', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ADVERTISING AND MARKETING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Public Relations and Publicity', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hiring and Promotion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T17:26:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d9b4e7d5-d014-5312-9183-ec340ce25815', 'word_count': 1151, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d9b4e7d5-d014-5312-9183-ec340ce25815'}, {'abstract': 'A campaign for Cape Cod kettle-cooked chips is called the first for the brand that includes television and social media.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/business/media/ads-promise-youll-fall-in-love-with-cape-cod-chips.html', 'snippet': 'A campaign for Cape Cod kettle-cooked chips is called the first for the brand that includes television and social media.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A brand in a competitive segment of the snack market is returning to its roots in a campaign meant to play up its origins.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/11/business/media/11adnewsletter1-inline/11adn