. The first is the noise from the construction of a building next to the main plaza where the fair is held; the building, designed by the Swiss architects Herzog & de Meuron, will be yet another exhibition space in the complex. The second is the arrival of the “Schaulager Satellite,’’ a dramatic, all-white temporary pavilion, also designed by Herzog & de Meuron, right in the center of the main plaza.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Schaulager Museum Sets Up Temporary Outpost at Art Basel', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ART BASEL (FESTIVAL)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Herzog & de Meuron', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Schaulager, The', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Basel (Switzerland)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T19:23:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Carol Vogel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Carol', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vogel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bbede82d-9a42-5d8d-8d45-7aa91d917e40', 'word_count': 342, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bbede82d-9a42-5d8d-8d45-7aa91d917e40'}, {'abstract': 'The Tony-winning musical will play a month as part of its ongoing tour.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/fela-will-return-to-broadway-for-summer-run/', 'snippet': 'The Tony-winning musical will play a month as part of its ongoing tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Tony Award-winning musical “Fela!,” which ran 14 months on Broadway before 