r Great Britain’s Olympic team at the London Games in 2012. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Queen’s Granddaughter, Zara Phillips, Will Compete in Olympics', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Horsemanship and Equestrian Events', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Phillips, Zara', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T20:36:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Pilon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pilon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fbfa37c8-6bc8-5ad9-810c-f5a30e3e8395', 'word_count': 323, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fbfa37c8-6bc8-5ad9-810c-f5a30e3e8395'}, {'abstract': 'There was a relaxed vibe at Chloé, with its all-white looks, summery pieces and romantic off-the-shoulder dresses.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/just-one-look-chloe-2/', 'snippet': 'There was a relaxed vibe at Chloé, with its all-white looks, summery pieces and romantic off-the-shoulder dresses.', 'lead_paragraph': '“So pretty,” editors gasped upon entering the penthouse at Milk Studios, where the stars of the Chloé resort collection were displayed on mannequins bathed in bright morning light. There, all-white looks like the one shown here (full, perforated skirt; peasant top — oh so pretty) segued into summery pieces like shorts and a scarf print shift (was there a designer who didn’t show a scarf print today?), and a number of even more romantic off-the-shoulder dresses. Really, really relaxed was the vibe one got from the collection and its designer, Claire Waight Keller, who seems to have settled in quite comfortably at Chloé’s helm. All those pretty — and wearable and flattering and easy-to-understand — clothes must be doing the trick.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Chloé', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Milk Studios', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T20:38:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jane Herman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jane', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Herman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/447e4f35-09bf-5fa3-aec9-6d6959f20581', 'word_count': 124, 'uri': 'nyt://article/447e4f35-09bf-5fa3-aec9-6d6959f20581'}, {'abstract': 'Parents at a Brooklyn elementary school are calling on the Department of Education to move faster to remove toxic PCBs from lighting fixtures in school buildings around the city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/schoolbook/2012/06/11/parents-push-for-faster-pcb-removal/', 'snippet': 'Parents at a Brooklyn elementary school are calling on the Department of Education to move faster to remove toxic PCBs from lighting fixtures in school buildings around the city.', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Parents Push for Faster PCB Removal', 'kicker': 'SchoolBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T20:40:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_des