445-5f70-809b-cc5e8d5bedf9', 'word_count': 12, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14dfc61e-7445-5f70-809b-cc5e8d5bedf9'}, {'abstract': 'Just in time for the hot weather, the hipsters behind the Paris night spots Social Club and Silencio have brought their brand of cool outdoors.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/the-scene-on-the-seine-wanderlust-in-paris/', 'snippet': 'Just in time for the hot weather, the hipsters behind the Paris night spots Social Club and Silencio have brought their brand of cool outdoors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Scene on the Seine | Wanderlust in Paris', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T22:07:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sarah Moroz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sarah', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Moroz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d1bfb976-2c8e-5851-8c0f-d13e6101e9d2', 'word_count': 352, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d1bfb976-2c8e-5851-8c0f-d13e6101e9d2'}, {'abstract': 'A paper on Australian warming and the greenhouse effect makes news and then is “put on hold.”', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/australian-warming-hockey-sticks-and-open-review/', 'snippet': 'A paper on Australian warming and the greenhouse effect makes news and then is “put on hold.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'A much-cited study\xa0(paper here) concluded last month that the extent of warming in Australia in recent decades was so great compared to climate variations in the last millennium that it had to be mainly the result of warming from the human-driven buildup of greenhouse gases in the atmosphere. (Here’s a video interview from May with the lead author, Joëlle Gergis from the University of Melbourne.)', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Australian Warming, Hockey Sticks and Open Review', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'News and News Media', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Melbourne (Australia)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T22:12:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b7962d39-b0ec-5807-8425-97e9286e1438', 'word_count': 795, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b7962d39-b0ec-5807-8425-97e9286e1438'}, {'abstract': 'Starbucks helps bring at least a few jobs back to the United States by hiring a plant in East Liverpool, Ohio, to make its new line of coffee mugs.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/business/starbucks-turns-to-ohio-not-china-for-coffee-mugs.html', 'snippet': 'Starbucks helps bring at least a few jobs back to the United States by hiring a plant in East Liverpool, Ohio, to make its new line of coffee mugs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'EAST LIVERPOOL, Ohio — Not that long ago, this little Ohio River town could call itself the pottery capital of the nation. Some four dozen pottery factories here “set America’s table,” as the locals liked to boast, churning out everything from fine china to chamber pots and employing a large majority of the work force.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Ohio Pottery, a Small Revival', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Ohio Pottery, a Small Revival', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Starbucks Corporation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ceramics and Pottery', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'American Mug and Stein Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ohio', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Labor and Jobs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T22:15:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Stephanie Strom', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Stephanie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Strom', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1efdc7c0-f116-5bf1-8ffc-6ec8edf2d483', 'word_count': 1394, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1efdc7c0-f116-5bf1-8ffc-6ec8edf2d483'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama speaks at a fundraiser in Denver. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000001599895/obama-speaks-in-denver.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama speaks at a fundraiser in Denver. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'President Obama speaks at a fundraiser in Denver. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/08/multimedia/video-stump-obama-cs