as government and rebel forces exchanged fire in and around Homs, leaving civilians to fend for themselves.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/world/middleeast/fears-for-trapped-civilians-as-syria-fighting-continues.html', 'snippet': 'The United Nations and the United States expressed fears that another massacre was pending as government and rebel forces exchanged fire in and around Homs, leaving civilians to fend for themselves.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United Nations reported intense fighting between the Syrian military and opposition forces in multiple locations across Syria on Monday and expressed alarm about civilians trapped in besieged rebel strongholds in the central city of Homs and northwestern village of Al Heffa.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.N. Fears for Syrians Trapped by Fighting', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.N. Fears For Syrians Trapped By Fighting', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Free Syrian Army', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T22:33:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gladstone', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4a8accd4-e763-573c-8076-68b4ba798454', 'word_count': 670, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4a8accd4-e763-573c-8076-68b4ba798454'}, {'abstract': 'Jack Bell of The Times will provide commentary and live analysis of the U.S.-Guatemala World Cup qualifier on June 12 on the Goal blog', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/11/live-coverage-of-u-s-guatemala-on-tuesday/', 'snippet': 'Jack Bell of The Times will provide commentary and live analysis of the U.S.-Guatemala World Cup qualifier on June 12 on the Goal blog', 'lead_paragraph': 'Tuesday night’s World Cup qualifier between the United States and Guatemala (10 p.m. Eastern) is only available on pay per view. (U.S. Soccer is compiling a list of bars that will show the game.) For those who can’t watch, and even those who can, Jack Bell of The Times will provide commentary and live analysis on the Goal blog. Join him, and check back after Tuesday’s game for player ratings.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Coverage of U.S.-Guatemala on Tuesday', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-11T22:36:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6281550b-7c1b-5808-85a9-5169b828952c', 'word_count': 70, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6281550b-7c1b-5808-85a9-5169b828952c'}, {'abstract': 'New albums include Grace Potter and the Nocturnals’ “Lion the Beast the Beat,” Josh Turner’s “Punching Bag” and “Year of the Snake,” from the jazz trio Fly.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/arts/music/new-albums-from-grace-potter-josh-turner-and-fly.html', 'snippet': 'New albums include Grace Potter and the Nocturnals’ “Lion the Beast t