ation': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/04fa66af-cf99-5673-8c50-f38b3f7424c6', 'word_count': 266, 'uri': 'nyt://article/04fa66af-cf99-5673-8c50-f38b3f7424c6'}, {'abstract': 'Law officers surrounded and shot tear gas into a Montgomery house where they believe a man suspected in a deadly shooting Saturday near Auburn University may have fled.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/us/alabama-two-arrested-in-auburn-triple-killing.html', 'snippet': 'Law officers surrounded and shot tear gas into a Montgomery house where they believe a man suspected in a deadly shooting Saturday near Auburn University may have fled.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Law officers on Monday surrounded and shot tear gas into a Montgomery house where they believe Desmonte D. Leonard, suspected of a shooting Saturday that left three people dead and three others wounded near Auburn University, may have fled. No one had emerged by late night. Two other men were arrested earlier in the case. Jeremy S. Thomas was arrested by the Auburn police on Monday and charged with hindering prosecution. Gabriel Thomas was arrested late Sunday by Montgomery police for “providing false information to law enforcement officers.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Alabama: House Swarmed in Search for Suspect', 'kicker': 'National Briefing | South', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Alabama: House Swarmed in Search for Suspect', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Auburn University', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Auburn (Ala)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Leonard, Desmonte D', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ALABAMA', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders and