', 'snippet': 'Wasn’t Europe paying attention when Lehman Brothers imploded? The response to the euro-zone crisis makes you wonder.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a delicious moment in the HBO film “Too Big to Fail” when Christine Lagarde, then France’s minister of finance, calls Hank Paulson, the U.S. Treasury secretary. It’s September 2008, and Lehman Brothers has just imploded after the government refused to bail it out. Panic is in the air.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/nocera-circular/nocera-circular-jumbo-v2.png', 'height': 228, 'width': 228, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/nocera-circular/nocera-circular-superJumbo-v2.png', 'height': 228, 'width': 228, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/nocera-circular/nocera-circular-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/nocera-circular/nocera-circular-thumbStandard-v2.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2014/11/01/opinion/nocera-circular/nocera-circular-thumbLarge-v4.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How Not to Solve a Crisis', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Columnist', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How Not To Solve A Crisis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Too Big to Fail (Movie)