awal Opens Door for 14-Year-Old Competitor', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Golf)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T01:56:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f185e460-e6a1-5c56-a574-08f59d7579a3', 'word_count': 118, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f185e460-e6a1-5c56-a574-08f59d7579a3'}, {'abstract': 'Gay and straight Mormons have begun challenging the church’s leadership on its opposition to homosexuality.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/us/dissent-on-gay-marriage-among-mormons.html', 'snippet': 'Gay and straight Mormons have begun challenging the church’s leadership on its opposition to homosexuality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SALT LAKE CITY — The congregants wore church clothes to the annual gay pride parade here in the heartland of Mormonism. Waving rainbow signs and urging love and acceptance, they marched at the front of the line, vanguards of a new movement of Mormons challenging their church’s staunch opposition to homosexuality.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/us/12mormon1/12mormon1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/12/us/12mormon1/12mormon1-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': '