s and a 40 percent chance of rain: pretty much what one would expect for a Central American country during its wet season.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Expects Tough Game, and Rough Reception, in Guatemala', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T02:09:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Godfrey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Godfrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7c9a4128-9d1e-52ec-9d64-f2191d6b238a', 'word_count': 730, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7c9a4128-9d1e-52ec-9d64-f2191d6b238a'}, {'abstract': 'After falling in the 1990s, the Jewish population of New York City and three suburban counties has rebounded.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2012/06/12/nyregion/growing-jewish-population-especially-in-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'After falling in the 1990s, the Jewish population of New York City and three suburban counties has rebounded.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After falling in the 1990s, the Jewish population of New York City and three suburban counties has rebounded.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Growing Jewish Population, Especially in Brooklyn', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T02:11:30+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'New York', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/2eb3b625-bbc4-558c-8852-cde0f184217f', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/2eb3b625-bbc4-558c-8852-cde0f184217f'}, {'abstract': 'The latest European bailout has not calmed anyone’s nerves, with good reason. The next potential calamity is just days away.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/opinion/now-spain.html', 'snippet': 'The latest European bailout has not calmed anyone’s nerves, with good reason. The next potential calamity is just days away.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two weeks after Prime Minister Mariano Rajoy of Spain vowed “there will be no Spanish banking rescue,” and after days of delay in which Mr. Rajoy pressed European officials for sounder rescue terms, Spain has now joined Greece, Ireland and Portugal as the latest bailout recipient. Catastrophe averted? Hardly. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Now, Spain', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Now, Spain', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Merkel, Angela', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rajoy, Mariano', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Monetary Union', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T02:14:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/8927310f-50b7-57c3-87d2-0a72ba994a19', 'word_count': 598, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8927310f-50b7-57c3-87d2-0a72ba994a19'}, {'abstract': 'There were few policy disagreements between Representative Charles B. Rangel and his primary challengers, but the latter group all agreed it was time for the congressman to go.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/nyregion/at-primary-debate-main-quarrel-is-whether-rangel-should-retire.html', 'snippet': 'There were few policy disagreements between Representative Charles B. Rangel and his primary challengers, but the latter group all agreed it was time for the congressman to go.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Congressman Charles B. Rangel, participating in the first debate of his primary campaign, looked around at his four Democratic challengers on Monday and decided that none of them had made a very good case about why they should replace him.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/nyregion/RANGEL/RANGEL-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'le