s-and-heat-assume-underdog-role.html', 'snippet': 'When Miami fell to the Dallas Mavericks in last year’s N.B.A. finals, it seemed as if the public was gleeful. So much has changed in a year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OKLAHOMA CITY — In a moment of introspection and thoughtfulness, LeBron James was short-circuited by a short circuit. A slight crackle, then silence as the podium microphone sputtered in midsentence.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/sports/YNBA/YNBA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 738, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/sports/YNBA/YNBA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1384, 'width': 997, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/sports/YNBA/YNBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/12/sports/YNBA/YNBA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/sports/YNBA/YNBA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'James and Heat Assume New Role as Underdogs', 'kicker': 'N.B.A. Finals', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'James and Heat Assume New Role as Underdogs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bosh, Chris', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'r