ggling program back into the national spotlight, Spoelstra forged in his mind a template for what the Heat could be: fast, quick, devastating, and – perhaps most important – built around precise spacing and the peerless penetrating abilities of LeBron James and Dwyane Wade.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Bosh Back, Miami Has New Punch', 'kicker': 'Off the Dribble', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Basketball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Battier, Shane', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bosh, Chris', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'James, LeBron', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wade, Dwyane', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Miami Heat', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Oklahoma City Thunder', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Oregon', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T14:38:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Cavan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cavan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e995eb2-8b31-566c-b583-4d7be25ec042', 'word_count': 660, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e995eb2-8b31-566c-b583-4d7be25ec042'}, {'abstract': 'Images from the ninth annual Bishnu Charan Ghosh Cup, which was held at the LAX Radisson in Los Angeles, where the mirrored ballroom became a competitive yoga stadium and runway-like hallways morphed into warm-up rooms for yogis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/06/11/sports/SPTSYOGA0611-480.html', 'snippet