and 59th Streets.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'John Jay College Is Moving Up, Floor by Floor', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Building (Construction)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Travis, Jeremy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'John Jay College of Criminal Justice', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T15:33:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By David W. Dunlap', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'W.', 'lastname': 'Dunlap', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6eda147d-f7e3-53e3-ad0c-e105b89c712c', 'word_count': 252, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6eda147d-f7e3-53e3-ad0c-e105b89c712c'}, {'abstract': 'June 12, 2012 - A battery breakthrough for electric cars... perhaps. ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/business/100000001601113/a-possible-battery-breakthrough.html', 'snippet': 'June 12, 2012 - A battery breakthrough for electric cars... perhaps. ', 'lead_paragraph': 'June 12, 2012 - A battery breakthrough for electric cars... perhaps. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/12/business/video-bdl-120612-battery/video-bdl-120612-battery-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/12/business/video-bdl-120612-battery/video-bdl-120612-battery-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'capt