 from age 2 to 10 in Venezuela.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — When pitcher Freddy Garcia left the Yankees to attend the funeral of his grandfather Victor, he was doing more than paying his respects to a family member. For Garcia, his grandfather was like a second father.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Garcia Recalls Grandfather Who Taught Him to Play', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garcia, Freddy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T20:08:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Waldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Waldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8e98c859-1af9-509e-8185-7e4b8a650cae', 'word_count': 246, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8e98c859-1af9-509e-8185-7e4b8a650cae'}, {'abstract': 'Cybill Shepherd and Kristin Davis will make their Broadway debuts in the political drama, which is slated to run until Sept. 9.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/12/best-man-looks-to-tv-in-electing-new-cast-members/', 'snippet': 'Cybill Shepherd and Kristin Davis will make their Broadway debuts in the political drama, which is slated to run until Sept. 9.', 'lead_paragraph': ' With four main actors scheduled to depart the show in July, the Broadway revival of “Gore Vidal’s The Best Man” is turning to some notable television stars as replacements, in hopes they will help sell tickets to the tourists who dominate New York theater audiences in summertime.', 'print_section'