e', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Malters Bring Terroir to the Beer Bottle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Whiskey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Grain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beer', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T21:13:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Andrey Smith', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': 'Andrey', 'lastname': 'Smith', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/39e8704e-896f-57bf-81db-262d51d5fcac', 'word_count': 1311, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39e8704e-896f-57bf-81db-262d51d5fcac'}, {'abstract': 'If you decide to employ a bartender for your next party, here are tips on how to hire one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/dining/past-keg-parties-ready-for-a-bartender.html', 'snippet': 'If you decide to employ a bartender for your next party, here are tips on how to hire one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LAST winter, before we moved, my husband and I decided to toast our neighbors with a farewell cocktail party. We opted for a full bar, not just because we love our friends so much, but because we didn’t want to pack and move boxes of liquor. We figured we could just drink all of it in one shot.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13BARTENDER_SPAN/13BARTENDER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13BARTENDER_SPAN/13BARTENDER-articleLa