e ways that the Small Business Administration could do more to provide working capital to small businesses. Karen Mills, administrator of the S.B.A., requested an opportunity to respond, which we are happy to provide. Here is Ms. Mills’s response:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'S.B.A. Administrator Responds', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mills, Karen', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Clinton Global Initiative', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Small Business Administration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T21:48:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': "By You're the Boss Editors", 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d8e233d9-9569-52cf-83eb-6653acee146f', 'word_count': 565, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d8e233d9-9569-52cf-83eb-6653acee146f'}, {'abstract': 'Now in its fifth year, the Red Hook Jazz Festival exists contentedly on the margins, like its namesake neighborhood and much of the music on its bill.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/06/12/arts/music/20120613-REDHOOK.html', 'snippet': 'Now in its fifth year, the Red Hook Jazz Festival exists contentedly on the margins, like its namesake neighborhood and much of the music on its bill.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now in its fifth year, the Red Hook Jazz Festival exists contentedly on the margins, like its namesake neighborhood and much of the music on its bill.', 'source': 'The New York Times', '