ike Travis Sullivan’s Bjorkestra, Hot Cup Chili Pepper 7 and the Flail.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/arts/music/red-hook-jazz-festival-at-urban-meadow-in-brooklyn.html', 'snippet': 'On Sunday Red Hook Jazz Festival, at the Urban Meadow community garden in Brooklyn, featured groups like Travis Sullivan’s Bjorkestra, Hot Cup Chili Pepper 7 and the Flail.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Hot Cup Chili Pepper 7 had just barreled through a tune called “Turkey Foot Corner” at the Red Hook Jazz Festival on Sunday afternoon when some outside noise piped up, distracting but altogether fitting. It was the rickety jingle of an ice cream truck parked next to the Urban Meadow community garden in Brooklyn, which adjoins a playground and serves as the festival site.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/arts/13redhook/13redhook-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/13/arts/13redhook/13redhook-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/arts/13redhook/13redhook-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 723, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/arts/13redhook/13redhook-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1447, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/arts/13redhook/13redhook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/13/arts/13redhook/13redhook-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/arts/13redhook/13redhook-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Festival of Reveling, Unhindered by Restraint', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Festival Of Reveling, Unhindered By Restraint', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Red Hook (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Jazz', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-12T21:50:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Chinen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Chinen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/19d4a2d8-436c-5ad1-90a4-e4a4618f237d', 'word_count': 639, 'uri': 'nyt://article/19d4a2d8-436c-5ad1-90a4-e4a4618f237d'}, {'abstract': 'Childhood nostalgia, machismo, plus a dash of stick-it-to-the-man: this sums up the attitude behind ABV Wine Bar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/dining/reviews/abv-wine-bar-in-manhattan-hungry-city.html', 'snippet': 'Childhood nostalgia, machismo, plus a dash of stick-it-to-the-man: this sums up the attitude behind ABV Wine Bar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LET it be remembered: In the year 2012, the foie gras fluffernutter entered history. There it is on your table at ABV Wine Bar, seared duck liver laid out on Wonder Bread like a sacrifice, over broad Rothko brush strokes of marshmallow fluff and peanut butter, amid drifts of hazelnut crumble and demi-orbs of sour-apple gelée ($17). It is caviar and Bud, Jane Austen and zombies, Blair Waldorf and Dan Humphrey.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 733, 'width': 1100, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/dining/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN/13HUNGRYABV_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 100, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Like Princess Grace at a Roadside Bar', 'kicker': 'Hungry City', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Like Princess Grace at a Roadside Bar', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'k