ntly and in even larger quantities.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Russia, Soviet Style', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Russia, Soviet Style', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Putin, Vladimir V', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Russia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests, and Riots', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clinton, Hillary Rodham', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T00:54:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/c8e5937e-e529-51a3-a50f-52416f4513bf', 'word_count': 355, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c8e5937e-e529-51a3-a50f-52416f4513bf'}, {'abstract': 'Tough talk on immigration issues by Republicans risks alienating some voters, evangelical leaders say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/us/politics/evangelical-groups-call-for-new-stance-on-illegal-immigration.html', 'snippet': 'Tough talk on immigration issues by Republicans risks alienating some voters, evangelical leaders say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Some of the nation’s most influential evangelical groups urged a solution to illegal immigration on Tuesday that defies the harsh rhetoric of the Republican primary race, which continues to undermine Mitt Romney’s appeal to Hispanic voter