e Rays, snapping a three-game losing streak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. — The Mets’ cathartic 11-2 victory over the Tampa Bay Rays here on Tuesday seemed to unfold as one long, collective sigh of relief.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/METS/METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/METS/METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1414, 'width': 1018, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/METS/METS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mets Win an Easy One for a Change', 'kicker': 'Mets 11, Rays 2', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Offense Helps Mets Win Easy One for a Change', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tampa Bay Rays', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T02:46:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7fc52b8f-fa53-5a29-8b4a-cb62a0d8ee92', 'word_count': 790, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7fc52b8f-fa53-5a29-8b4a-cb62a0d8ee92'}, {'abstract': 'Alex Rodriguez’s bases-loaded homer in the eighth tied the score at 4-4 and gave him a share of first place on the career grand slam list with Lou Gehrig in the Yankees’ win in Atlanta.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/sports/baseball/rodriguez-matches-gehrig-with-23-grand-slams-in-yanks-win-over-braves.html', 'snippet': 'Alex Rodriguez’s bases-loaded homer in the eighth tied the score at 4-4 and gave him a share of first place on the career grand slam list with Lou Gehrig in the Yankees’ win in Atlanta.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ATLANTA — As well as the Yankees have played this month, the one bothersome aspect of their game has been their inability to hit with the bases loaded. That even applied to Alex Rodriguez who, despite being one of the most productive hitters ever with the bases full, has struggled terribly in those situations this season.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/YANKEESfloater/YANKEESfloater-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 951, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/YANKEESfloater/YANKEESfloater-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1977, 'width': 1836, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/sports/YANKEESfloater/YAN