ed number of people on the ground. Then on Friday, the runway lights failed at the airport in the Nigerian capital of Abuja. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Airborne Tales of Fistfights, Diuretics and Crooning Pilots', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'AIRLINES AND AIRPLANES', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Aviation Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pilots', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nossiter, Adam', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Aeroflot Russian Airlines', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Baghdad (Iraq)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lagos (Nigeria)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Moscow (Russia)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Nigeria', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T04:53:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The International Herald Tribune', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The International Herald Tribune'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f99283fb-d7e7-532e-beb2-f3c45653ebec', 'word_count': 426, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f99283fb-d7e7-532e-beb2-f3c45653ebec'}, {'abstract': 'Street fighting broke out between Polish and Russian soccer fans ahead of a Euro 2012 match.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/soccer-fans-from-poland-and-russia-clash-ahead-of-euro-2012-match/', 'snippet': 'Street fighting broke out between Polish and Russian soccer fans ahead of a Euro 2012 match.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Centuries of enmity between Poland and Russia manifested in bloody clashes between soccer fans on the streets of Warsaw on Tuesday hours before