ords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Solar Energy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T11:00:01+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Interactive Feature', '_id': 'nyt://interactive/c0cb8acb-f070-5370-9ba1-08ec5b31812c', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://interactive/c0cb8acb-f070-5370-9ba1-08ec5b31812c'}, {'abstract': 'On Wednesday the Yankees will face Brandon Beachy, who is leading the National League in earned run average but never aspired to pitch and was never drafted.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/aspiring-hitter-finds-a-home-on-the-mound/', 'snippet': 'On Wednesday the Yankees will face Brandon Beachy, who is leading the National League in earned run average but never aspired to pitch and was never drafted.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Brandon Beachy, the Atlanta Braves right-hander who faces the Yankees on Wednesday night, did not grow up hoping to lead the National League in earned run average. He is doing that now, with a 1.98 mark, but Beachy mostly wanted to hit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aspiring Hitter Finds a Home on the Mound', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beachy, Brandon', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Atlanta Braves', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T11:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/86ed6b34-44fd-553a-8d6f-cac9f861b602', 'word_count': 583, 'uri': 'nyt://article/86ed6b34-44fd-553a-8d6f-cac9f861b602'}, {'abstract': 'It takes a creative and determined buyer to purchase a small business in today’s lending environment.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/using-your-401k-to-buy-a-small-business/', 'snippet': 'It takes a creative and determined buyer to purchase a small business in today’s lending environment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It takes a creative and determined buyer to purchase a small business in today’s lending environment. If there’s any doubt that small-business lending has yet to recover in any meaningful way, look no further than Ami Kassar’s new contribution to this blog: Searching for Capital. While frozen credit markets have made it difficult for small businesses to get loans for expansion and working capital, they have also had a major impact on the business-for-sale marketplace.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Using Your 401(k) to Buy a Small Business', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': '401(k), 403(b) and 457 Plans', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Individual Retirement Accounts', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Small Business Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T11:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Entrepreneurship', 'byline': {'original': 'By Barbara Taylor', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Barbara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Taylor', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/81edc858-71a2-57f2-ba61-6f084c27d967', 'word_count': 880, 'uri': 'nyt://article/81edc858-71a2-57f2-ba61-6f084c27d967'}, {'abstract': 'The desktop interface, called “windows, icons, menus, pointer,” or WIMP, never seemed to work for most people. What has worked in intuitive computing is iOS, which continues to make its way onto the desktop.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/thankfully-desktop-computers-start-to-look-more-like-smartphones/', 'snippet': 'The desktop interface, called “windows, icons, menus, pointer,” or WIMP, never seemed to work for most people. What has worked in intuitive computing is iOS, which continues to make its way onto the desktop.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you’re an experienced computer user, you probably remember explaining to newbies how a desktop computer worked: Your photos should go in this folder; your documents in that one. You will need to use this application to open that image; that application to open this document.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Desktop Computers Look More and More Like Smartphones', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mobile Touches On the Desktop', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Desktop Computers', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPhone', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T11:11:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/628fc972-99dc-56d4-8951-1a73de51823c', 'word_count': 387, 'uri': 'nyt://article/628fc972-99dc-56d4-8951-1a73de51823c'}, {'abstract': 'Airlines in the region are expected to generate profits of $2 billion this year, far more than those of any other region, and new airlines are popping up at a faster pace than ever before.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/business/global/asia-pacific-region-is-fertile-ground-for-low-cost-airlines.html', 'snippet': 'Airlines in the region are expected to generate profits of $2 billion this year, far more than those of any other region, and new airlines are popping up at a faster pace than ever before.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SINGAPORE — The airline industry is suffering from global economic turmoil. But people like Kelvin Mok, who just graduated from college in Hong Kong, are helping to ensure that in Asia, at least, the sector is continuing to grow.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/business/Air/Air-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/14/business/Air/Air-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/business/Air/Air-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 719, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/business/Air/Air-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1437, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy'