655, 'uri': 'nyt://article/481b80cd-7843-596f-a76e-22b36422bda9'}, {'abstract': 'With nerves — and bank accounts — on edge over the future of the euro and whether leaders will act to reinforce the eurozone, old demons are finding new life.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/subtext-germany-threatens-europe-again/', 'snippet': 'With nerves — and bank accounts — on edge over the future of the euro and whether leaders will act to reinforce the eurozone, old demons are finding new life.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — Stubborn, domineering, downright unfriendly. All the old stereotypes about the Germans are rising to the surface as frustration grows over their refusal to sign what they regard as a blank check to their less disciplined European neighbors.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/blogs/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/blogs/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/blogs/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/13/blogs/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/13/blogs/merkel-germany-subtext-rdv/merkel-germany-subtex