url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/13/for-a-new-teacher-a-soldiers-lessons-on-helping-veterans-fit-in/', 'snippet': 'A veteran, freelance war photographer and creative writing teacher finds a way, through the experience of another soldier, to recognize, but not single out, the students in his class who have served.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The “Tower Guard” invitation arrived after Kent Dell finished up his freshman year at Michigan State University in 2011. It came with other academic junk mail he easily tossed aside — “Join this honor society, or that one. And send us $80,” Mr. Dell said. But his wife, Kolina, already an M.S.U. graduate, knew what the Tower Guard represented, even if her husband didn’t. “You should accept this invitation,” she told him.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For a New Teacher, a Soldier’s Lessons on Helping Veterans Fit In', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Colleges and Universities', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-13T20:53:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nathan S. Webster', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nathan', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Webster', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/995e8fb7-97f4-5716-8723-1f95909182c7', 'word_count': 1280, 'uri': 'nyt://article/995e8fb7-97f4-5716-8723-1f95909182c7'}, {'abstract': 'Mrs. Romney as a standard-bearer for authenticity, a woman determined to use fashion, when the time seems right, to counter her husband’s image.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/201