r faculty members in town to preside over master classes at the June in Buffalo new-music festival, spoke of agonizing over the concerto for a decade. He still considers the work unfinished, he said, and just last week he spent four hours with the guitarist Eliot Fisk, for whom it was written, tweaking the solo guitar line. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/arts/JUNE/JUNE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/arts/JUNE/JUNE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/arts/JUNE/JUNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/14/arts/JUNE/JUNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/arts/JUNE/JUNE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'New Composers and New Sounds Converge in Buffalo', 'kicker': 'Critic’s Notebook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'New Composers and New Sounds Converge in Buffalo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Buffalo (NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wolfe, Julia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Andriessen, Louis', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, '