kit-eaton.html', 'snippet': 'The new App Smart columnist describes some apps now on his home screen: photography apps, games, and a text translator that may offer a glimpse of the future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Let me tell you a story. Not too many weeks ago my son was doing something adorable and I was deeply focused on filming him with my phone so I could pop it on the social media app Viddy (one of the “Instagram for video” apps that are booming right now) and share his cuteness with the world.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/business/14-SMART1/14-SMART1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 652, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/business/14-SMART1/14-SMART1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1304, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/business/14-SMART1/14-SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/14/business/14-SMART1/14-SMART1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/business/14-SMART1/14-SMART1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Starters, These Are a Few of My Favorite Apps', 'kicker': 'App Smart', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Starters, These Are a Few of My Favorite Apps', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sma