', 'lead_paragraph': 'The United States Tennis Association will spend an estimated $500 million through the coming decade to build a new Louis Armstrong Stadium, a new grandstand on unused land at the Billie Jean King National Tennis Center, and a double-deck viewing area for fans to watch players practice during the United States Open.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/sports/14tennis-1/14tennis-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/sports/14tennis-1/14tennis-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1316, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/sports/14tennis-1/14tennis-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/14/sports/14tennis-1/14tennis-1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/14/sports/14tennis-1/14tennis-1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Tennis Center Could Get New Stadiums (but No Roof)', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Big Plans for Open, but Not for a Roof', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Tennis)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ashe, Arthur, S