ted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a5a4489-762d-5ba3-a6bc-163b633d01f3', 'word_count': 556, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a5a4489-762d-5ba3-a6bc-163b633d01f3'}, {'abstract': 'Andrea Bruce, a freelance photographer for The New York Times and a member of the Noor photo agency , has won the the first Getty Images and Chris Hondros Fund Award. Dominic Bracco II was a finalist.', 'web_url': 'https://lens.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/andrea-bruce-wins-first-chris-hondros-award/', 'snippet': 'Andrea Bruce, a freelance photographer for The New York Times and a member of the Noor photo agency , has won the the first Getty Images and Chris Hondros Fund Award. Dominic Bracco II was a finalist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Updated | June 14, 3:31 p.m.  The slideshow has been appended with photos courtesy of The Washington Post (Slides 6 through 11).', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Andrea Bruce Wins First Chris Hondros Award', 'kicker': 'Lens', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Awards, Decorations and Honors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Heisler, Todd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hetherington, Tim', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hondros, Chris', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty Images', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Times', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-14T12:45:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'By James Estrin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Estrin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': ''