iti', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Politi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/08277e35-0aa5-5826-b99a-9830d1051fd2', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/08277e35-0aa5-5826-b99a-9830d1051fd2'}, {'abstract': 'Metropolitan Diary: Just because someone is down on his luck doesn’t mean he can’t complain about what he eats or drinks.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/eyeing-a-gift-soda/', 'snippet': 'Metropolitan Diary: Just because someone is down on his luck doesn’t mean he can’t complain about what he eats or drinks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dear Diary: My meeting included a small setup of waters and soft drinks and ended at about 5:30 on a hot afternoon. I had to get across town, and walked down Fifth Avenue and then west on 42nd alongside Bryant Park.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Eyeing a Gift Soda', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Awaking to a Masked Visitor, and Other Reader Tales', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beggars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soft Drinks', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bryant Park (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-14T12:53:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bryan A. McKenna', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bryan', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'McKenna', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99d29f4a-fcda-53a4-83ad-fb2c7718027b', 'word_count': 170, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99d29f4a-fcda-53a4-83ad-fb2c7718027b'}, {'abs