ickly with the grouping of Tiger Woods, Phil Mickelson and Bubba Watson among the first to tee off.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. Open: Thompson Leads After First Round', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Golf)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McIlroy, Rory', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Golf Assn', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-14T14:17:53+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/73f32420-a5b1-551f-8441-daddc5a15405', 'word_count': 3821, 'uri': 'nyt://article/73f32420-a5b1-551f-8441-daddc5a15405'}, {'abstract': 'A judge ruled that a group aligned with the oil and gas industry lacked the standing to legally challenge New York’s participation in the Regional Greenhouse Gas Initiative.', 'web_url': 'https://green.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/challenge-to-carbon-trading-fails/', 'snippet': 'A judge ruled that a group aligned with the oil and gas industry lacked the standing to legally challenge New York’s participation in the Regional Greenhouse Gas Initiative.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A New York State Supreme Court justice has dismissed a lawsuit that sought to end New York’s participation in the multIstate carbon trading system known as the Regional Greenhouse Gas Initiative, or RGGI.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Challenge to New York’s Carbon Trading Fails', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [