59a7-b6b4-c61b56b922ff', 'word_count': 655, 'uri': 'nyt://article/55aa096b-5abc-59a7-b6b4-c61b56b922ff'}, {'abstract': 'Jeep Cherokee and Liberty models from certain model years were added to the investigation, which was opened by the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration in August 2010. The investigation applies to 5.1 million vehicles.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/government-expands-investigation-into-fire-risk-of-jeep-grand-cherokee/', 'snippet': 'Jeep Cherokee and Liberty models from certain model years were added to the investigation, which was opened by the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration in August 2010. The investigation applies to 5.1 million vehicles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'More than five million Jeep vehicles are under federal scrutiny after a preliminary investigation revealed an uncommonly high occurrence of fires, some of them deadly, when the vehicles were rear-ended in crashes.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Government Expands Investigation Into Fire Risk of Jeep Grand Cherokee', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Center for Auto Safety', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jeep Division of Chrysler', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Highway Traffic Safety Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-14T17:31:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Schultz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schultz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'ran