0702', 'word_count': 30, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29c90b6b-dc28-5f36-a94c-a9c1babd0702'}, {'abstract': 'Al Pacino will play Shelly “The Machine” Levene in a coming Broadway revival of David Mamet’s “Glengarry Glen Ross.”', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/pacino-and-a-theater-confirmed-for-glengarry-revival/', 'snippet': 'Al Pacino will play Shelly “The Machine” Levene in a coming Broadway revival of David Mamet’s “Glengarry Glen Ross.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Confirming a Times report on Tuesday, Al Pacino will star as Shelly Levene, known as “the Machine,” in a Broadway revival of David Mamet’s “Glengarry Glen Ross,” the producers of the show announced on Thursday. Mr. Mamet’s Pulitzer Prize-winning dark comedy about salesmen in a Chicago real estate office, is to begin previews on Oct. 16 at the Gerald Schoenfeld Theater on West 45th Street, with opening night scheduled for Nov. 11. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Pacino and a Theater Confirmed for ‘Glengarry’ Revival', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Footnote', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Glengarry Glen Ross (Play)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frankel, Jerry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mamet, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pacino, Al', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Richards, Jeffrey', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-14T18:34:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Erik Piepenburg', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Erik', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Piepenburg', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5dd06a69-e3cd-57bf-b297-b99720affc3e', 'word_count': 147, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5dd06a69-e3cd-57bf-b297-b99720affc3e'}, {'abstract': 'The BMX track in the Olympic Park in London was built with dirt from the site.', 'web_url': 'https://london2012.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/know-that-venue-bmx-track/', 'snippet': 'The BMX track in the Olympic Park in London was built with dirt from the site.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Making its second Olympic appearance, BMX biking is scheduled for the Olympic Park in August. The track was built with more than 14,000 cubic meters of soil reused from the site. Because the area previously had been highly polluted, the dirt had to be washed, sieved and then shaken free of contaminants like oil, tar, cyanide, arsenic and lead as well as some very low-level radioactive material.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Know That Venue: BMX Track', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bicycle Motocross', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-14T18:42:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Samantha Storey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Samantha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Storey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/de600493-93c2-501b-9102-7fae351808b3', 'word_count': 80, 'uri': 'nyt://article/de600493-93c2-501b-9102-7fae351808b3'}, {'abstract': 'Bags, bangles, baubles and more from the resort shows.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slidesho