e highest-level contact between the two countries since relations were nearly severed after Iranian students stormed the British Embassy in Tehran in November.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/world/middleeast/officials-from-iran-and-britain-discuss-diplomatic-rift.html', 'snippet': 'The meeting was the highest-level contact between the two countries since relations were nearly severed after Iranian students stormed the British Embassy in Tehran in November.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The foreign ministers of Britain and Iran conferred on the sidelines of a security conference in Afghanistan on Thursday, the highest-level contact between the two nations since relations were nearly severed after protesters in Tehran overran and pillaged the British Embassy and a diplomatic residence in November.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'British and Iranian Officials Meet to Discuss Rift', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'British and Iranian Officials Meet to Discuss Diplomatic Rift', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hague, William', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Salehi, Ali Akbar', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Embargoes and Economic Sanctions', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Nuclear Weapons', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T02:18:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rick Gladstone', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rick', 'middl