, a double bogey and a bogey on the first three holes of the United States Open.', 'web_url': 'https://onpar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/14/14-year-old-struggles-in-opening-rounds/', 'snippet': 'Andy Zhang, a 14-year-old, got off to an inauspicious start with a triple bogey, a double bogey and a bogey on the first three holes of the United States Open.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Andy Zhang, a 14-year-old, got off to an inauspicious start to the United States Open with a triple bogey, a double bogey and a bogey on the first three holes. He was eight over after five before playing his final 13 holes in one over to post a 79, one stroke worse than the reigning Masters champion, Bubba Watson.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '14-Year-Old Struggles in Opening Rounds', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Golf)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zhang, Andy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T02:38:42+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a106ddf4-9f09-5852-9ac1-fd96903a9ad4', 'word_count': 277, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a106ddf4-9f09-5852-9ac1-fd96903a9ad4'}, {'abstract': 'In recent off-season workouts, the Giants have used heart-rate monitors, G.P.S. devices and hydration/nutrition monitoring as training tools to better evaluate players.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/sports/football/new-york-giants-add-technology-to-workouts.html', 'snippet': 'In recent 