tsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/jeremy-jordan-added-to-cast-of-nbcs-smash/', 'snippet': 'Jeremy Jordan, a Tony Award nominee for his lead role in “Newsies the Musical,” will join “Smash” in Season 2 as a character described as “Sexy, charismatic, musically gifted, but also self-destructive and remote.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Extra, extra! Hey, look at the headline! By night (and on matinee days), Jeremy Jordan is a Broadway star playing the leader of a feisty gang of turn-of-the-20th-century newspaper boys. Now, by day and in whatever free time he has left, he’ll be playing one of the aspiring Broadway stars hoping to hit it big in a developing musical about the life of Marilyn Monroe on “Smash.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Jeremy Jordan Added to Cast of NBC’s ‘Smash’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Jeremy Jordan Is Added to Cast of ‘Smash’', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tony Awards (Theater Awards)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jordan, Jeremy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T12:54:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85e36c1d-803e-59dd-96cb-7c0dcb85fb9c', 'word_count': 214, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85e36c1d-803e-59dd-96cb-7c0dcb85fb9c'}, {'abstract': 'A Central St. Martins alum creates a collection that is a small, confident tour de force of taste and technique.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/werk-ing-girl-edeline-lee/', 'snippet': 'A Central St. Martins alum creates a collection that is a small, confident tour de force of taste and technique.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Werk-ing Girl | Edeline Lee', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T13:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nancy MacDonell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nancy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacDonell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38969a4b-ac70-54e9-a1be-30e3ddbcfd9f', 'word_count': 402, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38969a4b-ac70-54e9-a1be-30e3ddbcfd9f'}, {'abstract': 'Egypt’s military rulers moved to consolidate power before the presidential runoff election, shutting down the Islamist-led Parliament and seizing the sole right to issue laws.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/16/world/middleeast/blow-to-transition-as-court-dissolves-egypts-parliament.html', 'snippet': 'Egypt’s military rulers moved to consolidate power before the presidential runoff election, shutting down the Islamist-led Parliament and seizing the sole right to issue laws.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Egypt’s military rulers moved to consolidate power Friday on the eve of the presidential runoff election, shutting down the Islamist-led Parliament, locking out lawmakers and seizing the sole right to issue laws even after a new head of state takes office.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia':