rson': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Parker-Pope', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a4987d87-2182-5d2a-9702-484eaf35afc2', 'word_count': 24, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a4987d87-2182-5d2a-9702-484eaf35afc2'}, {'abstract': 'At home, dads are more involved than ever. So why is it that all the disputes about parenting are by, for and about women?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2012/06/15/what-about-dad/', 'snippet': 'At home, dads are more involved than ever. So why is it that all the disputes about parenting are by, for and about women?', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What About Dad?', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T15:41:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/abfcea7d-a233-5267-812b-460fa8928134', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/abfcea7d-a233-5267-812b-460fa8928134'}, {'abstract': 'After a dramatic win over Oregon, the Kent State Golden Flashes are in the College World Series for the first time.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/a-first-for-the-golden-flashes/', 'snippet': 'After a dramatic win over Oregon, the Kent State Golden Flashes are in the College World Series for the first time.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s been a dramatic and exciting season for the Kent State baseball team, and it’s not over yet. The Golden Flashes are one of this year’s Cinderella teams in the College World Series, which starts Friday in Omaha. Kent State (46-18) is scheduled to play on Saturday against Arkansas (43-20).', 'source': 'The New York Times', '