': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0b56515f-7368-5950-b26c-26cdde6428ae', 'word_count': 1097, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0b56515f-7368-5950-b26c-26cdde6428ae'}, {'abstract': 'When a pet owner is heading out of town, Spotwag wants to help people find friends to look after their furry friends using Facebook and Twitter.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/spotwag-helps-facebook-friends-find-pet-sitters/', 'snippet': 'When a pet owner is heading out of town, Spotwag wants to help people find friends to look after their furry friends using Facebook and Twitter.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you have a pet and you travel a lot, you know how difficult it can be to find someone to look after your furry buddy. Asking a friend, and then trying to give them money for their troubles, is often a pretty awkward affair.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Spotwag Helps Facebook Friends Find Pet Sitters', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cats', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dogs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T17:56:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nick Bilton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bilton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc412865-5b40-5800-a561-3c694ed6b8ee', 'word_count': 429, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc412865-5b4