ction of Brooklyn, is\xa0 to close for an unspecified period of time, the site’s programmer, Aaron Hillis, announced in an email this week. With the subject line “Farewell to reRun Gastropub Theater,” Mr. Hillis wrote that he would be stepping down from curating films there and that the owner, Jason Stevens, would temporarily shut the space to revamp it for “whatever its next incarnation will be.”', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'ReRun Gastropub Theater to Close', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'ReRun Gastropub Theater Makes Plans to Close', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bars', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Dumbo (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T18:04:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fc135e8f-bfbe-56e7-873c-b60844543201', 'word_count': 159, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc135e8f-bfbe-56e7-873c-b60844543201'}, {'abstract': 'Rachel Swarns’s “American Tapestry” is a close look at the family history of Michelle Obama over several generations.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/book-review-podcast-the-first-ladys-family/', 'snippet': 'Rachel Swarns’s “American Tapestry” is a close look at the family history of Michelle Obama over several generations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the New York Times Book Review, Edward Ball reviews Rachel Swarns’s “American Tapestry,” an intricate look into the family history of Michelle Obama. The book, which includes what 