5-86da-bf744d5a0660'}, {'abstract': 'On a trip to Sweden’s capital, the author used local bloggers and “soulmates” to shape his itinerary. So, how’d it go?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/travel/stockholm-and-the-strangers-who-brought-me-there.html', 'snippet': 'On a trip to Sweden’s capital, the author used local bloggers and “soulmates” to shape his itinerary. So, how’d it go?', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE view was peerless but not pierless. I was sitting on the patio of the chic Hotel Skeppsholmen, which, located on an island in the middle of Stockholm, seems to embody all that’s good about a city that is roughly one-third water and one-third green space. I could see lawn, palisades, boats and ferries, very few tourists, Northern Europe’s best-preserved medieval city, an amusement park built in 1883, important shrubbery, ducks.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/travel/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 450, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/17/travel/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 450}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/travel/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/travel/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1534, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/travel/17STOCKHOLM_SPAN/17STOCKHOL