er.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/16/theater/reviews/we-play-for-the-gods-at-cherry-lane-theater.html', 'snippet': 'A quest for men who cry easily in “We Play for the Gods,” from the Women’s Theater Project, at the Cherry Lane Theater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The title of “We Play for the Gods,” a slight production from the Women’s Theater Project, comes from Ellen Stewart, the founder of La MaMa, who died last year. “We play for the Gods,” Ms. Stewart said, “and in return, they play for us.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/arts/WEPLAY/WEPLAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 960, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/arts/WEPLAY/WEPLAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1989, 'width': 1864, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/arts/WEPLAY/WEPLAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/16/arts/WEPLAY/WEPLAY-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/arts/WEPLAY/WEPLAY-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It Took a Village for a Play (7 Writers and 4 Directors)', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It Took a Village for a Play (7 Writers and 4 Directors)', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Golden, Annie', 'rank':