l', 'snippet': 'A couple makes an unconventional toast that finds a following on the Web.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF you’re worried all this Emily Post-style rule-mongering will squeeze the life out of your wedding toast, consider jettisoning the rules entirely to follow the example of Selma and Kenny Furst. The couple, who this year will celebrate their 72nd anniversary, became YouTube sensations this spring when a spirited toast they made for their grandson’s wedding was posted on awkwardfamilyphotos.com. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/17TOASTS2/17TOASTS2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 764, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/17TOASTS2/17TOASTS2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1527, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/17TOASTS2/17TOASTS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/17TOASTS2/17TOASTS2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/17TOASTS2/17TOASTS2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Breaking All the Rules', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Breaking All the Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'nam