 'nyt://slideshow/a445d17a-89b9-5221-a34d-a7f5ca1def49'}, {'abstract': 'Many automakers are unconvinced that Americans will respond to the tiny models that swarm the streets of Berlin and Shanghai. Add the terrific VW Up to the list of cars that we won’t see here.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/automobiles/autoreviews/volkswagen-up-just-passing-through-impressively.html', 'snippet': 'Many automakers are unconvinced that Americans will respond to the tiny models that swarm the streets of Berlin and Shanghai. Add the terrific VW Up to the list of cars that we won’t see here.', 'lead_paragraph': 'YOU might assume, on the petite heels of the Mini Cooper, that car companies would be amassing an army of Lilliputian cars to sell here. But consider the Volkswagen Up, AWOL from our shores.', 'print_section': 'AU', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/automobiles/17WHEEL1/17WHEEL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/17/automobiles/17WHEEL1/17WHEEL1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/automobiles/17WHEEL1/17WHEEL1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 494, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/automobiles/17WHEEL1/17WHEEL1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 987, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/automobiles/17WHEEL1/17WHEEL1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStan