'Lowrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a0314e6-be7f-5f5c-bb2c-a043ab9430cb', 'word_count': 756, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6a0314e6-be7f-5f5c-bb2c-a043ab9430cb'}, {'abstract': 'Barry didn’t need to hear eulogies from his kids. He knew everything about them, including how much he was loved.', 'web_url': 'https://parenting.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/15/remembering-a-dad-and-the-little-things/', 'snippet': 'Barry didn’t need to hear eulogies from his kids. He knew everything about them, including how much he was loved.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My friend Barry just lost a three-year battle with a rare form of lung cancer, the kind you can get even if you’ve never smoked. My grandmother used to say that every person’s life is a novel waiting to be written. In their eulogies, Barry’s children told his story, and the beauty of it was in all the things I didn’t know about Barry, the little things.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Remembering a Dad, and the Little Things', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-15T22:41:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harley A. Rotbart', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harley', 'middlename': 'A.', 'lastname': 'Rotbart', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/973568d6-d239-587e-acb4-594b0b74bdab', 'word_count': 721, 'uri': 'nyt://article/973568d6-d239-587e-acb4-594b0b74bdab'}, {'abstract': 'Many automakers are unconvinced that Americans will respond to the tiny models that swarm the streets of Berlin and Shanghai. Add the terrific VW Up to the list of those cars that we won’t see here.', '