-chris-brown-flying-bottles-and-ice.html', 'snippet': 'A fight this week involving Chris Brown and Drake, which the police are still investigating, stood out in its weapons of choice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The melee bore the marks of storied New York nightclub brawls of yore: star rappers were involved, egos were bruised and revelers got bloodied. But this week’s altercation involving the R&B crooner Chris Brown and the rap artist Drake stands apart in the weapons of choice: it did not, by most accounts, involve guns or knives, but rather airborne cubes of ice, cocktail glasses and high-priced bottles of liquor.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/nyregion/BRAWL/BRAWL-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/16/nyregion/BRAWL/BRAWL-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/nyregion/BRAWL/BRAWL-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/nyregion/BRAWL/BRAWL-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/nyregion/BRAWL/BRAWL-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/16/nyregion/BRAWL/BRAWL-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/nyregion/BRAWL/BRAWL-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 100, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Celebrity Brawl at Club, a Scene of Flying Bottles and Ice Cubes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Celebrity Brawl at Club, a Scene of Flying Bottles and Ice Cubes', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Chris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'NIGHTCLUBS AND CABARETS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'WiP (Manhattan, NY, Nightclub)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Drake', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-16T00:53:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Cara Buckley', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Cara', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buckley', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/99ed3130-18b6-5a3d-8130-5861f0e0ad34', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/99ed3130-18b6-5a3d-8130-5861f0e0ad34'}, {'abstract': 'With a clutch birdie on the last hole, Phil Mickelson gave himself some much-needed breathing room near the cut line, shooting a 71 on Friday’s second round play.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/16/sports/golf/us-open-second-round-notebook.html', 'snippet': 'With a clutch birdie on the last hole, Phil Mickelson gave himself some much-needed breathing room near the cut line, shooting a 71 on Friday’s second round play.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — With a clutch birdie on the last hole of his second round, Phil Mickelson gave himself some much-needed breathing room. Not at the top of the leader board, mind you, but at the bottom, 