 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/16/opinion/a-step-toward-a-dream.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama’s bold move opens the future for young immigrants who are here illegally through no fault of their own.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Obama administration’s decision to allow as many as 800,000 young immigrants avoid deportation and apply for work permits makes perfect sense. It wisely rescues blameless young people from legal limbo in an immigration system marked by dysfunction and toxic politics. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Step Toward a Dream', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Step Toward a Dream', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dream Act (Development, Relief and Education for Minors Act)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deportation', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-16T01:32:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4833c05-598e-5ed3-8ff4-8ecbe31bc251', 'word_count': 574, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4833c05-598e-5ed3-8ff4-8ecbe31bc251'}, {'abstract': 'The leash-free walks of an 11-year-old Australian cattle dog prompted complaints, an online petition of support and a City Council meeting that drew crowds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/16/us/in-new-mexico-a-city-divies-and-unites-for-a-dog