final rounds.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/16/sports/golf/top-ranked-donald-exits-the-us-open.html', 'snippet': 'Top-ranked golfer Luke Donald finished Friday’s second round of the United States Open at 11 over par, a score that eliminated him from this weekend’s final rounds.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — For a couple of years now, as each major golf championship concludes, Luke Donald can predict the immediate future. He knows that within 10 minutes he will face one specific question — and it will not be how it feels to be the world’s No. 1-ranked ranked golfer.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/sports/CUT/CUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/16/sports/CUT/CUT-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/sports/CUT/CUT-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/sports/CUT/CUT-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1201, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/sports/CUT/CUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/16/sports/CUT/CUT-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/sports/CUT/CUT-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150