article/6305b560-c909-52fc-9a2d-7942252a5792', 'word_count': 1001, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6305b560-c909-52fc-9a2d-7942252a5792'}, {'abstract': 'The Cardinals’ Lance Lynn struck out 12 White Sox while allowing three hits in seven and a third shutout innings last Wednesday, matching R. A. Dickey for the National League lead in victories, with 10.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/16/lynn-having-a-breakout-year-for-cardinals/', 'snippet': 'The Cardinals’ Lance Lynn struck out 12 White Sox while allowing three hits in seven and a third shutout innings last Wednesday, matching R. A. Dickey for the National League lead in victories, with 10.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In all the pitching excitement last Wednesday, when the Giants’ Matt Cain fired a perfect game and the Mets’ R. A. Dickey tossed a one-hitter, it was easy to miss Lance Lynn of the St. Louis Cardinals. Lynn struck out 12 White Sox while allowing three hits in seven and a third shutout innings, matching Dickey for the National League lead in victories, with 10.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lynn Having a Breakout Year for the Cardinals', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Extra Bases: A Breakout for a Cardinal', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'St Louis Cardinals', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-16T16:35:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0c76c8b3-3628-5fe0-81e9-e04c38b435b4', 'word_count': 455, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0c76c8b3-3628-5fe0-81e9-e04c38b435b4'}, {'abstract': 'The plan will include measures to prevent bank runs and push for the repeal of regulations that hinder competition, keep young people out of the work force or make it difficult to start businesses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/world/europe/european-leaders-present-plan-to-quell-euro-zone-crisis.html', 'snippet': 'The plan will include measures to prevent bank runs and push for the repeal of regulations that hinder competition, keep young people out of the work force or make it difficult to start businesses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The head of the European Central Bank and other euro zone leaders worked on Saturday on a grand vision for the euro zone meant to reassure investors and allies that flaws in the currency union will be addressed quickly.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'European Leaders to Present Plan to Quell the Crisis Quickly', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'European Leaders to Present Plan to Quickly Quell the Crisis', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Draghi, Mario', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Monetary Union', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Central Bank', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'European Union', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-16T16:40:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jack Ewing', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jack', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ewing', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/db1fcec7-33cb-5ef9-9a90-5e05ac459823', 'word_count': 872, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db1fcec7-33cb-5ef9-9a90-5e05ac459823'}, {'abstract': 'Too much debate has focused on textbook remedies to the nation’s economic troubles, and not enough on how Americans have lost faith in political solutions to problems.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/business/broken-trust-takes-time-to-mend-economic-view.html', 'snippet': 'Too much debate has focused on textbook remedies to the nation’s economic troubles, and not enough on how Americans have lost faith in political solutions to problems.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PRESIDENT OBAMA caused a stir recently when he said that “the private sector is doing fine” and pinned many of the nation’s economic troubles on a decline in public-sector employment. He cited some interesting numbers, but he didn’t draw the right lesson — namely, that America is witnessing a collapse of trust in politics, including the shaping of its broad economic policy. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/business/17-VIEW/17-VIEW-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/business/17-VIEW/17-VIEW-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/business/17-VIEW/17-VIEW-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 