orth watching, from many points of view — some even relevant to Formula One.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/blogs/lemans-rdv/lemans-rdv-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/16/blogs/lemans-rdv/lemans-rdv-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'F1 on Pause for 24 Hours … of Le Mans', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Indianapolis 500 (Auto Race)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Le Mans Auto Race', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'PlayStation (Video Game System)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kristensen, Tom', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Formula One', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Toyota Motor Corporation', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-16T20:21:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brad Spurgeon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brad', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Spurgeon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9ba09093-3aa3-5105-a68f-d4733ba9a4de', 'word_count': 548, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9ba09093-3aa3-5105-a68f-d4733ba9a4de'}, {'abstract': 'A medley of overlooked international gems.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/opinion/sunday/this-week-at-film-forum.html', 'snippet': 'A medley of overlooked international gems.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The Terrible Elbows” (1965, Georges Millefeux) Determined to improve his station, Claude LeFevre — a heavy-lidded pickpocket from the wrong side of the tracks — hatches a reckless plot to seize the tracks and move them 200 yards to the right. While hurrying across the Pont Neuf, he meets Lulu, an enchanting schoolgirl of 37, when her head gets stuck between the spokes of his bicycle wheel. They quickly become lovers — then rivals, then acquaintances, then paramedics, then lovers once again — in this New Wave romance that dispenses with traditional notions of theme and structure in order to set the world record for jump-cuts.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17LooseEnds/17LooseEnds-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17LooseEnds/17LooseEnds-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17LooseEnds/17LooseEnds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17LooseEnds/17LooseEnds-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17LooseEnds/17LooseEnds-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'This Week at Film Forum', 'kicker': 'L