ughts-on-fathers-and-families.html', 'snippet': 'Terry performed many jobs around our place but none more important, or better executed, than filling the aching void left by our father’s inaccessibility.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A FEW years ago, while I was preparing to write a memoir about my father, I spent time looking through old photographs. One in particular, which I hadn’t seen in years, caught my attention. It’s not a typical family portrait. But by mid-20th-century America’s stingy definition, we weren’t a typical family. ', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17Styron/17Styron-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17Styron/17Styron-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17Styron/17Styron-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17Styron/17Styron-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1390, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17Styron/17Styron-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/17/sunday-review/17Styron/17Styron-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sun