': 'nyt://article/fc883a2b-7e3e-50a5-b0b6-aeb0fce84700', 'word_count': 793, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fc883a2b-7e3e-50a5-b0b6-aeb0fce84700'}, {'abstract': 'An accomplished former player and coach, Eugene Selznick helped to promote beach volleyball, which became an Olympic sport in 1996.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/sports/eugene-selznick-beach-volleyball-pioneer-dies-at-82.html', 'snippet': 'An accomplished former player and coach, Eugene Selznick helped to promote beach volleyball, which became an Olympic sport in 1996.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Eugene Selznick, a celebrated volleyball innovator who helped raise American players’ game to international caliber in the 1960s, and whose shrewdness in drafting Wilt Chamberlain for a 1970s exhibition of beach volleyball helped make Californians’ beach-party game an Olympic sport, died on June 11 in Los Angeles. He was 82.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '27', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/17selznick-1/17selznick-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 822, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/17selznick-1/17selznick-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1644, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/17selznick-1/17selznick-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/17selznick-1/17selznick-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/17selzni