'}, {'abstract': 'By the end of the third round, Tiger Woods was tied for 14th, five strokes behind Jim Furyk and Graeme McDowell, the 2010 champion, who posted a two-under 68 for a 54-hole total of one under.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/sports/golf/us-open-furyk-and-mcdowell-hold-lead-as-woods-falls-to-14th.html', 'snippet': 'By the end of the third round, Tiger Woods was tied for 14th, five strokes behind Jim Furyk and Graeme McDowell, the 2010 champion, who posted a two-under 68 for a 54-hole total of one under.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — The scoreboard at the 112th United States Open broke into a rash of red numbers Saturday. After a two-day quarantine imposed by the United States Golf Association to prevent a spread of birdies, rounds below par suddenly became contagious at the Olympic Club. The infected included everyone from the United States Open winners Graeme McDowell, Ernie Els and Retief Goosen to Lee Westwood, a veteran desperate to join their exalted ranks.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/jp-golf-1/jp-golf-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/jp-golf-1/jp-golf-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/jp-golf-1/jp-golf-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 822, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/jp-golf-1/jp-golf-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1644, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'cap