ow believes he can win at the Olympic Club.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/sports/golf/us-open-17-year-old-amateur-believes-he-can-win.html', 'snippet': 'Through three rounds, Beau Hossler has shown he isn’t ready to go away. He finished Saturday tied for eighth, one stroke ahead of Tiger Woods, and now believes he can win at the Olympic Club.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SAN FRANCISCO — Standing by the practice putting green Wednesday, 17-year-old Beau Hossler said he had simple goals for the 112th United States Open.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/open/open-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 764, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/open/open-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1529, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/open/open-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/open/open-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/sports/open/open-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Forget Feel-Good Story: 17-Year-Old Aims to Win', 'kicker': 'U.S. Open', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Forget Feel-Good Story: 17-Year-Old Aims to Win', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hossler, Beau', 'rank': 1, 'majo