y graduated.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sara Elisabeth di Bonaventura and Nii Amaah Koranteng Ofosu-Amaah were married Saturday evening at the Memorial Church on the Harvard campus in Cambridge, Mass. The Rev. Jonathan C. Page, a minister of the United Church of Christ, performed the ceremony. On Friday, the couple had a traditional ceremony of the Ga tribe of Ghana at the Charles Hotel in Cambridge.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/weddings/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/weddings/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/weddings/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/weddings/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/17/fashion/weddings/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg/17DIBONAVENTURAjpg-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sara di Bonaventura and Nii Amaah Ofosu-Amaah', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sara di Bonaventura, Nii Ofosu-Amaah', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value':