07', 'word_count': 326, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c9195132-9a93-509d-b07f-a518e3553f07'}, {'abstract': 'The plan was to make Aroldis Chapman, the left-hander with the blazing fastball, a starter. Until the Reds needed a reliever.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/sports/baseball/in-chapman-the-reds-have-a-lights-out-closer-for-now.html', 'snippet': 'The plan was to make Aroldis Chapman, the left-hander with the blazing fastball, a starter. Until the Reds needed a reliever.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If it were four months ago, or perhaps next season — if the Reds had their way, Aroldis Chapman would be a starter. Or so was the plan.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18chapman/18chapman-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18chapman/18chapman-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18chapman/18chapman-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18chapman/18chapman-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1298, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18chapman/18chapman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18chapman/18chapman-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type'