ion giant economies like the United States and China whose precarious health depends in part on Europe’s success. The Lede blog has been following the reaction as reported by correspondents from The New York Times and The International Herald Tribune based around the world. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Aftermath of the Greek Vote', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Greece', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-17T20:13:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Victoria Shannon', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Victoria', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shannon', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a593894d-ac6f-5f90-9b24-a48deda0b617', 'word_count': 9763, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a593894d-ac6f-5f90-9b24-a48deda0b617'}, {'abstract': 'The International Olympic Committee is looking into a report that officials violated the organization’s rules surrounding ticket sales to the London Games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/sports/olympics/ioc-investigating-olympic-ticket-sales.html', 'snippet': 'The International Olympic Committee is looking into a report that officials violated the organization’s rules surrounding ticket sales to the London Games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'International Olympic Committee officials have opened an investigation in response to allegations that officials violated the committee’s rules about ticket sales to the London Games. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 