in segments, softly but mechanically, all elbows and knees.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/arts/dance/emily-faulkner-wind-up-dances-at-baryshnikov-arts-center.html', 'snippet': 'In Emily Faulkner Wind-Up Dances at the Baryshnikov Arts Center, Ms. Faulkner’s default way of moving is toylike, with the body twisting in segments, softly but mechanically, all elbows and knees.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In calling her company Wind-Up Dances, Emily Faulkner has hit upon an accurate label. In the two dances she presented at the Baryshnikov Arts Center on Friday, her default way of moving is toylike. The body twists in segments, softly but mechanically, all elbows and knees. Occasionally one part of the toy helps another part along. A less flattering label might be Chiropractic Choreography.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/arts/faulkner/faulkner-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 699, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/arts/faulkner/faulkner-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1398, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/arts/faulkner/faulkner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/18/arts/faulkner/faulkner-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/arts/faulkner/faulkner-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'he