yt://article/93856dd1-1051-5d5d-bd7a-e5e1443ba7ef'}, {'abstract': 'Chris Young made his third start for the Mets and lasted seven innings, but the Mets lost for the third game in a row to Cincinnati.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/sports/baseball/mets-young-has-solid-outing-but-reds-pull-off-sweep.html', 'snippet': 'Chris Young made his third start for the Mets and lasted seven innings, but the Mets lost for the third game in a row to Cincinnati.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been all or nothing these days for the Mets, who were swept a week ago by the Yankees, before winning all three of their games last week against the Tampa Bay Rays.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18mets-pic/18mets-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18mets-pic/18mets-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18mets-pic/18mets-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18mets-pic/18mets-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18mets-pic/18mets-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/18mets-pic/18mets-pic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank'