perience and shrugging off talk of a two-person race in the Democratic primary for the 13th Congressional District.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An air of single-mindedness, and slight impatience, clings to Clyde Williams these days as he heads into the final week before voters go to the polls in the state’s Congressional primary.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/nyregion/WILLIAMS/WILLIAMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/nyregion/WILLIAMS/WILLIAMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/nyregion/WILLIAMS/WILLIAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/18/nyregion/WILLIAMS/WILLIAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/nyregion/WILLIAMS/WILLIAMS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For a Rangel Challenger, Voters’ Opinions Are the Only Ones That Matter', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For a Rangel Challenger, Voters’ Opinions Are the Only Ones That Matter', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schley, Craig', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rangel, Charles B', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wil