9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Sweden, Man Claims to Be AWOL Since 1984', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Sweden, Man Claims To Be AWOL Since 1984', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sweden', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Air Force', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'DESERTION', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hemler, David A', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Missing Persons', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-18T02:23:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Schwirtz', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schwirtz', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/453d24d0-7a98-5560-bfa1-d4aaea40218e', 'word_count': 787, 'uri': 'nyt://article/453d24d0-7a98-5560-bfa1-d4aaea40218e'}, {'abstract': 'Chicago defeated the Red Bulls, 3-1, in an M.L.S. game Sunday that included a blown call on the goal line.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/17/ghost-goal-fire-3-vs-red-bulls-1/', 'snippet': 'Chicago defeated the Red Bulls, 3-1, in an M.L.S. game Sunday that included a blown call on the goal line.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Red Bulls — remember them? — were back on the field Sunday in Major League Soccer for the first time since May 23 … and it showed.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Ghost Goal: Fire (3) vs. Red Bulls (1)', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_h