ader board as they finished the 18th hole Sunday at the United States Open, but the hole produced a Father’s Day-related gesture that moved both of them. Bradley had his father, Mark, a golf pro who helped teach him the game, carry his golf bag as they walked up No. 18.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/YONPAR/YONPAR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/18/sports/YONPAR/YONPAR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1264, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For Two Golfers Far Off the Pace, a Moment to Reflect on Father’s Day', 'kicker': 'On Par', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'For Two Golfers Far Off the Pace, a Moment to Reflect on Father&#8217;s Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Open (Golf)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': "Father's Day", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bradley, Keegan', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'ALLEN, MICHAEL', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Woods, Tiger', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Schwartzel, Charl', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-18T04:18:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'org