, '_id': 'nyt://article/75b09f1e-a705-5532-a511-35001f6dd793', 'word_count': 642, 'uri': 'nyt://article/75b09f1e-a705-5532-a511-35001f6dd793'}, {'abstract': 'Environmental groups in Malaysia are hoping to use a popular protest against an Australian-built refinery to raise awareness of projects in other parts of the country.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/business/global/green-movement-takes-root-in-malaysia.html', 'snippet': 'Environmental groups in Malaysia are hoping to use a popular protest against an Australian-built refinery to raise awareness of projects in other parts of the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KUALA LUMPUR — When a planned 24-hour environmental protest gets under way this Saturday on the outskirts of the coastal Malaysian town of Kuantan, the roll call will include speakers from across the country.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/business/global/19lynas-pic/19lynas-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/19/business/global/19lynas-pic/19lynas-pic-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/business/global/19lynas-pic/19lynas-pic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 586, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/business/global/19lynas-pic/19lynas-pic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1173, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/business/global/19lynas-pic/19lynas-pic-thumbSt