e Gershwins’ Porgy and Bess” and the plays “One Man, Two Guvnors” and “Gore Vidal’s The Best Man” in the strongest shape among new productions as the summer tourist season begins, according to the weekly ticket sales data compiled by the Broadway League.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Once,’ ‘One Man, Two Guvnors’ Enjoy Tony Awards Bump at Box Office', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Tony Wins Lift Box Office', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tony Awards (Theater Awards)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corden, James', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kazee, Steve', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McDonald, Audra', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Broadway League', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-18T20:50:41+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Patrick Healy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Patrick', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Healy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6de16d9a-1e8a-59c3-90b1-efd949d0d75a', 'word_count': 570, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6de16d9a-1e8a-59c3-90b1-efd949d0d75a'}, {'abstract': 'The former pitcher Roger Clemens was found not guilty Monday of lying to Congress in 2008 when he said he never used steroids or human growth hormone in his baseball career.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/sports/baseball/roger-clemens-is-found-not-guilty-in-perjury-trial.html', 'snippet': 'The former pitcher Roger Clemens was found not guilty Monday of lying to Congress in 2008 when he said he never used steroids or human growth hormone in his baseball career.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Roger Clemens, who intimidated even the toughest batters while becoming one of the best pitchers in baseball history, was acquitted Monday of all charges that he lied to Congress in 2008 when he insisted he never used steroids or human growth hormone during his long career.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/19clemens5_span/19clemens5_span-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/19clemens5_span/19clemens5_span-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/19clemens5_span/19clemens5_span-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 667, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/19clemens5_span/19clemens5_span-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1333, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/19clemens5_span/19clemens5_span-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/19clemens5_span/19clemens5_span-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/19clemens5_span/19clemens5_span-thumbLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name':