: 'Confinement was a theme of several works in this year’s Queer New York International Arts Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/arts/queer-new-york-festival-is-in-search-of-broader-definition.html', 'snippet': 'Confinement was a theme of several works in this year’s Queer New York International Arts Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A central goal of the inaugural Queer New York International Arts Festival was to posit a more expansive notion of queerness. Yet in several solo performances offered last week at Abrons Arts Center on the Lower East Side, one of the most striking through-lines was the way these works dealt with various ideas of confinement and were themselves confined.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/queerfest/queerfest-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/queerfest/queerfest-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/queerfest/queerfest-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 715, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/queerfest/queerfest-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1430, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/queerfest/queerfest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/queerfest/queerfest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumb