et': 'Letter to the editor.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s All in the Head (1 Letter)', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s All In the Head', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-18T22:17:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/c6d6786d-65ab-577f-b2ef-62e3ae09279c', 'word_count': 87, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c6d6786d-65ab-577f-b2ef-62e3ae09279c'}, {'abstract': 'The shot, fired by one of two men trying to rob the store, missed the cashier.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/shot-fired-at-duane-reade-cashier-in-robbery-attempt/', 'snippet': 'The shot, fired by one of two men trying to rob the store, missed the cashier.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A surveillance camera recorded the scene: On Friday, around 11 p.m., two men stood at the counter of a Duane Reade at 100 Delancey Street on the Lower East Side. One man, wearing a blue baseball cap, drew a gun from inside his jacket and fired a single bullet at a cashier, who was standing outside the camera’s field of vision. The two men fled.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Shot Fired at Duane Reade Cashier in Robbery Attempt', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lower East Side (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-18T22:18:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eric P. Newcomer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eric', 'middlename': 'P.', 'lastname': 'Newcomer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b77cafbd-125d-5f5d-8872-cfb809385ff4', 'word_count': 229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b77cafbd-125d-5f5d-8872-cfb809385ff4'}, {'abstract': 'Red Deluxe, an agency in Memphis, created a spot that the American Lung Association hopes will get people focused on the cleanliness of the air and catch the attention of breathers 18 to 40.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/business/media/american-lung-association-seeks-younger-donors-with-new-ad-and-an-app.html', 'snippet': 'Red Deluxe, an agency in Memphis, created a spot that the American Lung Association hopes will get people focused on the cleanliness of the air and catch the attention of breathers 18 to 40.', 'lead_paragraph': '“I MEAN, yeah, you can say it’s an unusual hobby,” says a man in his 20s wearing oversize glasses in a quirky new public service announcement from the American Lung Association. “I’ve had people laugh at me, but I don’t care. I just love collecting air.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/business/Adco/Adco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 647, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/business/Adco/Adco-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1293, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Public Service Ad About Air, and an App', 'kicker': 'Advertising', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Public Service Ad About Air, And an App', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN LUNG ASSN', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Air Pollution', 'rank': 2, 'major': 