uri': 'nyt://article/6529f42f-2b7c-52a6-bbf1-95686f5b6694'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Kennedy, who gave chick lit a black focus, rose to prominence with her roman à clef “Bling,” in 2004.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/books/erica-kennedy-music-writer-and-novelist-dies-at-42.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Kennedy, who gave chick lit a black focus, rose to prominence with her roman à clef “Bling,” in 2004.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Erica Kennedy, a music writer turned novelist who came to wide attention in 2004 with the publication of her first novel, “Bling,” a satirical roman à clef about the world of hip-hop, was found dead last week at her home in Miami Beach. She was 42.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/KENNEDY-obit/KENNEDY-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/KENNEDY-obit/KENNEDY-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1418, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/KENNEDY-obit/KENNEDY-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/KENNEDY-obit/KENNEDY-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/arts/KENNEDY-obit/KENNEDY-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Erica Kennedy, a Music Writer Who Satirized the Hip-Hop World, Di