: 'Regulators are trying to clamp down on rogue traders like JPMorgan Chase’s Bruno Iksil, nicknamed the London Whale, who amassed large positions in credit derivatives as part of a complex trading strategy that eventually soured.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/loopholes-abound-despite-new-rules/', 'snippet': 'Regulators are trying to clamp down on rogue traders like JPMorgan Chase’s Bruno Iksil, nicknamed the London Whale, who amassed large positions in credit derivatives as part of a complex trading strategy that eventually soured.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bank regulators are casting new nets to catch excessive risk-taking in the financial system. But future London Whales may find plenty of ways to slip right through them.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Loopholes Abound Despite New Rules', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'News Analysis: Loopholes Abound Despite New Rules', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T00:35:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Eavis', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Eavis', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/0bad6707-39dd-5b78-8dd4-22f1e77b7965', 'word_count': 924, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0bad6707-39dd-5b78-8dd4-22f1e77b7965'}, {'abstract': 'Goldman Sachs must continue to pay Mr. Gupta’s bills until the case is completely resolved, a process that could take a couple of years.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/06/18/gupta-legal-bills/', 'snippet': 'Goldman Sachs must continue to pay Mr. Gupta’s bills until the case is completely resolved, a process that could take a couple of years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For Goldman Sachs, the insider trading case against a former board member, Rajat K. Gupta, which ended in a conviction on Friday, was distracting and discomforting.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Goldman Stuck With a Defense Tab, and Awaiting a Payback', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Stuck With a Defense Tab, and Awaiting a Payback', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boards of Directors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Decisions and Verdicts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Executive Compensation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Insurance', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Black, Conrad M', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Blankfein, Lloyd C', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gupta, Rajat K', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rajaratnam, Raj', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Skilling, Jeffrey K', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Procter & Gamble Company', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T00:35:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Peter Lattman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Peter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lattman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/dba6a180-b545-56fc-bfc3-9e4406645289', 'word_count': 968, 'uri': 'nyt://article/dba6a180-b545-56fc-bfc3-9e4406645289'}, {'abstract': 'Mitt Romney, who often struggles with small talk on the trail, campaigned through six swing states during a five-day bus tour.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/us/politics/road-trip-helps-romney-brush-up-on-banter.html', 'snippet': 'Mitt Romney, who often struggles with small talk on the trail, campaigned through six swing states during a five-day bus tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JANESVILLE, Wis. — Mitt Romney’s English is direct and to the point, useful for attacking President Obama on the stump or dismantling his Republican opponents in primary debates. He is even fluent in French. But the one language Mr. Romney doesn’t seem to speak is small talk.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/19campaign4/19campaign4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/19/us/19campaign4/19campaign4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/19campaign4/19campaign4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/19campaign4/19campaign4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/19campaign4/19campaign4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/19/us/19campaign4/19campaign4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/