'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/us/teachers-union-to-open-lesson-sharing-web-site.html', 'snippet': 'The American Federation of Teachers has joined with a British publisher that will allow teachers to download simple work sheets or full-course outlines.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Teachers seeking lesson plans on anything from fractions and multiplication tables to Shakespeare or the Civil War can take to the Internet for a boundless array of work sheets, reading lists and classroom tips, available free or for a fee.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Teachers’ Union to Open Lesson-Sharing Web Site', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Teachers’ Union to Open Lesson-Sharing Web Site', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Teachers and School Employees', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN FEDERATION OF TEACHERS', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T03:08:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Motoko Rich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Motoko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/91bb0b19-7530-5bde-9d60-7eb9d9ed92d9', 'word_count': 728, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91bb0b19-7530-5bde-9d60-7eb9d9ed92d9'}, {'abstract': 'Jeremy Bloom, a two-time Olympic skier, began organizing monthly get-togethers with his Olympic buddies about six months ago, when he moved to Manhattan from Colorado.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/sports/olympics/life-after-the-games-for-five-former-olympians.html', 'snippet': 'Jeremy Bloom, a two-time Olympic skier, began organizing monthly get-togethers with his Olympic buddies about six months ago, when he moved to Manhattan from Colorado.', 'lead_paragraph': 'They may be Olympians, but no one is ever going to mistake Tara Lipinski, Sasha Cohen, Sarah Hughes, Jeremy Bloom or Joey Cheek for beach volleyball champions.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/yOLYMPIANS/yOLYMPIANS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/yOLYMPIANS/yOLYMPIANS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/yOLYMPIANS/yOLYMPIANS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 786, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/yOLYMPIANS/yOLYMPIANS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1572, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/yOLYMPIANS/yOLYMPIANS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/yOLYMPIANS/yOLYMPIANS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/sports/yOLYMPIANS/yOLYMPIANS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Life After