t blocks away from where she said her great-grandfather used to live and sell stockings out of pushcart on Pitt Street.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Esther Weisbrod’s connection to the Lower East Side runs deeper than her appreciation for the neighborhood’s mom-and-pops stores, live music venues and leather and tattoo-clad residents. We spotted her at Ludlow and Rivington Streets, just blocks away from where she said her great-grandfather used to live and sell stockings out of pushcart on Pitt Street.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Connecting to Lower East Side Roots in Style', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Lower East Side (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T04:07:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simone S. Oliver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simone', 'middlename': 'S.', 'lastname': 'Oliver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2fc918a6-aae0-5304-b12a-24ad754bb392', 'word_count': 97, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2fc918a6-aae0-5304-b12a-24ad754bb392'}, {'abstract': 'As part of the deal, Roche, the Swiss pharmaceutical company, will get an important patent from Seaside Therapeutics and help that company with clinical tests.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/health/roche-and-seaside-team-up-to-develop-autism-drugs.html', 'snippet': 'As part of the deal, Roche, the Swiss pharmaceutical company, will get an important patent from Seaside Therapeutics and help that company with clinical tests.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two of the front-runners in the race to develop drugs to treat mental retardation and autism are joining forces, hoping to save money and get to the market sooner. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Competitors Form Partnership to Develop Autism Drugs', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Competitors Form Partnership to Develop Autism Drugs', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Autism', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Roche Holding A G', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Retardation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T04:11:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Pollack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pollack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e11207a1-091a-513a-81a6-3bd8bd9c3403', 'word_count': 566, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e11207a1-091a-513a-81a6-3bd8bd9c3403'}, {'abstract': 'The Charlotte Bobcats have hired St. John’s assistant Mike Dunlap to be their new head coach, two people familiar with the decision said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/sports/ncaabasketball/st-johns-mike-dunlap-to-be-coach-of-charlotte-bobcats.html', 'snippet': 'The Charlotte Bobcats have hired St. John’s assistant Mike Dunlap to be their new head coach, two people familiar with the decision said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After a season highlighted by turnover, St. John’s lost another key piece Monday night. The assistant Mike Dunlap, the Red Storm’s key strategist, is leaving to become the coach of the Charlotte Bobcats. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'