ns-about-obamas-memoir/', 'snippet': 'A new book by a Washington Post reporter could raise further questions about how closely the President Obama’s telling of his life hews to reality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'At Harvard Law School in 1990, President Obama found himself lovingly mocked by his peers for relentlessly promoting the exotic story of a search for racial identity that later became the theme of his best-selling book, “Dreams From My Father.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'New Book Raises Questions About Obama’s Memoir', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Political Memo: Obama Biography Brings New Scrutiny to President’s Own Memoir', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T13:41:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/380d0246-df5c-562e-98b9-0f963e103dfc', 'word_count': 1240, 'uri': 'nyt://article/380d0246-df5c-562e-98b9-0f963e103dfc'}, {'abstract': 'Reaction to Mets pitcher R. A. Dickey’s second straight one-hitter and Roger Clemens’s victory in court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/sports/for-ra-dickey-the-ascent-continues.html', 'snippet': 'Reaction to Mets pitcher R. A. Dickey’s second straight one-hitter and Roger Clemens’s victory in court.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It might be possible to imagine two more divergent story lines in one sport than baseball managed Monday, but it would take some heavy-duty creative thinking. Because after baseball followed the Roger Clemens verdict with a second straight one-hitter by Mets pitcher R. A. Dickey, you get the feeling there are some science-fiction writers out there muttering, "I couldn\'t have thought that up."', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/sports/baseball/20leadingpic/20leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/sports/baseball/20leadingpic/20leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1394, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/sports/baseball/20leadingpic/20leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/20/sports/baseball/20leadingpic/20leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/sports/baseball/20leadingpic/20leadingpic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For R. A. Dickey, the Ascent Continues', 'kicker': 'Leading Off', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'UEFA European Football Championship', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Charlotte Bobcats', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pennsylvania State University', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Baseball Hall