ms aimed at younger, more diverse audiences.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/the-breakfast-meeting-new-entry-in-the-tablet-landscape-and-a-more-hip-npr/', 'snippet': 'Microsoft unveiled a tablet called Surface, meant to compete with the iPad. NPR, with its core shows aging, is looking for some new programs aimed at younger, more diverse audiences.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Taking on Apple’s iPad would seem to be a tough task, but Microsoft on Monday took up the challenge, introducing a new tablet computer called Surface. The new product marks a foray into making hardware for a company known mostly for its software, but it is an acknowledgement, writes Nick Wingfield, that the company needed to depart from its regular way of doing business to maintain its dominance in computing. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Breakfast Meeting: New Entry in the Tablet Landscape, and a More Hip NPR', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Buses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Consumer Behavior', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'iPad', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Shopping and Retail', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tablet Computers', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Best BUY Company Inc', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Public Radio', 'ra