tion': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8a42065e-e283-5fae-88e6-c686c0f19bb2', 'word_count': 349, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8a42065e-e283-5fae-88e6-c686c0f19bb2'}, {'abstract': 'On Tuesday, Google shared some of the insights it had gleaned from the time it has spent on the dark side of the Web. It said — no surprises here — that cybercriminals are getting faster and more crafty.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/cybercriminals-getting-quicker-and-craftier-google-says/', 'snippet': 'On Tuesday, Google shared some of the insights it had gleaned from the time it has spent on the dark side of the Web. It said — no surprises here — that cybercriminals are getting faster and more crafty.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Five years ago, Google started a “Safe Browsing” initiative to track down malicious content across the Web. On Tuesday, the company shared some of the insights it gleaned during the cleanup job.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Cybercriminals Getting Quicker and Craftier, Google Says', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Phishing (Computer Fraud)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T15:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nicole Perlroth', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nicole', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Perlroth', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ce295e8b-055e-5691-ad0c-b2062ae640d4', 'word_count': 354, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ce295e8b-055e-5691-ad0c-b2062ae640d4'}, {'abstract': 'Rodriguez looked to create “languid and easy” pieces for resort, like this pantsuit and striped top combo.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/just-one-look-narciso-rodriguez-2/', 'snippet': 'Rodriguez looked to create “languid and easy” pieces for resort, like this pantsuit and striped top combo.', 'lead_paragraph': '“The whole thing is about mixing tailoring and bias cutting into one piece, so that the clothes would be languid and easy,” said the designer Narciso Rodriguez about his resort collection. The theme came across in a white sheath dress featuring a color-blocked bondage bodice (“Classic me,” Rodriguez said), sleek crepe trousers and an even sleeker black coat (“At-night me,” he said), and a bias-cut, bra-equipped buff-colored strap dress (“Day me.” We should have known). This pantsuit and striped top combo sums it up for the designer, because: “It’s my favorite.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Just One Look | Narciso Rodriguez', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rodriguez, Narciso', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T15:00:46+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chelsea Zalopany', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chelsea', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zalopany', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b2e4681e-5ef5-5e3f-b688-d873836f89d0', 'word_count': 94, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b2e4681e-5ef5-5e3f-b688-d873836f89d0'}, {'abstract': 'The annual foodie frenzy in Aspen, Colo., stimulated the brain as well as the stomach.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/10-lessons-from-t