'Two new dried pastas from the Cipriani brand are made only with egg whites, so they are cholesterol free.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As packaged dried egg pastas go, the pappardelle, tagliolini and others bearing the Cipriani label are fashioned with great finesse. Now there are two new varieties, made only with the egg whites, so they are cholesterol free. The very thin pappardelle noodles and tagliardi squares cook in less than five minutes, with silken yet al dente results. Serve them lightly dressed for summer with chopped fresh tomatoes or coins of sautéed zucchini, strewn with herbs and perhaps some nuggets of crab meat.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_PASTASPAN/20STUFF1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_PASTASPAN/20STUFF1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_PASTASPAN/20STUFF_PASTASPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_PASTASPAN/20STUFF_PASTASPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_PASTASPAN/20STUFF_PASTASPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Delicate Pastas, Barely Dressed', 'kicker': 'Food Stuff', 'content_kicker': 