powerful effect in cocktails.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/dining/there-in-your-drink-a-drop-of-perfume.html', 'snippet': 'Natural essences — flowers, spices, grasses, barks and resins —are being used to powerful effect in cocktails.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IF you think perfume’s only place is behind the wrist or ear, take another sniff at that drink you just ordered. Scents are starting to show up in martinis, margaritas and much fancier concoctions, thanks in large part to Mandy Aftel, a former psychotherapist who now makes edible and potable perfumes.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20INFUSION1_SPAN/20INFUSION1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20INFUSION1_SPAN/20INFUSION1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20INFUSION1_SPAN/20INFUSION1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20INFUSION1_SPAN/20INFUSION1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20INFUSION1_SPAN/20INFUSION1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20INFUSION1_SPAN/20INFUSION1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20INFUSION1_SPAN/20INFUSION1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Perfumes to Sip as Well as Sniff', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Perfumes To Sip As Well As Sniff', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Meehan, Jim', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'AFTEL, MANDY', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocktails', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Saunders, Audrey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Perfumes and Fragrances', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T18:40:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alice Feiring', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alice', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Feiring', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7f146afc-a8cd-5c17-9c40-6f4cec2cf177', 'word_count': 940, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7f146afc-a8cd-5c17-9c40-6f4cec2cf177'}, {'abstract': 'Whether or not the Supreme Court strikes down the health care law’s individual mandate, the rule might matter less than its advocates believe.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/business/economy/a-health-care-mandate-that-might-not-matter-economic-scene.html', 'snippet': 'Whether or not the Supreme Court strikes down the health care law’s individual mandate, the rule might matter less than its advocates believe.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Within the next few days, the Supreme Court may strike down the provision in the Affordable Care Act requiring every American to buy health insurance. Odds that the justices will reject this measure, the so-called individual mandate, are approaching 80 percent on Intrade, a market where investors can bet on the outcome of pretty much everything.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/business/eduardo-porter/eduardo-porter-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/02/29/business/eduardo-porter/eduardo-porter-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/business/eduardo-porter/eduardo-porter-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/business/eduardo-porter/eduardo-porter-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/business/eduardo-porter/eduardo-porter-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/02/29/business/eduardo-porter/eduardo-porter-thumbStandard-v6.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/business/eduardo-porter/eduardo-porter-thumbLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Self-Interest Meets Mandate', 'kicker': 'Economic Scene', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Self-Interest Meets Mandate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reform and Reorganization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T18:43:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eduardo Porter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eduardo', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Porter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa77244f-bb2b-5599-906e-4cb859f93b00', 'word_count': 1229, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa77244f-bb2b-5599-906e-4cb859f93b00'}, {'abstract': 'Sauce, Pane Panelle and Beacon have all opened takeout windows, a warm-weather convenience in the heart of the city.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/dining/new-takeout-windows-bring-food-straight-to-the-sidewalk.html', 'snippet': 'Sauce, Pane Panelle and Beacon have all opened takeout windows, a warm-weather convenience in the heart of the city.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the hot weather you want ease, and the walk-up window lets you order food without waiting to be seated. At Sauce, a restaurant that opened last fall on the Lower East Side, you can saunter up and order a meal in a container after midnight, or for breakfast. For Frank Prisinzano (in photo), the chef, who also has restaurants in the East Village, and his partner, Rob DeFlorio, the window, which opened last week, is a way to sell food when the restaurant is not open for table service. “There are not a lot of options when you’re hungry in this neighborhood, especially late at night,” Mr. DeFlorio said. The menu includes five dishes, like spaghetti with various toppings, as well as French toast, eggs and a kale salad. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN/20STUFF5-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 817, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN/20STUFF5-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1634, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/dining/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN/20STUFF_WINDOWSPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'From the Restaurant Kitchen Straight to the Sidewalk', 'kicker': 'Food 