ount': 501, 'uri': 'nyt://article/744c6c40-c253-50f9-a4fe-a1143eb25586'}, {'abstract': 'A popular climate and energy blogger lays out why he sees global warming as simple.', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/david-roberts-on-the-simple-climate-problem/', 'snippet': 'A popular climate and energy blogger lays out why he sees global warming as simple.', 'lead_paragraph': 'David Roberts of Grist.org has posted his presentation at an\xa0Evergreen State College \xa0TEDx\xa0event, “Hello Climate Change: Rethinking the Unthinkable.” The conference was organized “to encourage thinking about the role of liberal arts education in an era of climate change.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'David Roberts on the Simple Climate Problem', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Blogs and Blogging (Internet)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Liberalism (US Politics)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T18:52:45+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew C. Revkin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Revkin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/95034a9f-be2c-5855-bfad-ce6d7f2cd501', 'word_count': 616, 'uri': 'nyt://article/95034a9f-be2c-5855-bfad-ce6d7f2cd501'}, {'abstract': 'President Obama and Mitt Romney have at times been stretching the truth, using statistics without context or just exaggerating.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/us/politics/fact-checking-obama-and-romney.html', 'snippet': 'President Obama and Mitt Romney have at times been stretching the truth, using statistics without context or just exaggerating.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To listen to Mitt Romney tell it, President Obama is a job-killing, free-spending, big-government liberal who made the recession worse with his policies and endangered free-market capitalism. The president has spent tax dollars “at a pace without precedent in recent history,” Mr. Romney says, and “added almost as much debt as all the prior presidents combined.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/politics/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/19/us/politics/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/politics/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/politics/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/us/politics/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/19/us/politics/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6/0620CHECK-cham-slide-7IZ6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ran