0-5ff8-87bd-67bb2331f17c'}, {'abstract': 'The British mini-series “Inside Men,” on BBC America, begins with a robbery, then spools out the back story.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/arts/television/inside-men-a-bbc-america-heist-drama.html', 'snippet': 'The British mini-series “Inside Men,” on BBC America, begins with a robbery, then spools out the back story.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Inside Men” is a British heist drama that goes on for too long (four hours) and, perhaps as a result, keeps wandering away from the story of the prodigious armed robbery — a haul of more than $250 million — at its core. It’s held together by a couple of things: its icy tone, which it maintains even as it detours needlessly into the personal lives of the robbers, and a twitchy, absorbing performance by Steven Mackintosh as the ringleader, a milquetoast who blossoms in the role of criminal mastermind.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/sub-20insidemen/sub-20insidemen-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/sub-20insidemen/sub-20insidemen-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/sub-20insidemen/sub-20insidemen-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 849, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/sub-20insidemen/sub-20insidemen-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1287, 'width': 1067, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/sub-20insidemen/sub-20insidemen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/sub-20insidemen/sub-20insidemen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/sub-20insidemen/sub-20insidemen-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Feathering the Nest With a Mask and a Plan', 'kicker': 'Television Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Feathering The Nest With a Mask And a Plan', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mackintosh, Steven', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'BBC America', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T20:49:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Television', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mike Hale', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mike', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hale', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee3a7b20-8bda-5e77-9376-82bb0f10f0df', 'word_count': 479, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee3a7b20-8bda-5e77-9376-82bb0f10f0df'}, {'abstract': '“Sovereign,” the last installment of Mac Rogers’s science-fiction “Honeycomb Trilogy,” considers how the rebel leader, Ronnie, handles restoration of humanity’s self-governing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/theater/reviews/sovereign-at-secret-theater-completes-a-sci-fi-trilogy.html', 'snippet': '“Sovereign,” the last installment of Mac Rogers’s science-fiction “Honeycomb Trilogy,” considers how the rebel leader, Ronnie, handles restoration of humanity’s self-governing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A blazing meteorite has hit the Florida town that is the central battlefield in the war between humans and aliens. Her name is Hanna Cheek. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/20sovereign/20sovereign-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/20sovereign/20sovereign-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/20sovereign/20sovereign-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/20sovereign/20sovereign-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/arts/20sovereign/20sovereign-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Repelling Alien Conquerors Is Easy; It’s Ruling That’s Hard', 'kicker': 'Theater Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Repelling Alien Conquerors Is Easy; It’s Ruling That’s Hard', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cheek, Hanna', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Science Fiction', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rogers, Mac', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T20:51:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Theater', 'subsection_name': 'Theater Reviews', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jason Zinoman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jason', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Zinoman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a26b05b-a433-552c-8ef0-fcfcf89aa27a', 'word_count': 465, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a26b05b-a433-552c-8ef0-fcfcf89aa27a'}, {'abstract': 'On Bornholm, the author discovers flowers in bloom, eats a “Sun over Gudhjem” sandwich and fails to lead his rundbold team to victory.', 'web_url': 'https://frugaltraveler.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/castle-ruins-and-smoked-herring-touring-a-danish-island-on-two-wheels/', 'snippet': 'On Bornholm, the author discovers flowers in bloom, eats a “Sun over Gudhjem” sandwich and fails to lead his rundbold team to victory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Oluf Host? The Oluf Host, the Danish contemporary painter famed for his scenes of Bornholm, on the very island I was visiting? It was indeed him – or more accurately, it was the stone that had marked his grave since 1966 – right in front of me in the churchyard in Gudhjem, the cozy coastal village where I had just stopped on my bike.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Castle Ruins and Smoked Herring: Touring a Danish Island on Two Wheels', 'kicker': 'Frugal Traveler', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T20:55:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By SETH KUGEL', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Seth', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'KUGEL', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e0d53ccf-7f37-5057-a346-b41214bf0149', 'word_count': 1608, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e0d53ccf-7f37-5057-a346-b41214bf0149'}, {'abstract': 'On the immigration issue, in key states up for grabs that may determine this presidential election — like, for instance, Virginia and Ohio — there is a below-average number of Hispanic voters.', 'web_url': 'https://fivethirtyeight.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/hispanic-voters-less-plentiful-in-swing-states/', 'snippet': 'On the immigration issue, in key states up for grabs that may determine this presidential election — like, for instance, Virginia and Ohio — there is a below-average number of Hispanic voters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As I wrote on Tuesday morning, President Obama’s decision to suspend deportations of some young illegal immigrants should entail mostly upside for him from a political standpoint. Based on polls about his decision and the way that Republicans are reacting to it, the evidence that public opinion is on Mr. Obama’s side is reasonably clear.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hispanic Voters Less Plentiful in Swing States', 'kicker': 'FiveThirtyEight', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T20:57:36+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Nate Silver', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Nate', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Silver', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7d9613fe-f186-5cda-b45d-3e26ac90f034', 'word_count': 1018, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7d9613fe-f186-5cda-b45d-3e26ac90f034'}, {'abstract': 'Senator Scott P. Brown and Elizabeth Warren have yet to agree to the specifics of any debate in what may be the marquee Senate race in the country.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/19/in-massachusetts-senate-race-a-debate-over-a-debate/', 'snippet': 'Senator Scott P. Brown and Elizabeth Warren have yet to agree to the specifics of any debate in what may be the marquee Senate race in the country.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Plans for a debate in the Massachusetts Senate race — to be held in Boston at the Edward M. Kennedy Institute for the United States Senate, named for the Democrat who held the seat for nearly half a century — seemed to collapse Tuesday under the weight of partisanship.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Plans for Massachusetts Debate Seem to Collapse', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Debates (Political)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Brown, Scott P', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Kennedy, Victoria Reggie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Warren, Elizabeth', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'MSNBC', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Massachusetts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-19T21:05:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Katharine Q. Seelye', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Katharine', 'middlename': 'Q.', 'lastname': 'Seelye', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a66f51a7-1e9d-5068-bf61-fe4fac2140fb', 'word_count': 645, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a66f51a7-1e9d-5068-bf61-fe4fac2140fb'}, {'abstract': 'A lighter, dairy-free version of vichyssoise, this anise-scented soup is good hot or cold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/health/nutrition/fennel-garlic-and-potato-soup-recipes-for-health.html', 'snippet': 'A lighter, dairy-free version of vichyssoise, this anise-scented soup is good hot or cold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This anise-scentedsoup is reminiscent of the classic potato and leek soup known as vichyssoise,but it’s lighter and contains no dairy. It’s good hot or cold.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/19/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 656, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 1313, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/19/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-thumbStandard-v5.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/19/science/21recipehealth/21recipehealth-thumbLarge-v5.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fennel, Garlic and Potato Soup', 'kicker': 'Reci