 standards governing soot proposed by the Environmental Protection Agency will make for cleaner air and were long overdue.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a welcome move that will make the air that Americans breathe cleaner, the Environmental Protection Agency proposed on Friday to tighten standards governing fine particles, commonly known as soot. Released by sources like diesel trucks and power plants, these microscopic specks can lodge in the lungs and bloodstream and cause respiratory and heart ailments. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Deadly Particles', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Deadly Particles', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Air Pollution', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-20T00:48:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/b8c937f6-ef11-5126-8bbd-67387d946371', 'word_count': 310, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b8c937f6-ef11-5126-8bbd-67387d946371'}, {'abstract': 'School-issued debit cards may come with hidden fees and other strings. Congress needs to take a hard look at how banks disburse financial aid to students.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/opinion/debit-cards-on-campus.html', 'snippet': 'School-issued debit cards may come with hidden fees and other strings. Congress needs to take a hard look at how banks disburse financial aid to students.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Given the history of shady dealings between banks and colleges, Congress needs t