gressional District have similar views on nearly all core issues, like the economy, transportation and immigration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/nyregion/as-queens-looks-to-fill-a-congressional-seat-the-democratic-race-is-wide-open.html', 'snippet': 'The three major contenders for the primary in the Sixth Congressional District have similar views on nearly all core issues, like the economy, transportation and immigration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Assemblywoman Grace Meng appreciates the support of the Queens Democratic machine, and the overwhelming financial advantage she enjoys over her opponents. But she emphasizes that she is the only candidate who has won before without her party’s blessing.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/nyregion/QUEENS3/QUEENS3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/nyregion/QUEENS3/QUEENS3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As Queens Looks to Fill a Congressional Seat, the Democratic Race Is Wide Open', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'As Queens Looks to Fill a Congressional Seat, the Democratic Race Is Wide Open', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Queens (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lancman, Rory I', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crowley, Elizabeth S', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Primaries and Caucuses', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocat