'abstract': 'Mr. Lent, a Republican who represented a large swath of Long Island’s South Shore, was a significant voice in shaping environmental legislation, despite always being in the minority.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/nyregion/norman-f-lent-11-term-congressman-from-long-island-dies-at-81.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Lent, a Republican who represented a large swath of Long Island’s South Shore, was a significant voice in shaping environmental legislation, despite always being in the minority.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Norman F. Lent, who in his 11 terms in Congress representing a large swath of Long Island’s South Shore was a significant voice in shaping environmental legislation, despite always being in the minority, died on June 11 at his home in Arlington, Va. Mr. Lent, a Republican, was 81.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/sports/Lent1/Lent1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 871, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/sports/Lent1/Lent1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1743, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/sports/Lent1/Lent1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/21/sports/Lent1/Lent1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/sports/Lent1/Lent1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headlin