 Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Déjà Vu: Rock ’n’ Roll Memoir Coming From Graham Nash', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rock ’n’ Roll Memoir Coming From Nash', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rock Music', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Crosby, David', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nash, Graham', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Stills, Stephen', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'England', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Woodstock (NY)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-20T16:15:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6b4e9ade-cef1-5854-beb3-1531812df652', 'word_count': 568, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6b4e9ade-cef1-5854-beb3-1531812df652'}, {'abstract': 'The firm has signed up the first company to switch its London trading activity to NYSE Euronext London, the company’s new exchange in the British capital.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/nyse-euronext-stakes-claim-in-london/', 'snippet': 'The firm has signed up the first company to switch its London trading activity to NYSE Euronext London, the company’s new exchange in the British capital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON – Initial public offerings in London have come to a halt, but that has not stopped NYSE Euronext from trying to get in on