abstract': 'The Florida State baseball team has been to the College World Series 21 times, but has never won the title. But two wins over Arizona will put the Seminoles in the final.', 'web_url': 'https://thequad.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/is-this-the-seminoles-year-in-the-series/', 'snippet': 'The Florida State baseball team has been to the College World Series 21 times, but has never won the title. But two wins over Arizona will put the Seminoles in the final.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Florida State’s baseball team is looking sharp so far in the College World Series in Omaha, defeating U.C.L.A. on Tuesday evening, 4-1, to take the elimination game. The Seminoles (50-16) have never won the championship in 21 trips to the College World Series. But they are now one step away from the final, needing two wins over their next opponent, Arizona, in their series that starts Thursday at TD Ameritrade Park.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Is This the Seminoles’ Year in the Series?', 'kicker': 'The Quad', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College Athletics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'College World Series', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Florida State University', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Arizona', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of California, Los Angeles', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-20T18:59:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Pro Basketball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Joanne C. Gerstner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Joanne', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'Gerstner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 