uri': 'nyt://article/00caeb8a-4c58-5616-9c71-82e74a163f23'}, {'abstract': 'Erik Rhodes, a gay pornographic-film star who died last week, had detailed his escorting, rampant steroid use and crystal meth binges on a harrowing Tumblr feed.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/fashion/erik-rhodess-death-was-early-but-perhaps-not-surprising.html', 'snippet': 'Erik Rhodes, a gay pornographic-film star who died last week, had detailed his escorting, rampant steroid use and crystal meth binges on a harrowing Tumblr feed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE bereaved reactions on Twitter came from all over: Kim Hastreiter, the editor of Paper Magazine; Bruce LaBruce, the independent film director; and Jake Shears of the Scissor Sisters, who called his recently departed friend “brave” and “honest.”', 'print_section': 'E', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/fashion/21RHODES/21zRHODES-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 826, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/fashion/21RHODES/21zRHODES-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1766, 'width': 1425, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/fashion/21RHODES/21RHODES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/21/fashion/21RHODES/21RHODES-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/fashion/21RHODES/21RHODES-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy':