esday, is intended to persuade would-be drivers to make an active choice about organ donation, which would not be mandatory.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York State Legislature passed a measure on Wednesday aimed at increasing the low number of organ donors in the state by encouraging driver’s license applicants to make an active choice about their donation status. If the bill is signed by Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo, New York will become the second state, along with California, to make such a change in its donor registration process.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Albany Bill on Organ Donation Urges License Applicants to Act', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Albany Bill on Organ Donation Urges License Applicants to Act', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drivers Licenses', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Organ Donation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T01:21:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kevin Sack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kevin', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7811904f-fdab-5fff-a89e-647b69536989', 'word_count': 451, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7811904f-fdab-5fff-a89e-647b69536989'}, {'abstract': 'Two state lawmakers, from Binghamton and near Buffalo, are pushing a measure that would allow a Manhattan caterer to secure a liquor license, which has drawn local opposition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/nyregion/upstate-lawmakers-back-manhattan-caterer-in-liquor-license-bid.html', 'snippet': 'Two state lawmakers, from Binghamton and near Buffalo, are pushing a measure that would allow a Manhattan caterer to secure a liquor license, which has drawn local opposition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY — What interest do lawmakers from Binghamton and Buffalo have in a Manhattan catering hall? Plenty, apparently. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Upstate Legislators Aid Caterer in Its Bid for Liquor License on Park Ave.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Upstate Legislators Aid Caterer in Its Bid for Liquor License on Park Ave.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Catering', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rose Group Park Avenue LLC', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'State Legislatures', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State Liquor Authority', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALCOHOLIC BEVERAGES', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lobbying and Lobbyists', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T01:22:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Danny Hakim', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Danny', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Hakim', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b6064934-88d2-53cc-a24f-efd3857daeaf', 'word_count': 604, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b6064934-88d2-53cc-a24f-efd3857daeaf'}, {'abstract': 'Winning lottery numbers for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.c