ate steps need to be taken to minimize this inhumane punishment.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/opinion/the-abuse-of-solitary-confinement.html', 'snippet': 'More than 80,000 American prisoners are being held in brutal isolation, which induces suffering and mental illness. Immediate steps need to be taken to minimize this inhumane punishment.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Solitary confinement in this country has devolved from a short-term punishment imposed infrequently for violating prison rules into a routine form of prison management. Today, tens of thousands of local, state and federal prisoners are held in prolonged abusive isolation — in tiny, windowless cells for up to 23 hours a day. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '26', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Abuse of Solitary Confinement', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Abuse of Solitary Confinement', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Prisons and Prisoners', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Durbin, Richard J', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Epps, Christopher P', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T01:59:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c2d20aa-f403-56c0-887e-4390d2eeddd3', 'word_count': 434, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c2d20aa-f403-56c0-887e-4390d2eeddd3'}, {'abstract': 'A very interesting concept by newcomer Caleb Emmons.', 'web_url': 'https://wordplay.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/not-there/', 'snippet': 'A very interesting concept by newcomer Caleb Emmons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Administrivial Notepa