ir maps: 857 student desks arrayed near the Washington Monument.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/us/21desks/21desks-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/21/us/21desks/21desks-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/us/21desks/21desks-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 649, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/us/21desks/21desks-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1299, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Those 857 Desks? A Message for the Candidates', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Those 857 Desks? A Message for the Candidates', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Washington (DC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Presidential Election of 2012', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'College Board', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dropouts', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T03:44:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adeshina Emmanuel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adeshina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Emmanuel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/83bed690-06f7-5d0a-b10f-d96e212d599e', 'word_count': 578, 'uri': 'nyt://article/83bed690-06f7-5d0a-b10f-d96e212d599e'}, {'abstract': 'The morning after Trayvon Martin was fatally shot by a neighborhood watch volunteer, Tracy Martin, Trayvon’s father, called the police to file a missing person report, audio tapes show.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/in-audio-of-police-call-trayvon-martins-father-is-heard-looking-for-son/', 'snippet': 'The morning after Trayvon Martin was fatally shot by a neighborhood watch volunteer, Tracy Martin, Trayvon’s father, called the police to file a missing person report, audio tapes show.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The morning after his 17-year-old son was fatally shot by a neighborhood watch volunteer in Sanford, Fla., Tracy Martin called a dispatcher about filing a missing person report, described his son’s now-famous attire and insisted the teenager did not know anyone in the neighborhood, according to recordings obtained by NBC News.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Audio of Police Call, Trayvon Martin’s Father Is Heard Looking for Son', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Martin, Trayvon', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBC News', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Sanford (Fla)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T03:47:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Flegenheimer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Flegenheimer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ed0e14b6-c20e-5e62-9bc8-a62ec468324d', 'word_count': 414, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ed0e14b6-c20e-5e62-9bc8-a62ec468324d'}, {'abstract': 'The publisher, in conjunction with city libraries and 3M, will make its books available in e-format, though they will not be available immediately after release.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/20/penguin-plan-would-make-its-e-books-available-in-new-york-city-libraries/', 'snippet': 'The publisher, in conjunction with city libraries and 3M, will make its books available in e-format, though they will not be available immediately after release.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the past year, Penguin Group USA has slowly pulled away from the library e-book market. Now it is tiptoeing back in. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'From Penguin, a Plan to Make Its E-Books Available in New York City Libraries', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Book Trade and Publishing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'E-Books and Readers', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Libraries and Librarians', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': '3M Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Public Library', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'OverDrive Inc', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Penguin Group', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T03:59:33+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Julie Bosman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Julie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bosman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/63e4b745-d00e-5d7c-b040-0f47a1af9d9b', 'word_count': 396, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63e4b745-d00e-5d7c-b040-0f47a1af9d9b'}, {'abstract': 'Cancer is a tricky balancing act, writes Suleika Jaouad: You have to be proactive about your medical condition, while simultaneously accepting the fact that you can’t change your reality.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/life-interrupted-fighting-cancer-and-myself/', 'snippet': 'Cancer is a tricky balancing act, writes Suleika Jaouad: You have to be proactive about your medical condition, while simultaneously accepting the fact that you can’t change your reality.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There is a dreadful routine to chemotherapy. My life has been synched to a chemotherapy calendar ever since my leukemia diagnosis last year. I have become an expert at predicting when side effects and symptoms will set in. It’s a ghoulish monthly party, and the guests always arrive on time: nausea, vomiting, chills, exhaustion, fever, mouth sores, pain, infections and emergency hospitalizations.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/health/21well_suleika/21well_suleika-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/health/21well_suleika/21well_suleika-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/health/21well_suleika/21well_suleika-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/21/health/21well_suleika/21well_suleika-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/health/21well_suleika/21well_suleika-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Life, Interrupted: Fighting Cancer, and Myself', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cancer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chemotherapy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Leukemia', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T04:01:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Suleika Jaouad', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Suleika', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jaouad', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/42e8e469-37df-52e5-bed1-7716aab8fb11', 'word_count': 603, 'uri': 'nyt://article/42e8e469-37df-52e5-bed1-7716aab8fb11'}, {'abstract': 'Ms. Tyrrell specialized in playing odd and grotesque characters in films like “Cry-Baby” and “Big Top Pee-wee.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/movies/susan-tyrrell-oscar-nominee-dies-at-67.html', 'snippet': 'Ms. Tyrrell specialized in playing odd and grotesque characters in films like “Cry-Baby” and “Big Top Pee-wee.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Susan Tyrrell, a whiskey-voiced character actress whose talent for playing the downtrodden, outré and grotesque led to an Oscar nomination for best supporting actress in the 1972 John Huston film “Fat City,” died on Saturday at her home in Austin, Tex. She was 67.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/arts/TYRRELL-obit/TYRRELL-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 784, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/arts/TYRRELL-obit/TYRRELL-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1568, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/arts/TYRRELL-obit/TYRRELL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/21/arts/TYRRELL-obit/TYRRELL-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/21/arts/TYRRELL-obit/TYRRELL-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Susan Tyrrell, Oscar Nominee, Dies at 67', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Susan Tyrrell, 67, Actress Who Played the Down, Out and Odd', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tyrrell, Susan', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Obituaries)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Academy Awards (Oscars)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T04:05:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Movies', 'byline': {'original': 'By Daniel E. Slotnik', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Daniel', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Slotnik', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/16