” in Los Angeles faces challenges: the city’s reputation for theatrical premieres and the source material’s acclaim as a 1973 film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES A DESECRATED statue of the Virgin Mary. A forebodingly steep outdoor staircase. A girl whose head twists all the way around her body and emits something thick, green and unpleasant from her mouth. ', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24EXORCIST1_SPAN/24EXORCIST1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 300, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24EXORCIST1_SPAN/24EXORCIST1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 300}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24EXORCIST1_SPAN/24EXORCIST1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24EXORCIST1_SPAN/24EXORCIST1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 801, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24EXORCIST1_SPAN/24EXORCIST1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24EXORCIST1_SPAN/24EXORCIST1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24EXORCIST1_SPAN/24EXORCIST1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 59, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy