ednesday, NBC News officials thought the show’s co-host would not be coming into work Thursday morning, according to people at the network who were not authorized to speak on the record. A replacement, Hoda Kotb, had been...', 'lead_paragraph': 'For a couple of hours on Wednesday, as Ann Curry’s negotiations to leave the “Today” show were first reported publicly, NBC News officials believed that she would not be coming into work Thursday morning, according to people at the network who were not authorized to speak on the record.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'NBC Contingency Plans Are Not Needed as Ann Curry Reports to Work at ‘Today’', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Television', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Curry, Ann', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lauer, Matt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NBC News', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T12:46:51+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brian Stelter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stelter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d613222e-fb03-506f-91f4-6f0386f41b9b', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d613222e-fb03-506f-91f4-6f0386f41b9b'}, {'abstract': 'China sharply criticized Vietnam on Thursday for passing a law that claims sovereignty over the Paracel and Spratly Islands, saying they are the “indisputable” territory of China.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/world/asia/china-criticizes