ny TransUnion.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Many Borrowers Fall Behind Again After Mortgage Modifications', 'kicker': 'Bucks', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'TransUnion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T15:33:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ann Carrns', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ann', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carrns', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e1db6f22-9434-570a-9f3f-2badc6f76d99', 'word_count': 377, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e1db6f22-9434-570a-9f3f-2badc6f76d99'}, {'abstract': '“Picturing the South,” an exhibition at the High Museum of Art in Atlanta, features photographs of the region.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/arts/design/picturing-the-south-photos-at-high-museum-in-atlanta.html', 'snippet': '“Picturing the South,” an exhibition at the High Museum of Art in Atlanta, features photographs of the region.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HOW can a museum promote new photography while also building its own holdings? With an initiative like “Picturing the South,” run by the High Museum of Art in Atlanta since 1996. Over the years the museum has asked nine photographers to create pictures inspired by the modern American South “without any strings attached,” said Brett Abbott, the curator of photography there. And it has included nearly 200 of the works into its collection.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/design/20120624-SOUTH-slide-4BP7/20120