e': 'Hodge', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 3}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/ccae9016-c88b-52f8-8ede-daf003247894', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/ccae9016-c88b-52f8-8ede-daf003247894'}, {'abstract': 'There are an estimated 1.3 million people immigrating to the United States each year. Many are children, and most are poor. In Queens,  almost half the residents were born outside the U.S. A Columbia journalism school student provides a multimedia report on how one middle school student is making the transition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/schoolbook/2012/06/21/discovering-a-new-land-in-middle-and-high-school/', 'snippet': 'There are an estimated 1.3 million people immigrating to the United States each year. Many are children, and most are poor. In Queens,  almost half the residents were born outside the U.S. A Columbia journalism school student provides a multimedia...', 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Discovering a New Land, in Middle and High School', 'kicker': 'SchoolBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T18:30:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By SCHOOLBOOK', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Schoolbook', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a9dbd1ad-48e7-5b44-a2dc-d0511f41c575', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a9dbd1ad-48e7-5b44-a2dc-d0511f41c575'}, {'abstract': 'The deal calls for Swiss banks to transfer American client data directly to the I.R.S.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/business/global/22iht-tax22.html', 'snippet': 'The deal calls for Swiss banks to transfer American client data directly to the I.R.S.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — Washington gained another victory on Thursday in its push to extend surveillance over Americans’ financial dealings when Switzerland joined the list of countries that have agreed to cooperate in an initiative to track down tax cheats overseas.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'U.S. and Switzerland Reach Deal on Sharing of Financial Account Data', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'U.S. and Switzerland Reach Deal on Sharing of Financial Account Data', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Switzerland', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Internal Revenue Service', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Taxation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Evasion', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tax Shelters', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T18:31:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Global Business', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Jolly', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jolly', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddaa872a-bd5c-5f99-903e-ef61f1c99148', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddaa872a-bd5c-5f99-903e-ef61f1c99148'}, {'abstract': 'Manufacturers have to weigh the desire to have devices do a lot of things against the simplicity that consumers demand — and deserve. They keep loading on features that drag down a product’s usefulness rather than adding to it.', 'web_url': 'https://bits.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/design-features/', 'snippet': 'Manufacturers have to weigh the desire to have devices do a lot of things against the simplicity that consumers demand — and deserve. They keep loading on features that drag down a product’s usefulness rather than adding to it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week, I took up an invitation from Samsung to go to its United States headquarters in New Jersey and check out a bunch of products.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/technology/personaltech/20bits-interface/20bits-interface-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 343, 'width': 610, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/20/technology/personaltech/20bits-interface/20bits-interface-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 343, 'width': 610, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Good Features Demand Good Design', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Android (Operating System)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer and Video Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mobile Applications', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smartphones', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Apple Incorporated', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'iTunes', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Jawbone', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NIKE Inc', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Samsung Group', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T18:33:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 