e it into the film.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/21/the-mystery-of-men-in-black-3-what-happened-to-court-street/', 'snippet': 'Scenes for “Men in Black 3″ were filmed on Court Street in Carroll Gardens, Brooklyn, but did not make it into the film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In May of last year, Court Street in Carroll Gardens, Brooklyn, was transported back in time for a few days.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In ‘Men in Black 3,’ Court Street Is Dismissed', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In ‘Men in Black 3,’ Court Street Is Dismissed', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Carroll Gardens (NYC)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-21T21:18:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Chris Palmer', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Chris', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Palmer', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee5359c6-c272-5cae-bfe5-4372b3d1178d', 'word_count': 625, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee5359c6-c272-5cae-bfe5-4372b3d1178d'}, {'abstract': 'Aaron Sorkin’s new HBO series, “The Newsroom,” rails against the shallow, ratings-driven discourse on cable news shows from a Brigadoon version of a newsroom.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/arts/television/the-newsroom-an-hbo-series-from-aaron-sorkin.html', 'snippet': 'Aaron Sorkin’s new HBO series, “The Newsroom,” rails against the shallow, ratings-driven discourse on cable news shows from a Brigadoon version of a newsroom.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It’s not enough to be right; everyone else must be wrong. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The N