lence From Larry Page', 'kicker': 'Bits', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Google Inc', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T00:45:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Streitfeld', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Streitfeld', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ddd0c090-b152-5aa5-8d24-88687b2cb518', 'word_count': 415, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ddd0c090-b152-5aa5-8d24-88687b2cb518'}, {'abstract': 'The issues of Representative Charles B. Rangel’s age and long tenure have hovered over his re-election bid.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/nyregion/rangel-seeks-to-play-down-concerns-about-age-and-health.html', 'snippet': 'The issues of Representative Charles B. Rangel’s age and long tenure have hovered over his re-election bid.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Congressman Charles B. Rangel was celebrating his 82nd birthday, but he appeared eager not to look like an old man.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/Y-RANGEL/Y-RANGEL-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': 