ts are dying in the desert at the same rate that they have been for years.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Watertown, Mass.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Death in the Desert', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Death in the Desert', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Mexico', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'ARIZONA', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deserts', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T01:05:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ananda Rose', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ananda', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rose', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/745553fe-7e81-599f-aa53-c005021818c6', 'word_count': 885, 'uri': 'nyt://article/745553fe-7e81-599f-aa53-c005021818c6'}, {'abstract': 'The bill seeks to counter the damage done by the Obama administration’s Secure Communities program, which has led to the deportations of thousands of people with no criminal records.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/opinion/californias-trust-act.html', 'snippet': 'The bill seeks to counter the damage done by the Obama administration’s Secure Communities program, which has led to the deportations of thousands of people with no criminal records.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A bill moving through the California Legislature, aptly named the Trust Act, seeks to counter the damage done to community policing and public safety by the Obama administration’s Secure Communities program. The program conducts mandatory immigration checks of everyone booked into local jails and has led to the deportations of many thousands of people with no criminal records, while impeding law enforcement.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '24', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'California’s Trust Act', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'California&#8217;s Trust Act', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'California', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigrants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Law and Legislation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ammiano, Tom', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T01:08:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4f26c28-4c6d-55dc-b4cf-ffded452f054', 'word_count': 297, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4f26c28-4c6d-55dc-b4cf-ffded452f054'}, {'abstract': 'Lottery numbers for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/nyregion/lottery-numbers-for-new-york-new-jersey-and-connecticut.html', 'snippet': 'Lottery numbers for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'June 21, 2012', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lottery Numbers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lottery Numbers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations'