abstract': 'After Stony Brook University’s underdog run to the College World Series, four seniors will move on from the fairy tale season whether they like it or not.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/nyregion/stony-brook-seniors-look-beyond-an-unlikely-season.html', 'snippet': 'After Stony Brook University’s underdog run to the College World Series, four seniors will move on from the fairy tale season whether they like it or not.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With their underdog College World Series run over, their\xa0improbable dash\xa0to prominence completed, Stony Brook University’s baseball team came together one last time for the sake of a game. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/STONYBROOK/STONYBROOK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/STONYBROOK/STONYBROOK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/STONYBROOK/STONYBROOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/STONYBROOK/STONYBROOK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/nyregion/STONYBROOK/STONYBROOK-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Four Seniors Look Beyond an Unlikely Run', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': Non