-bdd0-3869b687a2a9'}, {'abstract': 'The governing board at the University of Virginia, facing increasing pressure from on and off campus, will consider “possible changes in the terms of employment” of Teresa Sullivan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/education/university-of-virginias-governing-board-to-meet-on-ousted-presidents-fate.html', 'snippet': 'The governing board at the University of Virginia, facing increasing pressure from on and off campus, will consider “possible changes in the terms of employment” of Teresa Sullivan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The campaign for the reinstatement of Teresa Sullivan as the University of Virginia’s president took a giant step forward on Thursday as the governing Board of Visitors scheduled a special meeting for Tuesday to consider “possible changes in the terms of employment of the president,” the university announced.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 725, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1129, 'width': 799, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/22/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/22/us/VIRGINIA/VIRGINIA-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subT