d_paragraph': ' A year after it became clear that a new and highly touted lawn herbicide called Imprelis was killing and damaging many thousands of trees around the country, the manufacturer, DuPont, is busy processing claims for compensation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'DuPont Facing 30,000 Claims for Tree Deaths', 'kicker': 'Green', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defoliants and Herbicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lawns', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Trees and Shrubs', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DuPont Company', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Environmental Protection Agency', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Columbus (Ohio)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Minnesota', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T13:36:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Science', 'subsection_name': 'Environment', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jim Robbins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Robbins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/eeab874f-472e-56b3-86ff-b01d7f087b61', 'word_count': 1078, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eeab874f-472e-56b3-86ff-b01d7f087b61'}, {'abstract': 'The center Jordan Staal could leave the Penguins. The Rangers have another Staal brother. But so do the Hurricanes.', 'web_url': 'https://slapshot.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/rangers-could-pursue-jordan-staal/', 'snippet': 'The center Jordan Staal could leave the Penguins. The Rangers have another Staal brother. But so do the Hurricanes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PITTSBURGH–Add a new name to the Rangers’ wish list