i, Dan Barden and Marcel Beyer.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/books/review/new-fiction-by-nick-dybek-dan-barden-and-more.html', 'snippet': 'New fiction by Nick Dybek, Cristina Comencini, Dan Barden and Marcel Beyer.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WHEN CAPTAIN FLINT WAS STILL A GOOD MAN  By Nick Dybek.  Riverhead, $26.95. ', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/books/review/0624-WILLIAMS/0624-WILLIAMS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 821, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/books/review/0624-WILLIAMS/0624-WILLIAMS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1641, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/books/review/0624-WILLIAMS/0624-WILLIAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/books/review/0624-WILLIAMS/0624-WILLIAMS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/books/review/0624-WILLIAMS/0624-WILLIAMS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Fiction Chronicle', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Fiction Chronicle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Barden, Dan', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Beyer, Marcel', 'rank': 3, 'maj