expected, it was taxing for all sides. For the anti-James camp, it took energy to maintain a proper level of antipathy, when every missed fourth-quarter free throw or highlight-quality dunk qualifies as news in the James-obsessed N.B.A. Meanwhile, his defenders shouted themselves hoarse trying to drown out the detractors, especially with the Heat\'s tendency -- until the finals at least -- to make everything more difficult than it probably needed to be. And even those who sat back and considered "As LeBron Turns" to be a mostly fascinating nightly pschyodrama, it got rather exhausting. We worked overtime playing the role of his therapist and now we need a vacation.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/sports/basketball/23leadingpic/23leadingpic-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/sports/basketball/23leadingpic/23leadingpic-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1389, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/sports/basketball/23leadingpic/23leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/23/sports/basketball/23leadingpic/23leadingpic-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/sports/basketball/23leadingpic/23leadingpic-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s All Over Now. Or Is It?', 'kicker': 'Leading 