a6-8a46-5079-87a6-edc2e27a7ec1'}, {'abstract': 'Drivers of the 200 experienced stalling, while the Explorer was prone to loss of power steering, owners told the safety agency.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/n-h-t-s-a-opens-investigations-into-the-chrysler-200-and-ford-explorer/', 'snippet': 'Drivers of the 200 experienced stalling, while the Explorer was prone to loss of power steering, owners told the safety agency.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The National Highway Traffic Safety Administration has opened investigations into possible stalling problems on 87,000 Chrysler 200 sedans and a loss of power-steering assist on 83,000 Ford Explorers.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'N.H.T.S.A. Opens Investigations Into the Chrysler 200 and Ford Explorer', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobile Safety Features and Defects', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Chrysler Group LLC', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Ford Motor Company', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Honda Motor Co Ltd', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Mercedes-Benz', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Highway Traffic Safety Administration', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T15:40:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Christopher Jensen', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Christopher', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Jensen', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fa9e5c09-3c09-5d05-a30c-225916cebd0e', 'word_count': 608, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fa9e5c09-3c09-5d05-a30c-225916cebd0e'}, {'abstract': 'Many wealthy Americans may, or may not, lose one of their favorite tax breaks: the chance to give huge amounts of their estates to heirs tax-free.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/your-money/to-give-or-not-to-give-up-to-5-12-million.html', 'snippet': 'Many wealthy Americans may, or may not, lose one of their favorite tax breaks: the chance to give huge amounts of their estates to heirs tax-free.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TIME may — or may not — be running out for one of the biggest tax breaks for wealthy Americans: the chance to give up to $5.12 million to heirs tax-free and then pay a comparatively low 35 percent rate on any gift above that. The break is scheduled to expire in six months, but no one will hazard a guess about its fate because it is just one of many tax and spending measures expiring at the same time.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/your-money/23wealth/23wealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/23/your-money/23wealth/23wealth-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/your-money/23wealth/23wealth-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/your-money/23wealth/23wealth-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail',