ic “The Gold Rush” is released in a Criterion Collection set that includes the original 1925 version and Chaplin’s 1942 cut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/movies/homevideo/charlie-chaplin-in-the-gold-rush-remastered.html', 'snippet': 'Charlie Chaplin’s silent classic “The Gold Rush” is released in a Criterion Collection set that includes the original 1925 version and Chaplin’s 1942 cut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'AS “The Artist” arrives on home video this week with its five Oscars in tow, perhaps this mock-silent movie from Michel Hazanavicius will motivate viewers to check out some of the many authentic examples of silent-film art that are currently available on DVD and Blu-ray. The air of amused condescension that Mr. Hazanavicius’s film expresses toward an imaginary era of “lost innocence” quickly dissipates when exposed to the emotional complexities and stylistic refinements of a film like Charles Chaplin’s 1925 classic “The Gold Rush,” recently issued by the Criterion Collection in a digitally restored version that puts all previous editions of this great film to shame.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24KEHR_SPAN/24KEHR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24KEHR_SPAN/24KEHR_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24KEHR_SPAN/24KEHR-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/arts/24KEHR_SPAN/24KEHR-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1414, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJum