'abstract': 'From American Ballet Theater, a mixed repertory program: Frederick Ashton’s “Dream,” an unalloyed masterpiece of poetic drama, and “Firebird,” Alexei Ratmansky’s new comic psychodrama.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/arts/dance/american-ballet-theaters-dream-and-firebird.html', 'snippet': 'From American Ballet Theater, a mixed repertory program: Frederick Ashton’s “Dream,” an unalloyed masterpiece of poetic drama, and “Firebird,” Alexei Ratmansky’s new comic psychodrama.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With its production of “The Dream,” American Ballet Theater has reached the peak of its current season. No other production looks more beautiful on the stage of the Metropolitan Opera House. The set and costumes, designed by David Walker, create a completely satisfying world, with space, air and depth around the dancing. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/DREAM/DREAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 416, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/DREAM/DREAM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 416}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/DREAM/DREAM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1006, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/DREAM/DREAM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2013, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/DREAM/DREAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/DREAM/DREAM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/DREAM/DREAM-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In the Air and on the Ground, a Force of Nature in Ashton’s Fairyland', 'kicker': 'Dance Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In the Air and on the Ground, a Force of Nature in Ashton’s Fairyland', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Metropolitan Opera', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ratmansky, Alexei', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ashton, Frederick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Reyes, Xiomara', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Walker, David', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'AMERICAN BALLET THEATER', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cornejo, Herman', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Dancing', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T20:39:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Dance', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alastair Macaulay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alastair', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Macaulay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/a222b468-9707-5ffa-a5dc-9ec5f1db7bff', 'word_count': 798, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a222b468-9707-5ffa-a5dc-9ec5f1db7bff'}, {'abstract': 'At the Jacob’s Pillow Dance Festival, Circa presented an intimate, circus-style performance.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/arts/dance/circa-an-australian-troupe-at-jacobs-pillow.html', 'snippet': 'At the Jacob’s Pillow Dance Festival, Circa presented an intimate, circus-style performance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BECKET, Mass. — Contemporary circus shows are often dissatisfying affairs. Having stripped out many of the traditional elements that make a trip to the big top so pleasurable, they suffer from something of an identity crisis, padding their offerings instead with tedious emotional clichés and boilerplate design elements. Spectacle becomes schmaltz.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/dance/23circa/23circa-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/dance/23circa/23circa-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/dance/23circa/23circa-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/dance/23circa/23circa-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 640, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/dance/23circa/23circa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/dance/23circa/23circa-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/arts/dance/23circa/23circa-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 95, 'width': 95,