a crust with the taste of an almond shortbread cookie.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/one-summer-many-tarts/', 'snippet': 'Possibilities abound for summer tart fillings, especially when using a crust with the taste of an almond shortbread cookie.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In this week’s video, I demonstrate how to make an almond crust for a fruit tart. And in my Good Appetite column, I fill the crust with rose-scented pastry cream and fresh berries. But don’t stop there. This crust recipe, which tastes like an almond shortbread cookie, can be used for any kind of sweet tart. Here are some more ideas for tarting up summer fruit:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'One Summer, Many Tarts', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Desserts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fruit', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T21:33:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/951d783b-6caf-50be-bc8c-719609c39019', 'word_count': 194, 'uri': 'nyt://article/951d783b-6caf-50be-bc8c-719609c39019'}, {'abstract': 'The winning team is made up of Sally Brock, Nicola Smith, Fiona Brown, Susan Stockdale, Heather Dhondy and Nevena Senior.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/crosswords/bridge/england-wins-the-european-womens-bridge-championship.html', 'snippet': 'The winning team is made up of Sally Brock, Nicola Smith, Fiona Brown, Susan Stockdale, Heather Dhondy and Nevena Senior.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The new European Women’s Teams champion is England, represented by Sally Brock, Nicola Smith, Fiona Brown, Susan Stockdale, Heather Dhondy and Nevena Senior.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/crosswords/bridge/23card-img/23card-img-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/crosswords/bridge/23card-img/23card-img-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 327, 'width': 190, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'England Wins the European Women’s Bridge Championship', 'kicker': 'Bridge', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Bridge (Card Game)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cards and Card Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T21:36:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Crosswords & Games', 'subsection_name': 'Bridge', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phillip Alder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phillip', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Alder', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/077e9455-2528-5316-bc80-5deb14af76e6', 'word_count': 409, 'uri': 'nyt://article/077e9455-2528-5316-bc80-5deb14af76e6'}, {'abstract': 'A civil suit in state Supreme Court accuses police officers of continuing to unlawfully charge New Yorkers with crimes – rather than with non-criminal violations – for low-level marijuana possession, despite a directive from Commissioner Raymond W. Kelly directing them not to make such arrests.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/in-lawsuit-police-officers-are-accused-of-ignoring-directive-on-marijuana-arrests/', 'snippet': 'A civil suit in state Supreme Court accuses police officers of continuing to unlawfully charge New Yorkers with crimes – rather than with non-criminal violations – for low-level marijuana possession, despite a directive from Commissioner Raymond W...', 'lead_paragraph': 'Nine months ago, Police Commissioner Raymond W. Kelly issued a memorandum directing police officers not to make misdemeanor arrests for possession of small quantities of marijuana discovered when suspects are ordered to empty their pockets in stop, question and frisk encounters. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lawsuit Accuses Police of Ignoring Directive on Marijuana Arrests', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lawsuit Accuses Police Officers of Ignoring Directive on Marijuana Arrests', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marijuana', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Search and Seizure', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Suits and Litigation', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Legal Aid Society', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Police Department (NYC)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T21:40:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Wendy Ruderman and Joseph Goldstein', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Wendy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruderman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Joseph', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Goldstein', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank'