s://6thfloor.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/22/greek-tragedy-at-the-soccer-bar/', 'snippet': '“Greece never dies,” one supporter said before the match between Germany and Greece in the European Cup quarterfinals on Friday. Perhaps not. But Greece does lose.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The winds whipped up, the thunder cracked and lightning bolts slashed the sky as I walked in the rain to my local soccer bar Friday afternoon to watch the match between Germany and Greece in the European Cup quarterfinals. A friend texted me, implying that Zeus had orchestrated the weather, suggesting that Greece — the underdog — would prevail.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Greek Tragedy at the Soccer Bar', 'kicker': 'The 6th Floor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T23:01:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rosie Schaap', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Rosie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Schaap', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a723e0c9-925c-54e2-ab8f-000c44e46d5e', 'word_count': 411, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a723e0c9-925c-54e2-ab8f-000c44e46d5e'}, {'abstract': 'Responses to the “Unlocked” front-page series, about New Jersey’s halfway houses.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/opinion/the-trouble-with-halfway-houses.html', 'snippet': 'Responses to the “Unlocked” front-page series, about New Jersey’s halfway houses.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/opinion/0623LETTERS/0623LETTERS-jumbo.jpg', 'h