she was left in a coma.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It began as the sort of tense dispute that is a regular part of Manhattan’s rattle and hum: two people, a man and a woman, arguing over who had the rightful claim to a parking space.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Man Sentenced for Punching Woman in Fight for Parking Space', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Sentenced for Punch In Fight for Parking Space', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Assaults', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sentences (Criminal)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Manhattan (NYC)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parking', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wittner, Bonnie G', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T23:35:04+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Russ Buettner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Russ', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Buettner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/50f701ae-4b3f-50d6-8aed-a7e4537beb9d', 'word_count': 702, 'uri': 'nyt://article/50f701ae-4b3f-50d6-8aed-a7e4537beb9d'}, {'abstract': 'Treva, in West Hartford, which opened a year and a half ago, offers fresh, meat-heavy Italian fare prepared by an Albanian chef, Dorjan Puka.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/nyregion/a-review-of-treva-in-west-hartford.html', 'snippet': 'Treva, in West Hartford, which opened a year and a half ago, offers fresh, meat-heavy Italian fare prepared by an Albanian chef, Dorjan Puka.', 'lead_paragraph': 'My first pilgrimage to West Hartford’s newest gastronomic shrine came one Tuesday evening when a friend and I managed to snag the last two seats at the bar. Across the marble counter, we found ourselves facing hanging cured meats and a gleaming Berkel slicer. All around, patrons enjoying cocktails and prosecco were dangling bits of prosciutto into their mouths.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24DINECT1_SPAN/24DINECT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24DINECT1_SPAN/24DINECT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 380}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24DINECT1_SPAN/24DINECT-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24DINECT1_SPAN/24DINECT-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1360, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24DINECT1_SPAN/24DINECT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24DINECT1_SPAN/24DINECT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24DINECT1_SPAN/24DINECT1_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Even a Martini Has Prosciutto in It', 'kicker': 'Connecticut Dining | West H