7e2-5c74-8b2a-cbaafa9fe85d'}, {'abstract': '“American Stare,” a new play by Tony Glazer at the New Jersey Repertory Company, pits a bright teenager against a slick corporate executive in a struggle over a debt-ridden neighbor’s lawsuit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/nyregion/a-review-of-american-stare-at-the-new-jersey-repertory-company.html', 'snippet': '“American Stare,” a new play by Tony Glazer at the New Jersey Repertory Company, pits a bright teenager against a slick corporate executive in a struggle over a debt-ridden neighbor’s lawsuit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New Jersey Repertory Company valiantly strains its modest stage capabilities to present the world premiere of “American Stare,” a new play by Tony Glazer that demands six actors and a realistic setting for a contemporary story that takes place in a trailer park in South Florida.', 'print_section': 'NJ', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1/24ARTSNJ1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1/24ARTSNJ1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1/24ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1/24ARTSNJ1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24ARTSNJ1/24ARTSNJ1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 200, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Showdown at the Trailer Park', 'kicker': 'Arts | New Jersey', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Showdown at the Trailer Park', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New Jersey Repertory Company', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Glazer, Tony (1967- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bergman, Evan (Theater Director)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-22T23:55:19+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Sommers', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sommers', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/8116c4ac-8966-55db-807f-ef7129a18c8a', 'word_count': 643, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8116c4ac-8966-55db-807f-ef7129a18c8a'}, {'abstract': 'The City of Birmingham Symphony Orchestra performs Jonathan Harvey’s “Weltethos,” with a libretto by Hans Küng, as part of the London 2012 Festival.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/arts/music/jonathan-harveys-weltethos-in-england.html', 'snippet': 'The City of Birmingham Symphony Orchestra performs Jonathan Harvey’s “Weltethos,” with a libretto by Hans Küng, as part of the London 2012 Festival.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BIRMINGHAM, England — From the start, the organizers of the London 2012 Festival wanted this celebration to take place all over Britain. As if to emphasize that goal, none of the major events that officially opened the festival on Thursday night took place in London.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 's