ing-who-cling-to-the-nest.html', 'snippet': 'Despite the increasing sophistication of today’s youth, fewer of them are leaving home to lead independent lives after college.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Not too long ago, I asked a friend, the mother of two daughters who are 9 and 13, whether she had ever taken her children to Disney World — a contractual obligation of parenthood, I assumed. The girls attend a progressive school in New York, and their tastes and proclivities run accordingly. The older might be found on a Saturday cooking ground ostrich in spices, in deference to ancient Roman cuisine. The younger can solve elaborate cubic puzzles in the time it takes to turn on a faucet. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24BIG-2/24BIG-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24BIG-2/24BIG-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24BIG-2/24BIG-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 650, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24BIG-2/24BIG-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1300, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24BIG-2/24BIG-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/nyregion/24BIG-2/24BIG-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'ra