', 'lead_paragraph': 'France and Holland were never pitted directly against each other at this summer’s European Championships, but they continue to compete for the title of European soccer’s perennial subversives.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Could a Falling Out Bring France Together?', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Soccer', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'UEFA European Football Championship', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T06:25:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By Graham Ruthven', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Graham', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Ruthven', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d4386c59-38a6-5376-abea-38e63c2af469', 'word_count': 673, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d4386c59-38a6-5376-abea-38e63c2af469'}, {'abstract': 'A round-up of news from across India.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/newswallah-regional-edition/', 'snippet': 'A round-up of news from across India.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jammu and Kashmir: In northern Kashmir, near the Line of Control that divides the Indian and Pakistan-controlled territories in the region, security personnel recovered a huge cache of arms and ammunition, Kashmir live reported. The supplies were “apparently dumped by arms smugglers for use of militants operating in the Valley,” the newspaper wrote.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: Bharat Edition', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Andhra Pradesh (India)',