ern computing — is being celebrated as a pioneer and mourned as a victim of intolerance.', 'web_url': 'https://rendezvous.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/father-of-modern-computing-nazi-code-breaker-homosexual/', 'snippet': 'A hundred years after his birth, the British mathematician Alan Turing — the father of modern computing — is being celebrated as a pioneer and mourned as a victim of intolerance.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — The centenary of the birth of Alan Turing, the World War II code-breaker and father of modern computing, was marked on Saturday with memorials, exhibitions and academic gatherings in his native Britain and beyond.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/blogs/rdv-turing/rdv-turing-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/23/blogs/rdv-turing/rdv-turing-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Father of Modern Computing, Nazi Code Breaker, Homosexual', 'kicker': 'IHT Rendezvous', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mathematics', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Turing, Alan M', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T11:45:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Harvey Morris', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Harvey', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Morris', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1