 blessing of governments.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/world/americas/rio20-conference-ends-with-some-progress-on-the-sidelines.html', 'snippet': 'The meeting produced no enforceable environmental commitments, but showed the growing capacity of organizations and corporations to mold effective action without the blessing of governments.', 'lead_paragraph': 'RIO DE JANEIRO — Burdened by low expectations, snarled by endless traffic congestion and shunned by President Obama, the United Nations Conference on Sustainable Development ended here as it began, under a shroud of withering criticism.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/world/RIO/RIO-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/world/RIO/RIO-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Progress on the Sidelines as Rio Conference Ends', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Progress on the Sidelines As Rio Conference Ends', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Global Warming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Rio de Janeiro (Brazil)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Greenhouse Gas Emissions', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T14:16:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Romero and John M. Broder', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Romero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1e1775ce-b600-52e5-bb6f-f0d88c72fcd2', 'word_count': 836, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1e1775ce-b600-52e5-bb6f-f0d88c72fcd2'}, {'abstract': 'The Spring 2013 men’s collection show from Burberry at Milan Fashion Week.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/now-streaming-burberry-spring-2013-mens-collection/', 'snippet': 'The Spring 2013 men’s collection show from Burberry at Milan Fashion Week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Spring 2013 men’s collection from Burberry at Milan Fashion Week.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Now Streaming | Burberry Prorsum Spring 2013 Men’s Collection Show', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T14:16:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fcafb24a-79e1-5305-9c67-c4b418e1bb88', 'word_count': 16, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fcafb24a-79e1-5305-9c67-c4b418e1bb88'}, {'abstract': 'An auspicious opening to the men’s wear fashion week here, Sander’s show was a master class in cut and color, pattern and proportion.', 'web_url': 'https://runway.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/at-sanders-show-watching-a-masters-work/', 'snippet': 'An auspicious opening to the men’s wear fashion week here, Sander’s show was a master class in cut and color, pattern and proportion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'MILAN — Rust never sleeps, as Neil Young once famously noted. Yet, after years spent tending her gardens outside Hamburg, Germany, in what can only be called semi-voluntary retirement Jil Sander returned Saturday to the label that bears her name and the city where she made her reputation to prove that, if you are sufficiently gifted, you can outrun it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At Sander’s Show, Watching a Master’s Work', 'kicker': 'On the Runway', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fashion and Apparel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sander, Jil', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Hamburg (Germany)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Milan (Italy)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T15:03:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Guy Trebay', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Guy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Trebay', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/8810eb8f-053b-5da6-b6e6-8bf0ae3e7f48', 'word_count': 450, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8810eb8f-053b-5da6-b6e6-8bf0ae3e7f48'}, {'abstract': 'The long-gestating Tesla Model S electric sedan began retail deliveries on Friday at the start-up’s factory in the Bay Area.', 'web_url': 'https://wheels.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/tesla-motors-launches-model-s-in-california/', 'snippet': 'The long-gestating Tesla Model S electric sedan began retail deliveries on Friday at the start-up’s factory in the Bay Area.', 'lead_paragraph': 'FREMONT, Calif. — On a Friday filled with press conferences, roundtable discussions, production-line walk-throughs and chaperoned test drives, it was only at a concluding pep rally, held on the Tesla Motors factory floor here, that the mood became palpable. As executives for the electric-vehicle start-up handed keys to the first Model S sedans to retail customers, the sense of a victory, to some an improbable one, came across as loud and giddy as any celebration of a basketball championship.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Leaving Baggage On the Dock, a Flagship Departs From California', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electric and Hybrid Vehicles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Jurvetson, Steve', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Musk, Elon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Energy Department', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Tesla Motors Inc', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Fremont (Calif)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T15:13:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josie Garthwaite', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Garthwaite', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/56deb351-d729-5448-820f-461b6d04467b', 'word_count': 916, 'uri': 'nyt://article/56deb351-d729-5448-820f-461b6d04467b'}, {'abstract': 'Last week, the Rangers closer Joe Nathan passed Mariano Rivera as the career leader in save percentage.', 'web_url': 'https://bats.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/23/rangers-closer-nathan-passes-rivera/', 'snippet': 'Last week, the Rangers closer Joe Nathan passed Mariano Rivera as the career leader in save percentage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'June has been very good for Texas Rangers closer Joe Nathan. He is the only player from Stony Brook University to reach the major leagues, and four years ago he donated $500,000 to help the university build a baseball field, which bears his name. The Seawolves reached their first College World Series this month, and Nathan has thrived along with his alma mater.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rangers’ Closer Nathan Passes Rivera', 'kicker': 'Bats', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Extra Bases: Passing Rivera', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Nathan, Joe', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Mariano', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'State University of New York at Stony Brook', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Texas Rangers', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T15:16:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tyler Kepner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tyler', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kepner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/fb6fb87a-7abb-5ca9-ac4f-c8036586cb54', 'word_count': 209, 'uri': 'nyt://article/fb6fb87a-7abb-5ca9-ac4f-c8036586cb54'}, {'abstract': 'Emil Zatopek won the 5,000 and 10,000 meters and the marathon — all in record times — at the 1952 Olympics in Helsinki, Finland.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/sports/olympics/for-emil-zatopek-unmatched-glory-at-1952-olympics.html', 'snippet': 'Emil Zatopek won the 5,000 and 10,000 meters and the marathon — all in record times — at the 1952 Olympics in Helsinki, Finland.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I have been fortunate to attend many big international track meets. Each one brought memorable moments, including record performances and crowds of spectators that intermingled in appreciation of the sport.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/zatopek1/zatopek1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 818, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/zatopek1/zatopek1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1636, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/zatopek1/zatopek1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/zatopek1/zatopek1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/zatopek1/zatopek1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': '60 Years Ago, an Olympic Trifecta of Endurance', 'kicker': 'Cheering Section', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '60 Years Ago, An Olympic Trifecta Of Endurance', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Track and Field', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marathon Running', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zatopek, Emil', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value':