 necessary,” complicating a tense relationship.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/world/middleeast/turkey-promises-retaliation-in-response-to-downing-of-military-jet-by-syria.html', 'snippet': 'Turkey’s president said his country would do “whatever is necessary,” complicating a tense relationship.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CAIRO — Turkey’s president said Saturday that his country would do “whatever is necessary” in response to the downing of a Turkish military jet by Syria, adding a new complication to the tense relationship between the former allies split by Turkey’s support for Syrian rebels trying to overthrow the government.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkey Vows Action After Downing of Jet by Syria', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkey Promises to Take ‘Necessary’ Action After Downing of a Jet by Syria', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gul, Abdullah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T15:38:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Liam Stack', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Liam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stack', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a70839d4-49c9-5281-97ec-b267a73e17d9', 'word_count': 886, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a70839d4-49c9-5281-97ec-b267a73e17d9'}, {'abstract': 'R. A. Dickey’s knuckleballs come in at a different speed than the pitches of his opponents, but umpires can adjust and make the right calls, two veteran umps say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/sports/baseball/knuckleball-is-tough-for-umpires-to-follow.html', 'snippet': 'R. A. Dickey’s knuckleballs come in at a different speed than the pitches of his opponents, but umpires can adjust and make the right calls, two veteran umps say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Greg Maddux won 355 games as a starting pitcher based largely on his ability to vary the speed between his fastball and changeup by as little as five to six miles per hour, which was enough to throw hitters off balance.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/dog-umpires-1/dog-umpires-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/dog-umpires-1/dog-umpires-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/dog-umpires-1/dog-umpires-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/dog-umpires-1/dog-umpires-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/sports/dog-umpires-1/dog-umpires-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 151, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Not So Easy on the Eyes', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline':