e All England Club is perhaps the most challenging in tennis, akin to plunging into a cold tub right after a soothing dip in the whirlpool — a shock to the system without the chattering teeth. Patience may be a virtue at the French Open, which rewards consistent baseliners, but it is a vice at Wimbledon, where, Maria Sharapova said, anything longer than a five-ball rally means “you’re probably doing something wrong.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Serena Williams Feeling Confident Ahead of Wimbledon', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Williams, Serena', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-23T19:00:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By Ben Shpigel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Ben', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Shpigel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a631a812-5a6a-53dc-9d58-beeb4a2c3790', 'word_count': 714, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a631a812-5a6a-53dc-9d58-beeb4a2c3790'}, {'abstract': 'The police said that detectives had recovered the gun used in the triple killing and that a shirt found at the site tied the 30-year-old suspect to the crime.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/nyregion/suspect-is-arrested-in-triple-killing-near-columbia-university.html', 'snippet': 'The police said that detectives had recovered the gun used in the triple killing and that a shirt found at the site tied the 30-year-old suspect to the crime.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Detectives on Saturday arrested a 30-year-old man suspected of fata