hould be postponed because of weather? Sometimes, apparently, the process resembles a student council election.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Secret Ballot, Pole-Vaulters Have Their Say', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Pole Vault', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-24T00:14:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a480424d-773c-5b36-a72d-4fc94529bb03', 'word_count': 648, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a480424d-773c-5b36-a72d-4fc94529bb03'}, {'abstract': 'Spain dominated France at Euro 2012 quarterfinals, and advanced to the semifinals on Wednesday, but the defending champion failed to reach the impossibly high bar it has set for itself.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/sports/soccer/euro-2012-critics-point-to-the-flaws-in-spains-art.html', 'snippet': 'Spain dominated France at Euro 2012 quarterfinals, and advanced to the semifinals on Wednesday, but the defending champion failed to reach the impossibly high bar it has set for itself.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KIEV, Ukraine — A consensus has formed at Euro 2012. Germany is the team to beat. Spain cannot decide on a lineup. It seems unsettled, if hardly unnerved. This is what happens when people are no longer content with beauty and now expect perfection.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None