 Shin of Flushing, Queens. The Rev. Beau Underwood, a Disciples of Christ minister, performed the ceremony at the National City Christian Church in Washington, where he is the church’s assistant pastor. The Rev. Hyong Sohn, a Baptist minister, assisted in the ceremony. ', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/fashion/weddings/24KIMjpg/24KIMjpg-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/fashion/weddings/24KIMjpg/24KIMjpg-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/fashion/weddings/24KIMjpg/24KIMjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/24/fashion/weddings/24KIMjpg/24KIMjpg-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/24/fashion/weddings/24KIMjpg/24KIMjpg-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ji Kim and Albert Shin', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Ji Kim, Albert Shin', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weddings and Engagements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-24T04:17:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Society', 'section_name': 'Fashion & Style', 'subsection_name': 'Weddings', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/09468717-5eb9-5b7f-9164-5686a23a89e5', 'word_count': 165, 'uri': 'nyt://article/09468717-5eb9-5b7f-9164-5686a23a89e5'}, {'abstract': 'The Yankees turned a walk, a misplay in the outfield and a hanging pitch into a four-run seventh on their way to a victory at Citi Field.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/sports/baseball/in-a-few-quick-missteps-the-mets-watch-a-win-slip-away.html', 'snippet': 'The Yankees turned a walk, a misplay in the outfield and a hanging pitch into a four-run seventh on their way to a victory at Citi Field.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It only takes a few misplays to squander a sizable lead in baseball. That was all it took Saturday as a walk here, a single and a fielding mishap there, a pitch up in the zone sent over the fence — all in a few minutes — spoiled what had been a big week for the Mets. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In a Few Quick Missteps, the Mets Watch a Win Slip Away', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In a few Quick Missteps, the Mets Watch a Win Slip Away', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Duda, Lucas', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swisher, Nick', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-24T05:29:32+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hunter Atkins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hunter', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Atkins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b0a5ec46-b3ec-50d7-b0be-b30bab468db4', 'word_count': 682, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b0a5ec46-b3ec-50d7-b0be-b30bab468db4'}, {'abstract': 'Top magazine and long-form articles this week.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/newswallah-long-reads-edition-32/', 'snippet': 'Top magazine and long-form articles this week.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Outlook magazine in its recent issue weighs in on the debate about having a single entrance examination for all engineering colleges in India. The federal minister for human resource development, Kapil Sibal, is of the opinion that a single entrance examination will aid in creating uniformity in the system and reduce the applicants’ burden of stress, preparation time and money spent on examination fees. However, this proposal has not been well received. The piece delves into the negative reactions this announcement has engendered among the management of the prestigious Indian Institute of Technology (I.I.T.), which has several campuses in India, alumni of the institution and students aspiring to seek admission in the premier engineering institution. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: Long Reads Edition', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Diet and Nutrition', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drugs (Pharmaceuticals)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-24T08:14:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neha Thirani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neha', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Thirani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6a9e0