ield Association does not have a procedure in place to handle a tie between runners for the final spot on a given Olympic team so officials met late into Saturday night discussing how to resolve the dead-heat finish between Allyson Felix and Jeneba Tarmoh in the 100 meters. As it turns out, the discussions may drag on even longer.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'With Opposition to Runoff, Decision on Final Olympic Spot Could Be Delayed', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Track and Field', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Felix, Allyson', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tarmoh, Jeneba', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Track and Field Assn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-24T18:20:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Borden', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borden', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a04ce5e3-320f-5393-94a5-72b6e9ecb6a1', 'word_count': 425, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a04ce5e3-320f-5393-94a5-72b6e9ecb6a1'}, {'abstract': 'Microsoft’s plan to create its own tablet is the most striking evidence yet of the friction with its partners on the hardware side of the PC business.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/technology/companies/with-tablet-microsoft-takes-aim-at-hardware-missteps.html', 'snippet': 'Microsoft’s plan to create its own tablet is the most striking evidence 