uggling operation early Saturday, a spokesman for the American Embassy in Honduras said Sunday. The man who was killed had been reaching for his weapon, the official said, and the agent fired in self-defense.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/global-home/25dea-image/25dea-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/global-home/25dea-image/25dea-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Man Is Killed by U.S. Agent in Drug Raid in Honduras', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Is Killed By U.S. Agent In Drug Raid In Honduras', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Drug Abuse and Traffic', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Honduras', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Drug Enforcement Administration', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-24T19:53:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Americas', 'byline': {'original': 'By Charlie Savage', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Charlie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Savage', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9b38f373-c15a-51ba-a9fd-700899dc922a', 'word_count': 742, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9b38f373-c15a-51ba-a9fd-700899dc922a'}, {'abstract': 'The Caramoor International Music Festival’s 2012 edition opened with “A Midsummer Night’s Dream.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/arts/music/caramoor-international-music-festival-2012-in-katonah.html', 'snippet': 'The Caramoor International Music Festival’s 2012 edition opened with “A Midsummer Night’s Dream.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'KATONAH, N.Y. — The Caramoor International Music Festival has a stranger back story than most summer music destinations, and its quirkiness remains a strong draw. It takes place on a 90-acre estate of Italianate gardens, picnic grounds, winding paths, outdoor theaters and an architecturally disparate country villa. The villa, cobbled together by Lucie and Walter Rosen, includes rooms from European palaces that they shipped over from Europe in the 1930s and filled with artifacts they had collected, among them a 14th-century Florentine tapestry and a bed that belonged to Pope Urban VIII. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/arts/caramoor/caramoor-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 660, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/arts/caramoor/caramoor-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1321, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/arts/caramoor/caramoor-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/25/arts/caramoor/caramoor-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/arts/caramoor/caramoor-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Festival With Classical Roots and Fanciful Surroundings', 'kicker': 'Music Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Festival With Classical Roots And Fanciful Surroundings', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Orchestra of St Luke's", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Caramoor International Music Festival', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-24T20:06:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By Allan Kozinn', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Allan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kozinn', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/904278e4-7b47-5966-8207-f491b62ac3a0', 'word_count': 594, 'uri': 'nyt://article/904278e4-7b47-5966-8207-f491b62ac3a0'}, {'abstract': 'Missy Franklin, 17, comes into this week’s United States trials a favorite to make the team bound for the London Games in multiple events, starting with the 100 backstroke preliminaries and semifinals Tuesday.', 'web_url': 'https://london2012.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/24/franklin-projected-as-a-star-of-the-games-but-first-she-has-to-make-the-team/', 'snippet': 'Missy Franklin, 17, comes into this week’s United States trials a favorite to make the team bound for the London Games in multiple events, starting with the 100 backstroke preliminaries and semifinals Tuesday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OMAHA — This week has been in Missy Franklin’s sights for four years, since she left here