c8097731-6a3c-5666-9a49-0b9c1f4fecb0'}, {'abstract': 'Data will include the home price index for April and personal income and spending for May, and companies reporting results will include H&R Block, General Mills and Research in Motion.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/business/economy/economic-reports-for-the-week-of-june-25.html', 'snippet': 'Data will include the home price index for April and personal income and spending for May, and companies reporting results will include H&R Block, General Mills and Research in Motion.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ECONOMIC REPORTS New home sales for May (Monday); the Standard & Poor’s/Case-Shiller home price index for April and consumer confidence for June (Tuesday); durable goods for May and pending home sales for May (Wednesday); weekly jobless claims and first-quarter gross domestic product (final) (Thursday); personal income and spending for May, the Chicago purchasing managers’ index for June and the Thomson Reuters/University of Michigan consumer sentiment index for June (Friday).', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Economic Reports for the Week Ahead', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Looking Ahead', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'European Sovereign Debt Crisis (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T01:42:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Schedule', '_id': 'nyt://article/eb626c35-06d5-5809-814e-5b5d0aaf82e1', 'word_count': 313, 'uri': 'nyt://article/eb626c35-06d5-5809-814e-5b5d0aaf82e1'}, {'abstract': 'The impending decision by the Supreme Court on President Obama’s health care law will be the beginning of the end of one of the most divisive policy battles in decades.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/us/politics/on-left-and-right-a-frenzy-awaiting-health-care-ruling.html', 'snippet': 'The impending decision by the Supreme Court on President Obama’s health care law will be the beginning of the end of one of the most divisive policy battles in decades.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Lawmakers are not usually eager to get back to Washington after a weekend in their districts, especially during campaign season. But Representative Michele Bachmann boarded a flight from Minnesota on Sunday night — even though the House will not meet until Tuesday — to make sure she would not miss the Washington moment she has been excitedly anticipating, the Supreme Court ruling on President Obama’s health care law.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/us/sub-mood/sub-mood-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/25/us/sub-mood/sub-mood-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/us/sub-mood/sub-mood-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 887, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/us/sub-mood/sub-mood-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1775, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Polarized Over Health Care, United on Drama of Ruling', 'kicker': 'Washington Memo', 'content_kicker': None, 'pr