bledon-kim-clijsters-is-getting-ready-to-say-goodbye.html', 'snippet': 'Worn down by injuries, her ranking down to No. 47, Kim Clijsters knows her time in tennis is growing short, and she seems comfortable with that.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WIMBLEDON, England — No, no, no, Kim Clijsters was saying. This time, there is no doubt. None at all. Not a trace. At the end of her last match here — be it Monday against the former No. 1 Jelena Jankovic, or on July 7 in what would be an improbable appearance in the women’s singles final, or at any stage between — Clijsters will bid farewell to Wimbledon, a tournament that has given her a stable of fond memories but no championship.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/subYCLIJSTERS/subYCLIJSTERS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 796, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/subYCLIJSTERS/subYCLIJSTERS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1592, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/subYCLIJSTERS/subYCLIJSTERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/subYCLIJSTERS/subYCLIJSTERS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/subYCLIJSTERS/subYCLIJSTERS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Clijsters Summons Last Push, Comfortably on the Way 