: 'R. A. Dickey, a likely National League All-Star, put his body at risk while beating Raul Ibanez’s throw home on David Wright’s single in the fifth inning.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The throw was coming from left field, and R. A. Dickey was determined to beat it to the plate. Never mind that Dickey was pitching his poorest outing in two months. If there was any way of salvaging a win, then Dickey, now a base runner, needed to take a chance sliding into home.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 248, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 248}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/METS/METS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/METS/METS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 846, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/METS/METS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/sports/METS/METS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'When Knuckler Doesn’t Behave, Dickey Lowers His Shoulder', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'When Knuckler Doesn’t Behave, Dickey Lowers His Shoulder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Records and Achievements', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Yankees', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dickey, R A', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T05:14:59+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Zach Berman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Zach', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Berman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7be754c5-247f-5bdd-9839-1b91297969d8', 'word_count': 817, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7be754c5-247f-5bdd-9839-1b91297969d8'}, {'abstract': '10-year-old Meena Devi, cooks, cleans and takes care of her two siblings after her mother died of starvation in Bihar’s Jhanwatola village.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/survival-without-adult-supervision-stark-reality-in-rural-bihar/', 'snippet': '10-year-old Meena Devi, cooks, cleans and takes care of her two siblings after her mother died of starvation in Bihar’s Jhanwatola village.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Meena Devi is unlike any little girl you will ever meet. In many ways, she isn’t even a child. The afternoon we met, she’d cooked lunch for herself and her older brother. “I made dal bhat tarkari,” she said proudly, referring to a local dish of rice, lentils and seasonal vegetables. “But we are out of dal, so really, it was just bhat tarkari.” Meena also washes her family’s dirty clothes and drags her brother off to school every morning. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Survival Without Adult Supervision, Stark Reality in Rural Bihar', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Orphans and Orphanages', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Poverty', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Bihar (India)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Jhanwatola (India)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T05:32:47+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sonia Faleiro', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sonia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Faleiro', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a1b2f285-69c0-5c53-9cb8-86f18b1f56fe', 'word_count': 1126, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a1b2f285-69c0-5c53-9cb8-86f18b1f56fe'}, {'abstract': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/news-quiz-june-25-2012/', 'snippet': 'See what you know about the news of the day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'See what you know about the news below. To prepare, you might scan the articles or summaries on today’s paper. Good luck!', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'News Quiz | June 25, 2012', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T06:00:15+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By Anastasia Economides', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Anastasia', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Economides', 'qualifier': None, 'ti