/d0e0eb8f-11ac-5d0f-bd02-216bac249fd0', 'word_count': 1132, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d0e0eb8f-11ac-5d0f-bd02-216bac249fd0'}, {'abstract': 'A philosopher explores a possible role for the United Nations in fostering “ecological citizenship.”', 'web_url': 'https://dotearth.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/beyond-rio-pursuing-ecological-citizenship/', 'snippet': 'A philosopher explores a possible role for the United Nations in fostering “ecological citizenship.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m posting a few final reflections related to the “Rio+20” United Nations Conference on Sustainable Development, which marked the 20th anniversary of the first “Earth Summit” and concluded ingloriously in Rio de Janeiro on Friday. If there is to be a 40th anniversary, what approaches or initiatives would you want to see there that weren’t in play this time around?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Beyond Rio: Pursuing ‘Ecological Citizenship’', 'kicker': 'Dot Earth', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Earth', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Ethics (Personal)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'International Relations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reservoirs', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sustainable Living', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United Nations Framework Convention on Climate Change', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ENVIRONMENT', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pace University', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T16:50:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'origi