.com/2012/06/25/in-the-400-good-heats-for-phelps-and-lochte/', 'snippet': 'Michael Phelps and Ryan Lochte swim well in the preliminaries of the 400-meter individual medley on Monday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OMAHA – From his thousand-meter stare before the race’s start to his seemingly effortless finish, Michael Phelps looked like his old self on Monday in the preliminaries of the 400-meter individual medley at the United States Olympic Trials.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In the 400, Good Heats for Phelps and Lochte', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Clary, Tyler', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Lochte, Ryan', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Phelps, Michael', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Omaha (Neb)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T18:51:00+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/022013f2-ccb5-5c99-989b-478c9ce6288d', 'word_count': 395, 'uri': 'nyt://article/022013f2-ccb5-5c99-989b-478c9ce6288d'}, {'abstract': 'The teams form an unusual pairing in the Cosmos Copa, a tournament of community-based teams in New York City that play to represent their heritage and culture.', 'web_url': 'https://goal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/play-trumps-politics-as-u-s-and-afghanistan-meet-in-new-york-tournament/', 'snippet': 'The teams form an unusual pairing in the Cosmos Copa, a tournament of community-based teams in New York City that play to represent their heritage and culture.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Cosmos Copa isn’t your average amateur tournament. The former France international Youri Djorkaeff decided to play once more, taking the field with his countrymen in the inaugural competition. Pele handed out awards in 2009 and 2010. Combine this sprinkling of stardust with the inevitable drama when national teams drawn from the New York City area are matched up and you have a distinctive tournament. And, in this year’s qualifying round, the Copa set up an unusual encounter when teams representing the United States and Afghanistan were paired.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Play Trumps Politics as U.S. and Afghanistan Meet in New York Tournament', 'kicker': 'Goal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T18:59:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Soccer', 'byline': {'original': 'By matthew nelson', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4ffc6662-6ecf-5eb8-9380-59d67a21e730', 'word_count': 694, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4ffc6662-6ecf-5eb8-9380-59d67a21e730'}, {'abstract': 'Danilo Scarpati’s Milan fashion week photo diary.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/photos-of-the-moment-moncler-gamme-bleu/', 'snippet': 'Danilo Scarpati’s Milan fashion week photo diary.', 'lead_paragraph': 'var data;function jsonSlideshowCallback(response){data = response;}NYTD.options = {source: data,cropType: \'blog480\',appendTo: \'fullScreenSlideShow\',showHeadLine: \'false\', renderstyle: "embeddedSlideShowTmag"}', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Photos of The Moment | Moncler Gamme Bleu', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'co