, 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'byline': {'original': 'By Somini Sengupta', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Somini', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sengupta', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e08dd4d8-b96c-5216-ac39-0027c69697c2', 'word_count': 167, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e08dd4d8-b96c-5216-ac39-0027c69697c2'}, {'abstract': 'The Supreme Court announced that it would issue the rest of its decisions for its current term on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/us/health-care-ruling-expected-thursday.html', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court announced that it would issue the rest of its decisions for its current term on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court announced on Monday that it would issue the rest of its decisions for its current term on Thursday, making it very likely that a decision on the comprehensive law overhauling health care will come that day.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Care Ruling Expected Thursday', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health Care Ruling Expected Thursday', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T20:40:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'National', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/829608c9-6087-5e61-bb4a-342665fd3cb4', 'word_count': 197, 'uri': 'nyt://article/829608c9-6087-5e61-bb4a-342665fd3cb4'}, {'abstract': 'No longer an afterthought, food and drink are becoming increasingly important to auction houses to lure bidders.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/dining/auction-houses-add-food-and-drink-to-lure-clients.html', 'snippet': 'No longer an afterthought, food and drink are becoming increasingly important to auction houses to lure bidders.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEFORE an auction of rare Italian masterworks by Fra Bartolommeo and Simone Martini, Sotheby’s rolled out some rarefied Italian treats, including imported guanciale in vinaigrette. For an offering of Japanese contemporary art, potential bidders were plied with freshly sliced sushi. And for a preview before the sale of “The Scream”\xa0by Edvard Munch, who grew up in Oslo, there was a lavish smorgasbord of Norwegian specialties.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/dining/27AUCTION_SPAN/27AUCTION-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/27/dining/27AUCTION_SPAN/27AUCTION-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/dining/27AUCTION_SPAN/27AUCTION-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/dining/27AUCTION_SPAN/27AUCTION-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/dining/27AUCTION_SPAN/27AUCTION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/27/dining/27AUCTION_SPAN/27AUCTION-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/dining/27AUCTION_SPAN/27AUCTION-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 100, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Powerhouse Fare for High-Powered Bidders', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Powerhouse Fare for High-Powered Bidders', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Catering', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Christie's", 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Auctions', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Food', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wines', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chefs', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Sotheby's", 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T20:45:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Glenn Collins', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Glenn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Collins', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bb70f8b6-43e5-5759-ab4a-08c3cf8db2f9', 'word_count': 1532, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bb70f8b6-43e5-5759-ab4a-08c3cf8db2f9'}, {'abstract': 'Readers weigh in on an Oregon study that found a group of newly insured people were happier, but also incurred more medical expenses than uninsured people.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/how-wider-coverage-affects-health-spending/', 'snippet': 'Readers weigh in on an Oregon study that found a group of newly insured people were happier, but also incurred more medical expenses than uninsured people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In an article over the weekend, I took a close look at a continuing health study relevant to the Supreme Court ruling due Thursday on the federal health care law, the Affordable Care Act. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Wider Coverage Affects Health Spending', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Research', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Oregon', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T20:47:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Annie Lowrey', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Annie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lowrey', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2c57576b-1fda-5452-9ac4-b4fa1c6d5002', 'word_count': 542, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2c57576b-1fda-5452-9ac4-b4fa1c6d5002'}, {'abstract': 'Anthony Swofford, the author of “Jarhead,” about his time in the Marines in the first gulf war, returns with a memoir of a midlife crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/books/hotels-hospitals-and-jails-by-anthony-swofford.html', 'snippet': 'Anthony Swofford, the author of “Jarhead,” about his time in the Marines in the first gulf war, returns with a memoir of a midlife crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Halfway through this intense but ungainly memoir Anthony Swofford describes being enraged at his father and taking his fury out in his driving, as he guns his BMW M3 down an upstate New York highway, ripping through its gears, “an angry man in a sick-fast car,” doing twice the 45 m.p.h. speed limit. “In front of me was about two miles of mostly straight road,” he writes, “and I killed it, I chewed it up, the speedo climbed to 90, and then 105, and then 120, and then 130, and then it hovered and ticked at 133; the world flew by, seasons changed, my heart hung at the edge of the world. I could die, I could kill myself with a flick of my wrist and it would look like a mistake, a daredevil young writer, war veteran, pushing all the limits at once and doing a header into a tree with his $65,000 car.” ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/arts/book/book-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 670, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/arts/book/book-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1340, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/26/arts/book/book-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/arts/book/book-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 222, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Tale of Post-Traumatic Success Disorder', 'kicker': 'Books of The Times', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Tale of Post-Traumatic Success Disorder', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Swofford, Anthony', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T20:47:52+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michiko Kakutani', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michiko', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kakutani', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/0a6d8aea-959a-5e75-816d-19cd20bc1199', 'word_count': 1357, 'uri': 'nyt://article/0a6d8aea-959a-5e75-816d-19cd20bc1199'}, {'abstract': 'Researchers found that each increase in 10 decibels of traffic noise exposure was associated with a 10 percent added risk of heart attack.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/traffic-noise-may-raise-heart-attack-risk/', 'snippet': 'Researchers found that each increase in 10 decibels of traffic noise exposure was associated with a 10 percent added risk of heart attack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A new study published in PLoS One suggests that traffic noise may be more than just a nuisance. It may increase the risk for heart attack.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_hazards/well_hazards-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 227, 'width': 227, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_hazards/well_hazards-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 227, 'width': 227, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_hazards/well_hazards-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/25/health/well_hazards/well_hazards-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th