-9b6f6c71d30f', 'word_count': 153, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7004178f-d7e6-59e8-99f2-9b6f6c71d30f'}, {'abstract': 'After a man in an Elmo costume was ejected from Central Park for an obscenity-laced rant, fellow impersonators of the Sesame Street star breathed sighs of relief.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/25/among-times-square-elmos-relief-to-be-rid-of-one-of-their-own/', 'snippet': 'After a man in an Elmo costume was ejected from Central Park for an obscenity-laced rant, fellow impersonators of the Sesame Street star breathed sighs of relief.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The pedestrian plazas of Times Square are prime territory for the Elmo impersonators of New York, who, dressed as\xa0the familiar, cuddly Sesame Street character, compete for tourists’ camera lenses and cash. But there was one Elmo who\xa0not only drove tourists off, but made his fellow Elmos back nervously away.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Nasty Elmo Is Gone, and the Other Ones Are Just Tickled', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Nasty Elmo Is Gone, and the Others Are Tickled', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ANTI-SEMITISM', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Costumes', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elmo (Fictional Character)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Street Performers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Central Park (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Times Square and 42nd Street (Manhattan, NY)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T23:04:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Vivian Yee and Kirk Semple', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Vivian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yee', 'q