 field hospitals and even salaries for soldiers who defect.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Turkish Border Is Crucial Link in Syrian Conflict', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Turkish Border Is Crucial Link In Syrian Fight', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Syrian National Council', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Turkey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Middle East and North Africa Unrest (2010- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Free Syrian Army', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Syria', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Assad, Bashar al-', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smuggling', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-25T23:26:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Neil MacFarquhar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Neil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'MacFarquhar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38a3546c-78fc-5980-b2e5-97f7383af32e', 'word_count': 1343, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38a3546c-78fc-5980-b2e5-97f7383af32e'}, {'abstract': 'A crossroads in southern Turkey has turned into a staging area for the Syrian opposition to smuggle supplies ranging from weapons to operating tables across the border.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2012/06/25/world/middleeast/20120626-TURKEY.html', 'snippet': 'A crossroads in southern Turkey has turned into a staging area for the Syrian opposition to smuggle supplies ranging from