live-up-to-potential.html', 'snippet': 'Donald Young, 22, has spent eight years playing professional tennis, but his career has been defined by unfulfilled potential. At the first round of Wimbledon, he lost his 12th consecutive match.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WIMBLEDON, England — After losing his 12th consecutive match, after crumbling from self-doubt and somehow making an opponent who screamed at the heavens and thumped his sternum with his racket appear as serene as a Japanese teahouse, Donald Young sat in an interview room with a towel draped over his head. His shoulders slumped, his eyes drawn to the floor. His voice was at a volume far lower than his appeals to the line judge or desperate pleas to himself. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/YYOUNG/YYOUNG-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/YYOUNG/YYOUNG-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/YYOUNG/YYOUNG-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/YYOUNG/YYOUNG-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/YYOUNG/YYOUNG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/YYOUNG/YYOUNG-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}