ies at home against the Cleveland Indians.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Dewayne Wise learned that he was starting his first game since May 22 when he arrived at Yankee Stadium on Monday, viewed the lineup card placed by his locker stall and saw his name in the No. 8 spot. Opportunities are rare for Wise, a 34-year-old journeyman who has played with six teams in parts of 10 seasons.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-wise/26yankees-wise-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-wise/26yankees-wise-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-wise/26yankees-wise-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 767, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-wise/26yankees-wise-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1533, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-wise/26yankees-wise-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-wise/26yankees-wise-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/26yankees-wise/26yankees-wise-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150