leg four years ago, Ryan Lochte finished strong on Monday night at the Olympic Trials to win the 400-meter individual medley.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/sports/olympics/ryan-lochte-beats-michael-phelps-in-400-meter-medley.html', 'snippet': 'After Michael Phelps out swam him in the freestyle leg four years ago, Ryan Lochte finished strong on Monday night at the Olympic Trials to win the 400-meter individual medley.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OMAHA — If Ryan Lochte was going to dethrone Superman, he had to become a Strongman. And so it was, heading into his showdown with Michael Phelps at this week’s United States Olympic trials, Lochte worked on his butterfly, backstroke, breaststroke and freestyle, but also on his pony keg heave, his 400-pound chain drag, his 650-pound tire flip and his heavy bar lift. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/subYJPSWIM/subYJPSWIM-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/subYJPSWIM/subYJPSWIM-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/subYJPSWIM/subYJPSWIM-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 665, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/subYJPSWIM/subYJPSWIM-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1330, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/subYJPSWIM/subYJPSWIM-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_