es. Last year, he began training in Gainesville, Fla., alongside Ryan Lochte, who went on to win five gold medals at the World Championships in Shanghai and is poised to compete for more medals at the London Games. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Motivated by the Two Stars He Helps Push', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vanderkaay, Peter', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-26T03:40:54+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/62782e43-7b8f-5a4c-a7f5-3e1c3de54e5b', 'word_count': 327, 'uri': 'nyt://article/62782e43-7b8f-5a4c-a7f5-3e1c3de54e5b'}, {'abstract': 'The Mets’ sluggish performance wasted a satisfactory start from Johan Santana and sent them to their third consecutive loss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/sports/baseball/mets-look-lifeless-against-the-cubs.html', 'snippet': 'The Mets’ sluggish performance wasted a satisfactory start from Johan Santana and sent them to their third consecutive loss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'CHICAGO — The Mets players wandered ghostlike around the antique grounds.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/26/sports/METS/METS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name':