question remains about how to handle those who were behind much of the violence.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/in-kashmir-killing-ebbs-but-killers-roam-free/', 'snippet': 'After decades of war, Kashmir is blooming again, but a question remains about how to handle those who were behind much of the violence.', 'lead_paragraph': '“After decades of war, Kashmir is blooming again,” Gardiner Harris wrote in The New York Times. “Hotels are bursting, roads are being fixed and offices rebuilt.” ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'In Kashmir, Killing Ebbs, but Killers Roam Free', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-26T06:22:30+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2eaa7781-7cbc-5122-a1b8-6bb84ad608cf', 'word_count': 140, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2eaa7781-7cbc-5122-a1b8-6bb84ad608cf'}, {'abstract': 'Can you choose the best antonym for “venerable” as it is used in the article?', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/test-yourself-june-26-2012/', 'snippet': 'Can you choose the best antonym for “venerable” as it is used in the article?', 'lead_paragraph': 'This question was written by Shannon Doyne. It comes from the article “A Georgia Town Takes the People’s Business Private.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Test Yourself | June 26, 2012', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-26T08:30:39+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Education', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Learning N