n body and trying to determine how each of us can optimize our time in the gym.', 'web_url': 'https://well.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/simple-advice-for-better-weight-training/', 'snippet': 'At McMaster University in Ontario, scientists are closely studying the effects of weight lifting on the human body and trying to determine how each of us can optimize our time in the gym.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For many of us, weight training is a mysterious and intimidating activity. People often ask me if they really need to lift weights. And if so, do they need to lift heavy weights? What is a heavy weight? People also ask if weight lifting will make them bulky — and often wonder whether, if they already regularly run, walk, swim or cycle, they need to lift weights at all?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Simple Advice for Better Weight Training', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Exercise', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Weight Lifting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-26T16:11:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Science', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Gretchen Reynolds', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Gretchen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Reynolds', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7539fb4b-bdf2-5d3c-bf11-bc96e244c317', 'word_count': 164, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7539fb4b-bdf2-5d3c-bf11-bc96e244c317'}, {'abstract': 'One of Jackson Pollock’s most important pre-drip paintings, “Mural,” from 1943 – the subject of political skirmishes in the last few years over whether its owner, the University of Iowa, should sell it to raise money for the school – will travel to Los Angeles to undergo extensive study and conservation by scientists at the Getty Conservation Institute and conservators at the J. Paul Getty Museum.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/major-work-by-pollock-slated-for-getty-center-conservation/', 'snippet': 'One of Jackson Pollock’s most important pre-drip paintings, “Mural,” from 1943 – the subject of political skirmishes in the last few years over whether its owner, the University of Iowa, should sell it to raise money for the school – will travel t...', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of Jackson Pollock’s most important pre-drip paintings, “Mural,” from 1943 – the subject of political skirmishes in the last few years over whether its owner, the University of Iowa, should sell it to raise money for the school – will travel to Los Angeles to undergo extensive study and conservation by scientists at the Getty Conservation Institute and conservators at the J. Paul Getty Museum.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Major Work by Pollock Slated for Getty Center Conservation', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Pollock’s ‘Mural’ Set For Work at Getty', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Museums', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Guggenheim, Peggy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Pollock, Jackson', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty Center', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Getty, J Paul, Museum', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Iowa', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Iowa Museum of Art', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iowa', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Los Angeles (Calif)', 'rank':