f0fa3da328b', 'word_count': 1135, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a0e79a71-1552-5757-bd47-5f0fa3da328b'}, {'abstract': 'The 36-year-old rapper was treated for minor injuries and then released from the hospital, according to his publicist.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/26/50-cent-injured-in-car-accident/', 'snippet': 'The 36-year-old rapper was treated for minor injuries and then released from the hospital, according to his publicist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The rapper 50 Cent was hospitalized briefly Tuesday morning after a truck hit his car from behind on the Long Island Expressway, according to his Web site, ThisIs50.\xa0His publicist said that the 36-year-old rapper, whose real name is Curtis Jackson, had been treated for minor injuries to his neck and back at New York Hospital Queens and then released.\xa0According to Mr. Jackson’s Web site, the accident occurred when the driver of a Mack truck lost control after the load he was carrying shifted, causing the truck to hit the rear of the SUV with Mr. Jackson and his driver.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '50 Cent Injured in Car Accident', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Rap and Hip-Hop', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Traffic Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': '50 CENT', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Long Island Expressway', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-26T16:33:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By James C. McKinley Jr', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'C.', 'lastname': 'McKinley', 'qualifier': 'Jr', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3955