an Reciters Vie for Top Honors', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Before a Full House In Iran, Koran Reciters Vie for Top Honors', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Muslims and Islam', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Koran', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Iran', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Uganda', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Voice and Speech', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T00:33:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Middle East', 'byline': {'original': 'By Thomas Erdbrink', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Thomas', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Erdbrink', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/914ef0a6-b737-591d-ad0e-820ca44b10b6', 'word_count': 1093, 'uri': 'nyt://article/914ef0a6-b737-591d-ad0e-820ca44b10b6'}, {'abstract': 'Two responses to David Blankenhorn’s online Op-Ed article.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/opinion/rethinking-gay-marriage.html', 'snippet': 'Two responses to David Blankenhorn’s online Op-Ed article.', 'lead_paragraph': 'To the Editor:', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rethinking Gay Marriage', 'kicker': 'Letters', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rethinking Gay Marriage', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Homosexuality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Same-Sex Marriage, Civil Unions and Domestic Partnerships', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Marriages', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T00: