k markets,” and Nasdaq said it had similar plans.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/business/stock-exchanges-duel-with-newcomers-over-trade-transparency.html', 'snippet': 'NYSE Euronext asked regulators to allow it to create a market that is similar to the unregulated “dark markets,” and Nasdaq said it had similar plans.', 'lead_paragraph': 'While most people trading stocks at home imagine their orders zipping from their brokers onto one of the nation’s stock exchanges, almost none of the trades go anywhere near those public markets. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/business/Exchanges/Exchanges-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 661, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/business/Exchanges/Exchanges-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1322, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/business/Exchanges/Exchanges-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Public Exchanges Duel With Newcomers Over Trade Transparency', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Public Exchanges Duel With Newcomers Over Trade Transparency', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Stock Exchange', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Stocks and Bonds', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'NYSE Euronext', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Regulation and Deregulation of Industry', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub