 a State Supreme Court judge.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/nyregion/michael-j-dontzin-89-counsel-to-new-york-mayor-in-70s-dies.html', 'snippet': 'On behalf of Mayor John V. Lindsay, Mr. Dontzin negotiated the release of guards held hostage during a jail riot in 1970; he later became a State Supreme Court judge.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Michael J. Dontzin, who as counsel to Mayor John V. Lindsay in the early 1970s helped deal with uprisings in New York City’s jails and who later served as a State Supreme Court justice, died on Friday at his home in Manhattan. He was 89.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '25', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/nyregion/DONTZIN-obit/DONTZIN-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 709, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/nyregion/DONTZIN-obit/DONTZIN-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1286, 'width': 890, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/nyregion/DONTZIN-obit/DONTZIN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/27/nyregion/DONTZIN-obit/DONTZIN-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/nyregion/DONTZIN-obit/DONTZIN-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Michael J. Dontzin, Counsel to New York Mayor in ’70s, Dies at 89', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Michael J