cial leaders, who took positions assessing global financial risk for the International Monetary Fund, failed to sound alarms as Spain edged closer to a real estate and banking crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/business/global/spanish-officials-hailed-banks-as-the-crisis-built.html', 'snippet': 'Spanish financial leaders, who took positions assessing global financial risk for the International Monetary Fund, failed to sound alarms as Spain edged closer to a real estate and banking crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As Spain edged closer to a real estate and banking crisis that led to its recent bank bailout, Spanish financial leaders in influential positions mostly played down concerns that something might go terribly wrong.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/business/Spainbanks1/Spainbanks1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/27/business/Spainbanks1/Spainbanks1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/business/Spainbanks1/Spainbanks1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 696, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/27/business/Spainbanks1/Spainbanks1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1392, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Spanish Officials Hailed Banks as Crisis Built', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Spain Officials Hailed Banks As Crisis Built', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Caruana, Jaime', 'ran