ach Australia capsized in the Indian Ocean. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '130 Rescued After Shipwreck South of Indonesia', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '130 Are Rescued After a Shipwreck South of Indonesia', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Indonesia', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Refugees and Displaced Persons', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Asylum, Right of', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Maritime Accidents and Safety', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T04:02:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Matt Siegel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Matt', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Siegel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/833eed62-dd69-55a2-a406-b26300305809', 'word_count': 334, 'uri': 'nyt://article/833eed62-dd69-55a2-a406-b26300305809'}, {'abstract': 'This word has appeared in 227 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'web_url': 'https://learning.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/word-of-the-day-sap/', 'snippet': 'This word has appeared in 227 New York Times articles in the past year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'sap •\\ˈsap\\• noun and verb ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Word of the Day | sap', 'kicker': 'The Learning Network', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T04:03:28+0000', 'document_type':