, {'abstract': 'Syria said that rebels stormed a television station in a suburb of Damascus, but opposition fighters said the attackers were in fact defectors from the loyalist Republican Guard.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/world/middleeast/syrian-pro-government-television-station-attacked.html', 'snippet': 'Syria said that rebels stormed a television station in a suburb of Damascus, but opposition fighters said the attackers were in fact defectors from the loyalist Republican Guard.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BEIRUT, Lebanon — Gunmen stormed a pro-government television station in a suburb near Damascus early Wednesday, killed seven employees and destroyed its studios with explosives, Syrian officials said, calling the assault a brazen example of atrocities committed by the armed opposition to President Bashar al-Assad. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/world/middleeast/syria/syria-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 350, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/28/world/middleeast/syria/syria-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 350}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/world/middleeast/syria/syria-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 694, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/world/middleeast/syria/syria-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1388, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Attack Destroys Pro-Government TV Station Near Damascus', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Attack Destroys Pro-Government TV Station Near Damascus', 'nam