ingh says.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/a-conversation-with-basketball-player-and-coach-divya-singh/', 'snippet': 'India’s female athletes are harassed and discriminated against, Ms. Singh says.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Divya Singh, 30, was a forward for India’s national women’s basketball team from 2002 to 2008 and the captain of India’s senior women’s team at the Commonwealth Games in Melbourne in 2006. Ms. Singh is currently the coach for India’s under-16 boys’ team and the assistant coach for the senior women’s basketball team.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'A Conversation With: Basketball Player and Coach Divya Singh', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Discrimination', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Women and Girls', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mirza, Sania', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T15:02:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By Malavika Vyawahare', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Malavika', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Vyawahare', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/396d6c2f-14e2-5296-89c2-b6ee4968c7c3', 'word_count': 992, 'uri': 'nyt://article/396d6c2f-14e2-5296-89c2-b6ee4968c7c3'}, {'abstract': 'Officials have come up with new, faster boats; courses closer to shore; and television wrinkles that make the sailing easier to watch and understand.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/sports/americas-cup-seeking-bigger-audience-changes-its-rules.html', 'snippet': 'Officials have come up with new, faster boats; courses closer to shore; and television wrinkles that make the sailing easier to watch and understand.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two years ago the officials who run the America’s Cup made an important decision: they were going to change professional sailing into a sport that was actually fun to watch. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/sports/28sailing/28sailing-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/28/sports/28sailing/28sailing-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/sports/28sailing/28sailing-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 680, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/sports/28sailing/28sailing-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1361, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/sports/28sailing/28sailing-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/28/sports/28sailing/28sailing-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/sports/28sailing/28sailing-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'America’s Cup