a scene from the film.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/anatomy-of-a-scene-beasts-of-the-southern-wild/', 'snippet': 'Benh Zeitlin narrates a scene from the film.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This year’s Sundance grand jury prize-winner “Beasts of the Southern Wild” makes it to the big screen today. Both of our co-chief film critics have weighed in, with A. O. Scott calling it “a blast of sheer, improbable joy” and Manohla Dargis calling it “among the best films to play at the festival in two decades.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Anatomy of a Scene: ‘Beasts of the Southern Wild’', 'kicker': 'ArtsBeat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Wallis, Quvenzhane', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Zeitlin, Benh', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T20:48:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mekado Murphy', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mekado', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Murphy', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9b5e770-2e71-52bf-8dd8-c285b3299c0d', 'word_count': 98, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9b5e770-2e71-52bf-8dd8-c285b3299c0d'}, {'abstract': 'Peter Madoff, the younger brother of the convicted fraudster Bernard L. Madoff, is expected to admit to, among other things, falsifying records, making false statements to securities regulators and obstructing the work of the Internal Revenue Service.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/peter-madoff-expected-to-plead-guilty/', 'snippet': 'Peter Madoff, the younger brother of the convicted fraudster Bernard L. Madoff, is expected to admit to, among other things, falsifying records, making false statements to securities regulators 