C’s Olympics coverage. “It’s got to be empowering. It’s got to be positive.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'With the news that the Obama campaign has purchased $5.5 million in commercial time during the coverage of the London Olympics, an NBC executive had advice for both presidential candidates: Don’t go negative during the three weeks’ worth of thrills of victory and agonies of defeat.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'As Obama Buys Up Time, NBC Executive Says Positive Ads Do Better at Olympics', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'National Broadcasting Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'London (England)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T21:07:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Carter', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Carter', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b361dcd9-2b1f-5ea0-bcca-4ae5188feba8', 'word_count': 552, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b361dcd9-2b1f-5ea0-bcca-4ae5188feba8'}, {'abstract': 'High winds fueled the Waldo Canyon Fire now engulfing the hills overlooking Colorado Springs.', 'web_url': 'https://thelede.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/colorado-wildfires-force-thousands-to-evacuate/', 'snippet': 'High winds fueled the Waldo Canyon Fire now engulfing the hills overlooking Colorado Springs.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A raging wildfire in the hills overlooking Colorado Springs doubled in size overnight, as my colleague Dan Frosch reports, destroying dozens of homes and forcing the evacuation of tens of thousands of people, including the Air Force Academy. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Colorado Wildfires Force Thousands to Evacuate', 'kicker': 'The Lede', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fires and Firefighters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forest and Brush Fires', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Air Force Academy', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Colorado Springs (Colo)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T21:13:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Blogs', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jennifer Preston', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jennifer', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Preston', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/68675e27-2b6e-56da-bcf4-d85499bef3e6', 'word_count': 419, 'uri': 'nyt://article/68675e27-2b6e-56da-bcf4-d85499bef3e6'}, {'abstract': 'How post-traumatic stress disorder is defined and treated is an issue likely to affect generations of taxpayers to come, a combat veteran argues.', 'web_url': 'https://atwar.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/27/the-financial-costs-of-war-beyond-the-battlefield/', 'snippet': 'How post-traumatic stress disorder is defined and treated is an issue likely to affect generations of taxpayers to come, a combat veteran argues.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Of all the issues surrounding the military today — repealing Don’t Ask Don’t Tell, whether to plan for intervention in Iran and or Syria, what form our role in the Pacific should take, the disturbing questions over torture and the use of drones against humans — none has more immediate and long-lasting potential for good or bad than educating our society about post-traumatic stress disorder. As evidenced by the still-growing number of suicides within and outside the military as well as violent crime by veterans, how we define and treat P.T.S.D. is an issue likely to affect generations of taxpayers to come.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Financial Costs of War, Beyond the Battlefield', 'kicker': 'At War', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Taxes (US)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Veterans', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rand Corp', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Army', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T21:17:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adrian Bonenberger', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adrian', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bonenberger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/38f30ebd-c61f-590b-af8e-863f38ff4874', 'word_count': 1377, 'uri': 'nyt://article/38f30ebd-c61f-590b-af8e-863f38ff4874'}, {'abstract': 'Brian d’Arcy James is performing “Under the Influence” at 54 Below through Saturday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/arts/music/brian-darcy-james-at-54-below.html', 'snippet': 'Brian d’Arcy James is performing “Under the Influence” at 54 Below through Saturday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ins