orted', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/9a73a598-da99-5376-8328-448204c76beb', 'word_count': 319, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9a73a598-da99-5376-8328-448204c76beb'}, {'abstract': 'It’s important to make cramped or cluttered bedrooms feel as generous as possible before opening your home to potential buyers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/garden/making-cramped-or-cluttered-bedrooms-appear-larger-market-ready.html', 'snippet': 'It’s important to make cramped or cluttered bedrooms feel as generous as possible before opening your home to potential buyers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q. Our two children share a bedroom, and it looks cramped. What can we do to make the room appear larger?', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28MARKET_SPAN/28MARKET_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28MARKET_SPAN/28MARKET_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28MARKET_SPAN/28MARKET-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 732, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28MARKET_SPAN/28MARKET-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1463, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28MARKET_SPAN/28MARKET_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbn