ion is too rich for federal funding, but too poor to make up the difference?', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you believe the research, statistics and experts, it appears that my son’s elementary school, Public School 9 in Brooklyn’s Prospect Heights neighborhood, has been doing everything right. Middle-class, college-educated people are increasingly sending their children there because of its academic excellence, its emphasis on individualized instruction, its commitment to arts education and its progressive, inquiry-based approach. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'At One Brooklyn School, a Lesson in the Danger of Success', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At One Brooklyn School, a Lesson in the Danger of Success', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (NYC)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Education (K-12)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Aid (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T23:41:34+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Louise Sloan', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Louise', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sloan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f792217-d7fe-5cb8-acff-d400f5656e6e', 'word_count': 876, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f792217-d7fe-5cb8-acff-d400f5656e6e'}, {'abstract': 'Discounts on summer bedding, floor models and more.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/garden/sales-at-garnet-hill-jayson-home-and-others.html', 'snippet': 'Discounts on summer bedding, floor models and more.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Summer sheets from Eileen Fisher and Lilly Pulitzer are 20 percent off at Garnet Hill through July 10, or while supplies last (Eileen Fisher Lustrous cotton sateen bedding, left, originally $50 to $250, is now $40 to $200; Lilly Pulitzer Bella coverlet and sham, originally $48 to $228, is now $38 to $182); (800) 622-6216, garnethill.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28DEALS/28DEALS-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1056, 'width': 807, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28DEALS/28DEALS-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1056, 'width': 807, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28DEALS/28DEALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28DEALS/28DEALS-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/garden/28DEALS/28DEALS-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 225, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Sales at Garnet Hill, Jayson Home and Others', 'kicker': 'Currents | Deals', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Sales on Bedding, Cookware and More', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sales', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cookware', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Beds and Bedding', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-27T23:42:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Home', 'section_name': 'Home & Garden', 'byline': {'original': 'By Rima Suqi', 'person': [{'fi