 off the start in the 100 backstroke final Wednesday night at the United States Olympic swimming trials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OMAHA — Eighteen minutes. That’s how much time 17-year-old Missy Franklin had between finishing her 200-meter freestyle semifinal and firing off the start in the 100 backstroke final Wednesday night at the United States Olympic swimming trials.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'For Franklin, No Rest Till After London', 'kicker': '2012 London Olympics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Coughlin, Natalie', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Franklin, Missy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T03:16:06+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Pat Borzi', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Pat', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Borzi', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f8630af3-f915-51fb-ad58-6dbeaf6862f0', 'word_count': 667, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f8630af3-f915-51fb-ad58-6dbeaf6862f0'}, {'abstract': 'Wayne Odesnik was suspended by the International Tennis Federation after pleading guilty to importing human growth hormone. Now back at Wimbledon, his fellow players haven’t exactly embraced him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/sports/tennis/wayne-odesnik-tennis-pariah-returns-to-wimbledon-and-loses.html', 'snippet': 'Wayne Odesnik was suspended by the International Tennis Federation after pleading guilty to importing human growth hormone. Now back at Wimbledon, his fellow players haven’t exactly embraced him.',