conflicts of interest among board members at its regional banks, particularly the New York Fed, an economist writes.', 'web_url': 'https://economix.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/three-more-governance-questions-for-the-fed/', 'snippet': 'The Federal Reserve needs to make clear how it is applying rules meant to avoid any question of conflicts of interest among board members at its regional banks, particularly the New York Fed, an economist writes.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Simon Johnson is the Ronald A. Kurtz Professor of Entrepreneurship at the M.I.T. Sloan School of Management and co-author of “White House Burning: The Founding Fathers, Our National Debt, and Why It Matters to You.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Three More Governance Questions for the Fed', 'kicker': 'Economix', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Banking and Financial Institutions', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Bollinger, Lee C', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dimon, James', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'FRIEDMAN, STEPHEN', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve Bank of New York', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Reserve System', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'JPMorgan Chase & Company', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T09:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Economy', 'byline': {'original': 'By Simon Johnson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Simon', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Johnson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b778860c-0cae-5e89-bf66-4bfbfa23df13', 'word_count': 248