: 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/magazine/get-him-to-the-fenugreek.html', 'snippet': 'Want explosive Indian flavor? Better stock up the spice rack.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No matter how accomplished you are in the kitchen, you always learn something when you cook with someone else — at least I always have. But it’s worth remembering that what you learn may be something other than what you thought you would.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '42', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/magazine/01eat1/01eat1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 446, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/07/01/magazine/01eat1/01eat1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 446}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/magazine/01eat1/01eat1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/magazine/01eat1/01eat1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1000, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/magazine/01eat1/01eat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/07/01/magazine/01eat1/01eat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/magazine/01eat1/01eat1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Get Him to the Fenugreek', 'kicker': 'Eat', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Get Him to the Fenugreek', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'India', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Spices', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Meat', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T11:00:03+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Bittman', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Bittman', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/85903e03-38ac-5c41-b155-ceadb73cad83', 'word_count': 636, 'uri': 'nyt://article/85903e03-38ac-5c41-b155-ceadb73cad83'}, {'abstract': 'Back in the offices of my ad agency, over the years, we have had conversations about the vodka that didn’t need advertising.', 'web_url': 'https://boss.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/building-a-brand-when-you-cant-afford-an-ad-agency/', 'snippet': 'Back in the offices of my ad agency, over the years, we have had conversations about the vodka that didn’t need advertising.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I met Tito Beveridge, the man behind Tito’s Handmade Vodka, about 15 years ago when he first started making vodka in Austin, Tex. Thinking it would be great to do advertising work for an adult beverage company, I called him. He told me he couldn’t afford advertising, but he invited me out to his still — and I couldn’t resist visiting a maker of spirits during business hours.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Building a Brand When You Can’t Afford an Ad Agency', 'kicker': 'You&#039;re the Boss', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name':