 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/91aa14e2-e2b9-51f9-bf9d-a9309dbecba6', 'word_count': 54, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91aa14e2-e2b9-51f9-bf9d-a9309dbecba6'}, {'abstract': 'The Hub, a children’s cable channel, is hoping to get some buzz at the event by having Mr. King conduct an interview with the actor who voices a character on one of its cartoons.', 'web_url': 'https://mediadecoder.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/larry-king-takes-his-star-power-to-comic-con/', 'snippet': 'The Hub, a children’s cable channel, is hoping to get some buzz at the event by having Mr. King conduct an interview with the actor who voices a character on one of its cartoons.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Hub TV Network may not have huge ratings, but it certainly has a sense of humor: Larry King will be one of the children’s cable channel’s star attractions this year at the pop culture convention known as Comic-Con.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Larry King Takes His Star Power to Comic-Con', 'kicker': 'Media Decoder', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comic-Con (Convention)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'King, Larry', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Discovery Holding Company', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hasbro Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hub, The (TV Network)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T13:33:02+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'subsection_name': 'Media', 'byline': {'original': 'By Brooks Barnes', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Brooks', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnes', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/280dd858-c4d4-59d9-80bd-b7b90cbe7d5a', 'word_count': 314, 'uri': 'nyt://article/280dd858-c4d4-59d9-80bd-b7b90cbe7d5a'}, {'abstract': 'In a video dug up by a Democratic group, Mitt Romney, six years ago, as governor of Massachusetts, praised the idea of an individual mandate.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/video/multimedia/100000001633697/mitt-romney-in-2006.html', 'snippet': 'In a video dug up by a Democratic group, Mitt Romney, six years ago, as governor of Massachusetts, praised the idea of an individual mandate.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In a video dug up by a Democratic group, Mitt Romney, six years ago, as governor of Massachusetts, praised the idea of an individual mandate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/multimedia/video-romney-2006/video-romney-2006-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/28/multimedia/video-romney-2006/video-romney-2006-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/28/multimedia/video-romney-2006/video-romney-2006-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/28/multimedia/video-romney-2006/video-romney-2006-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mitt Romney in 2006', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T13:33:23+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Multimedia/Photos', 'byline': {'original': 'YouTube', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Youtube', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/db77fca6-233f-5776-ad82-14d32fb65bab', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/db77fca6-233f-5776-ad82-14d32fb65bab'}, {'abstract': 'Sara Errani defeated Anne Keothavong in straight sets at Wimbledon on Thursday.', 'web_url': 'https://straightsets.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/errani-keeps-winning/', 'snippet': 'Sara Errani defeated Anne Keothavong in straight sets at Wimbledon on Thursday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WIMBLEDON, England — As she prepared to serve, Sara Errani of Italy looked skyward on Thursday morning and squinted at an unexpected sight, sunshine, at the All England Lawn Tennis Club.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Errani Keeps Winning', 'kicker': 'Straight Sets', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tennis', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Wimbledon Tennis Tournament', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Errani, Sara', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T13:34:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Tennis', 'byline': {'original': 'By John Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/44f781cc-14cd-5a30-b569-99f70c06c481', 'word_count': 290, 'uri': 'nyt://article/44f781cc-14cd-5a30-b569-99f70c06c481'}, {'abstract': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/what-were-reading-467/', 'snippet': 'A collection of links from the reporters and editors of the Dining section.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New York Times: It’s all about quality, not quantity: Mark Bittman explains a new Harvard University study suggesting that the kind of calories consumed is more significant than the sheer number, in losing weight — because the body handles highly processed carbohydrates less efficiently. So low-calorie diets (whole grains, fruits and veggies) are less effective than a low-glycemic-index diet (blood-sugar-regulation plans like the Zone diet and Nutrisystem). – Glenn Collins ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'What We’re Reading', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T13:51:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/530384bc-dff1-5e3c-91df-cf3601c30077', 'word_count': 466, 'uri': 'nyt://article/530384bc-dff1-5e3c-91df-cf3601c30077'}, {'abstract': 'Robert E. Diamond Jr., the chief executive of Barclays, faced a political backlash a day after the big British bank agreed to pay more than $450 million to settle accusations it had attempted to manipulate key interest rates.', 'web_url': 'https://dealbook.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/barclays-chief-faces-political-firestorm/', 'snippet': 'Robert E. Diamond Jr., the chief executive of Barclays, faced a political backlash a day after the big British bank agreed to pay more than $450 million to settle accusations it had attempted to manipulate key interest rates.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Barclays chief executive, Robert E. Diamond Jr., faced a political backlash on Thursday, a day after the British bank agreed to pay more than $450 million to settle accusations that it had attempted to manipulate key interest rates.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multi