g.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/let-them-climb-trees-and-fall/', 'snippet': 'Why do I give my children permission to climb the neighbor’s towering trees?', 'lead_paragraph': 'Recently, my son surprised me when he came shuffling into our house mumbling about life being unfair. When I asked him what was going on, he responded: “It’s not fair! I climb those trees all the time. Now she’s mad at me and I can’t climb anymore!”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Let Them Climb Trees (and Fall)', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T18:24:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kay Wyma', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wyma', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/d2829533-49b5-5b37-b18e-9e76f829f28a', 'word_count': 770, 'uri': 'nyt://article/d2829533-49b5-5b37-b18e-9e76f829f28a'}, {'abstract': 'At a clinic that treats the poor, patients welcome news of the Supreme Court ruling.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/ruling-brings-relief-at-a-virginia-clinic/', 'snippet': 'At a clinic that treats the poor, patients welcome news of the Supreme Court ruling.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LEESBURG, Va. — There were no shouts, no whoops of joy. But the fortunes of the patients at the Loudoun Community Health Center quietly changed on Thursday morning when the Supreme Court ruled to uphold the Affordable Care Act.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headlin