d6ba-c74a-55e2-9536-e37825436214'}, {'abstract': 'The Supreme Court said the expansion of Medicaid in the health care law was an option, not a mandate, and experts disagreed on whether states would take it.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/us/uncertainty-over-whether-states-will-choose-to-expand-medicaid.html', 'snippet': 'The Supreme Court said the expansion of Medicaid in the health care law was an option, not a mandate, and experts disagreed on whether states would take it.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — The Supreme Court said on Thursday that a huge expansion of Medicaid envisioned in the 2010 health care law was an option, not a mandate, for states. Experts disagreed on whether states would take the option, one of the most important questions created by the court’s decision. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/us/sub2-medicaid-1/sub2-medicaid-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/us/sub2-medicaid-1/sub2-medicaid-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/us/sub2-medicaid-1/sub2-medicaid-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/29/us/sub2-medicaid-1/sub2-medicaid-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/us/sub2-medicaid-1/sub2-medicaid-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subTy