 the price is right for many people who just want basic computer protection.', 'web_url': 'https://gadgetwise.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/qa-keeping-the-pc-safe-on-the-cheap/', 'snippet': 'Microsoft Security Essentials may not include as many features as a commercial security program, but the price is right for many people who just want basic computer protection.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Q.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Q&A: Keeping the PC Safe on the Cheap', 'kicker': 'Gadgetwise', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computer Security', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Computers and the Internet', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Software', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Microsoft Corporation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T19:55:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Technology', 'subsection_name': 'Personal Tech', 'byline': {'original': 'By J.d. Biersdorfer', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/29613f24-c070-5af4-a279-5955ca132cf3', 'word_count': 192, 'uri': 'nyt://article/29613f24-c070-5af4-a279-5955ca132cf3'}, {'abstract': 'Democrats who voted for the health overhaul could face a surge in attack ads about health care financed by third-party groups.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/health-care-a-likely-issue-in-battle-for-senate/', 'snippet': 'Democrats who voted for the health overhaul could face a surge in attack ads about health care financed by third-party groups.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Much of the political chatter of the day has been about the impact of the Supreme Court’s ruling on the presidential campaign. But the court’s decision to let stand President Obama’s health care plan may hold even more import in the battle for control of the Senate.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Health Care Fight Moves to Senate Races', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T19:56:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael D. Shear', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e2d1a1c9-6f8f-5873-baf4-21469f900386', 'word_count': 289, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e2d1a1c9-6f8f-5873-baf4-21469f900386'}, {'abstract': 'A broad survey of the work of the Italian artist Alighiero Boetti is unfolding at the Museum of Modern Art, with the last segment to open on Sunday.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/arts/design/alighiero-boetti-retrospective-at-museum-of-modern-art.html', 'snippet': 'A broad survey of the work of the Italian artist Alighiero Boetti is unfolding at the Museum of Modern Art, with the last segment to open on Sunday.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a bittersweet addition to the Museum of Modern Art’s sculpture garden this summer. Half hidden in the shade of a tree, it’s a life-size bronze statue of a gaunt-looking guy holding a fountainlike hose in one hand. When water spraying from it hits his head, steam rises, as if his brain were sizzling.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29BOETTI_SPAN/29BOETTI_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29BOETTI_SPAN/29BOETTI_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29BOETTI_SPAN/BOETTI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29BOETTI_SPAN/BOETTI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29BOETTI_SPAN/29BOETTI_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29BOETTI_SPAN/29BOETTI_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29BOETTI_SPAN/29BOETTI_SPAN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Whole World, Stitched and Patched', 'kicker': 'Art Review', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Whole World, Stitched and Patched', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Museum of Modern Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Boetti, Alighiero e', 'rank