//article/34d1073a-2f9e-57a0-b274-a3dd21676273'}, {'abstract': 'Jack Jones performs at Feinstein’s at Loews Regency, singing old classics with renewed vigor.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/arts/music/jack-jones-performs-at-feinsteins-at-loews-regency.html', 'snippet': 'Jack Jones performs at Feinstein’s at Loews Regency, singing old classics with renewed vigor.', 'lead_paragraph': '“Show rooms keep closing behind me, but I just keep moving,” the singer Jack Jones remarked near the end of his show at Feinstein’s at Loews Regency on Wednesday evening, naming two fabled but vanished Las Vegas lounges. In New York City, Mr. Jones, until this year, had made an annual appearance at the now closed Oak Room at the Algonquin Hotel. He has since moved 17 blocks uptown, and from the West Side to the East, for a too-short run at Feinstein’s. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29JACK_SPAN/JACK-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29JACK_SPAN/JACK-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29JACK_SPAN/JACK-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 642, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29JACK_SPAN/JACK-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 941, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29JACK_SPAN/JACK-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name':