Chinese software that was originally developed for the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/business/global/arms-contractor-pleads-guilty-on-china-exports.html', 'snippet': 'Pratt & Whitney Canada, a subsidiary of the military contractor United Technologies, admitted it illegally gave the Chinese software that was originally developed for the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A Canadian subsidiary of the Connecticut-based military contractor the United Technologies Corporation pleaded guilty on Thursday to federal charges that it had illegally helped the Chinese government develop an attack helicopter now in service there. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/business/Copter/Copter-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 655, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/business/Copter/Copter-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1310, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Military Contractors Are Fined Over Aid to China', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Military Contractors Are Fined Over Aid to China', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Helicopters', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Technologies Corporation', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Pratt & Whitney', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Canada', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Arms Trade', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'China', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hamilton Sundstrand Corp', 'ran