], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a6682f80-0623-5bc5-9115-c3c2b89d991b', 'word_count': 591, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a6682f80-0623-5bc5-9115-c3c2b89d991b'}, {'abstract': 'Even as she spreads herself across numerous formats, Casady is a prolific artist, consistent in her voice.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/28/the-lowdown-bianca-casady/', 'snippet': 'Even as she spreads herself across numerous formats, Casady is a prolific artist, consistent in her voice.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This is a big summer for Bianca Casady, half of the musical duo CocoRosie, who just released a new single and video for their song “We Are On Fire.” In late April, she wrapped up her first experimental dance piece, “Nightshift,” which she performed at the Donaufestival in Krems, Austria. And this evening she will unveil her first solo show of artwork (drawings, collages, photographs and audio and video pieces) in New York City since her debut at Deitch Projects in 2007. Even as she spreads herself across numerous formats, Casady is a prolific artist, consistent in her voice.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The Lowdown | Bianca Casady', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T21:03:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By IO Tillett Wright', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Io', 'middlename': 'Tillett', 'lastname': 'Wright', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/956432e5-5c19-57b4-94c4-ceeaf1fe6aa5', 'word_count': 336, 'uri': 'nyt://article/956432e5-5c19-57b4-94c4-ceeaf1fe6aa5'}, {'abstract': 'BMW recently confirmed that it ended talks with General Motors about collaborating on fuel-cell technologi