pervised the rebirth of the company under the BMW Group beginning in 1999.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Rolls-Royce Appoints Giles Taylor to Lead Design Department', 'kicker': 'Wheels', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Design', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Bayerische Motorenwerke AG', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Rolls-Royce Motor Cars', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-28T21:39:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Automobiles', 'byline': {'original': 'By Phil Patton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Phil', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Patton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4f9a7658-49de-541f-a5cb-99b767d07706', 'word_count': 359, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4f9a7658-49de-541f-a5cb-99b767d07706'}, {'abstract': 'Channing Tatum stars in “Magic Mike,” Steven Soderbergh’s funny, enjoyable romp about male strippers and the American dream.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/movies/magic-mike-by-steven-soderbergh-with-channing-tatum.html', 'snippet': 'Channing Tatum stars in “Magic Mike,” Steven Soderbergh’s funny, enjoyable romp about male strippers and the American dream.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hip-pumping studs who work at the Xquisite dance club know a thing or two about making the ladies scream in delight. But nobody works the crowd like Magic Mike (a terrific Channing Tatum), the gyrating main attraction in Steven Soderbergh’s funny, enjoyable romp about male strippers and the American dream. Then again, few directors can sell the goods — whether it’s Che in Cuba or Mike in a thong — as shrewdly as Mr. Soderbergh. A restive talent who toggles between big-studio and low-budget work, he has a genius for wrapping tricky ideas, like capitalism and its discontents, into commercial packages. Never before has he put them into cheek-baring chaps. ', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN-superJumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 998, 'width': 1500, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN-thumbStandard-v4.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN/29MAGICMIKE_SPAN-thumbLarge-v4.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Body Politic', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_