43bcadca'}, {'abstract': 'A salesman living in New York goes back to Los Angeles for his father’s funeral and learns he has more family than he knew about.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/movies/people-like-us-with-chris-pine.html', 'snippet': 'A salesman living in New York goes back to Los Angeles for his father’s funeral and learns he has more family than he knew about.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The jittery opening scenes of “People Like Us” capture the high anxiety that is epidemic in the modern workplace with the clattering velocity of an action film. Sam Harper (Chris Pine), a motormouthed New York salesman of remaindered merchandise, is called on the carpet for a costly mistake in the transportation of a shipment of canned soup. Amid the brouhaha, a bigger screw-up comes to light, and for the rest of the movie he is hounded by telephone threats from the Federal Trade Commission.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29PEOPLE1_SPAN/29PEOPLE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29PEOPLE1_SPAN/29PEOPLE1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29PEOPLE1_SPAN/PEOPLE1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29PEOPLE1_SPAN/PEOPLE1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1368, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/29PEOPLE1_SP