aterial': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/6320e9cf-d367-5e13-9069-5913fd4744f5', 'word_count': 639, 'uri': 'nyt://article/6320e9cf-d367-5e13-9069-5913fd4744f5'}, {'abstract': 'At Singh’s Roti Shop and Bar, the food and the atmosphere are West Indian.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/nyregion/at-singhs-roti-shop-and-bar-live-music-hot-food-and-hot-sauce.html', 'snippet': 'At Singh’s Roti Shop and Bar, the food and the atmosphere are West Indian.', 'lead_paragraph': 'IT’S a warm June night on Liberty Avenue in Richmond Hill, Queens, a flat half-mile past the last stop on the A train. Inside what looks like a low, neon-lighted diner, a West Indian band has just taken its set break, and a tassa drum ensemble assembles in an alcove, four men loosely circled, between mirrored walls and beneath pinpoints of green and red light. ', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01JOINT2/01JOINT2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01JOINT2/01JOINT2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1865, 'width': 1865, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01JOINT2/01JOINT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01JOINT2/01JOINT2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01JOINT2/01JOINT2-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Live Music, Hot Food, Hot Sauce', 'kicker': 'Neighborhood Joint', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Live Music, Hot Food, Hot Sauce', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Richmond Hill (Queens, NY)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': "Singh's Roti Shop and Bar (Queens, NY, Restaurant)", 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T00:08:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Cotto', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cotto', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/31179210-2500-566f-bcbe-4f45950b2ed0', 'word_count': 615, 'uri': 'nyt://article/31179210-2500-566f-bcbe-4f45950b2ed0'}, {'abstract': 'Web.com, a provider of Internet services, is becoming the main sponsor of the golf tour that is just below the level of the PGA Tour.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/business/media/webcom-to-sponsor-golf-tour.html', 'snippet': 'Web.com, a provider of Internet services, is becoming the main sponsor of the golf tour that is just below the level of the PGA Tour.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WEB.COM, which provides Internet services to small and medium-size businesses, is switching up its low-key profile by signing on to sponsor the golf circuit for promising players seeking to qualify for the elite PGA Tour. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/business/Adco/Adco-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 954, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'j