ork, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/nyregion/lottery-numbers-for-new-york-new-jersey-and-connecticut.html', 'snippet': 'Lottery numbers for June 28, 2012, for New York, New Jersey and Connecticut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'June 28, 2012', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Lottery Numbers', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Lottery Numbers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lotteries', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New Jersey', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Connecticut', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York State', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T01:35:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'List', '_id': 'nyt://article/cab0e42f-8a16-5cc4-b5ae-4cacaf4a3948', 'word_count': 232, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cab0e42f-8a16-5cc4-b5ae-4cacaf4a3948'}, {'abstract': 'A 19th-century mitt bought on eBay for about $750 was later resold for more than $200,000 with the false claim of having belonged to the famous baseball player.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/nyregion/man-faces-prison-for-selling-glove-with-babe-ruth-lie.html', 'snippet': 'A 19th-century mitt bought on eBay for about $750 was later resold for more than $200,000 with the false claim of having belonged to the famous baseball player.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The offer was extraordinary: A baseball mitt once owned by Babe Ruth was being offered by a memorabilia broker in Nevada. But the mitt had an even richer history, its owner wrote; in 1944, the Babe had given the glove to his close friend Robert Young, the Hollywood star, who had kept it in his private collection for more than 68 years.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/nyregion/Y-RUTH/Y-RUTH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 658, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/nyregion/Y-RUTH/Y-RUTH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1316, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/nyregion/Y-RUTH/Y-RUTH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/29/nyregion/Y-RUTH/Y-RUTH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/nyregion/Y-RUTH/Y-RUTH-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Man Faces Prison for Selling Glove With Babe Ruth Lie', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Man Faces Prison for Selling Glove With Babe Ruth Lie', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Memorabilia and Souvenirs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ruth, Babe', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Frauds and Swindling', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T01:42:37+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Metro', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By Benjamin Weiser', 'pe