tates Open, shot an even-par 71 in the first round and was tied for 23rd.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BETHESDA, Md. — Morning rush-hour traffic clogged the Capital Beltway as temperatures rose when Beau Hossler teed off shortly before 9 o’clock Thursday at the AT&T National. But a large crowd was on hand to follow the 17-year-old Hossler, who was a sensation at the United States Open.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Hossler Draws a Crowd at AT&T National', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hossler Draws a Crowd at AT&T National', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Golf', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hossler, Beau', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Van Pelt, Bo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hurley, Billy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T02:44:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Golf', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Wendel', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Wendel', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4b2d3d45-cb59-56fe-9464-3db9f58e59c3', 'word_count': 633, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4b2d3d45-cb59-56fe-9464-3db9f58e59c3'}, {'abstract': "What will be the economic implications of President Obama's signature legislation? How well will it expand coverage?", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/roomfordebate/2012/06/28/how-will-the-affordable-care-act-unfold/', 'snippet': "What will be the economic implications of President Obama's signature legislation? How well will it expand coverage?", 'lead_paragraph': '', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How Will the Health Care Law  Unfold?', 'kicker': 'Room for Debate', 'c