gallery owners to follow artists to SoHo, helping find, popularize and market artists like Andy Warhol, Roy Lichtenstein and Robert Rauschenberg.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/arts/design/ivan-karp-pop-art-dealer-dies-at-86.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Karp was one of the first gallery owners to follow artists to SoHo, helping find, popularize and market artists like Andy Warhol, Roy Lichtenstein and Robert Rauschenberg.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ivan Karp, a cigar-chomping, fast-talking New York gallery owner who helped find, popularize and market the Pop artists of the 1960s, including Andy Warhol, Roy Lichtenstein and Robert Rauschenberg, died on Thursday at his home in Charlotteville, N.Y. He was 86.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/KARP-obit/KARP-obit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/KARP-obit/KARP-obit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 1709, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/KARP-obit/KARP-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/KARP-obit/KARP-obit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/29/arts/KARP-obit/KARP-obit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Ivan Karp, Pop Art Dealer, Dies at 86', 'kicker': None,