ate a few bites of my apple. The health classes were 43 minutes long, 41 after a few kids wandered in late and the teacher reminded everyone to hand in their nutrition projects by Friday. This was the second year I’d volunteered as a guest speaker at this high school, and today they were making sure I reached every last senior.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'I Refuse to Let Child Abuse Define Me', 'kicker': 'Motherlode', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Child Abuse and Neglect', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Children and Childhood', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Families and Family Life', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parenting', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T14:30:44+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By Emily Rosenbaum', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Emily', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Rosenbaum', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b41f52aa-d945-5115-94ea-ecb7f8743df9', 'word_count': 814, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b41f52aa-d945-5115-94ea-ecb7f8743df9'}, {'abstract': 'The Candy brothers, who redefined high-end development in London with One Hyde Park, now have their sights trained on New York and Los Angeles.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/realestate/big-deal-london-the-upstarts-empire.html', 'snippet': 'The Candy brothers, who redefined high-end development in London with One Hyde Park, now have their sights trained on New York and Los Angeles.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, '