oat on the edge of Sognefjord, the longest fjord in Norway, slicing through water that resembled dark green glass. The sky yawned ever wider as the docks of the small town of Balestrand fell behind. All five passengers were wearing puffy, black full-body suits that worked as life jackets and, the captain assured us, would sustain us for two days if the untoward occurred.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01NORWAY_SPAN/01NORWAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 306, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01NORWAY_SPAN/01NORWAY-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 306}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01NORWAY_SPAN/01NORWAY-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01NORWAY_SPAN/01NORWAY-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 522, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01NORWAY_SPAN/01NORWAY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01NORWAY_SPAN/01NORWAY_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01NORWAY_SPAN/01NORWAY_SPAN-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 149, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headlin