 number is expected next year. What’s driving the growth, and who’s taking these cruises?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/travel/interest-in-european-river-cruises-soars.html', 'snippet': 'At least 11 new cruise ships are launching this year, and a similar number is expected next year. What’s driving the growth, and who’s taking these cruises?', 'lead_paragraph': 'IN Europe, where waterways were the roadways of the pre-automobile past, major cities from Amsterdam to Vienna reside on rivers. Centuries after those rivers were supplanted by railways and highways as main thoroughfares, there is renewed interest in traveling on them: at least 11 new river cruise ships are launching this year, and a similar number is expected next year. Over the last five years, many lines have doubled their capacity.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01HEADSUP_SPAN/01HEADSUP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01HEADSUP_SPAN/01HEADSUP_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01HEADSUP_SPAN/01HEADSUP-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01HEADSUP_SPAN/01HEADSUP-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/travel/01HEADSUP_SPAN/01HEADSUP_SPAN-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su