 'On Thursday I challenged Well readers to solve the mystery of a 48-year-old man with shortness of breath, fatigue and lesions on his shoulder and thigh bones. Nearly 200 people wrote in, and nearly one in six, or 34, people figured it out.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 280, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 280, 'width': 400, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/02/29/health/29well_diagnosis/29well_diagnosis-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Think Like a Doctor: Too Sick to Smoke Solved!', 'kicker': 'Well', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Doctors', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lungs', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Smoking and Tobacco', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Tests (Medical)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T17:35:27+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Health', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Sanders, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanders', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5eaf8f47-70e2-503d-a5a2-a40e8bc306c8', 'word_count': 1264, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5eaf8f47-70e2-503d-a5a2-a40e8bc306c8'}, {'abstract': 'Scott Gration cited “differences with Washington” as a reason for leaving days before the release of a highly critical government audit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/world/africa/scott-gration-resigns-as-us-ambassador-to-kenya.html', 'snippet': 'Scott Gration cited “differences with Washington” as a reason for leaving days before the release of a highly critical government audit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NAIROBI, Kenya — The American ambassador to Kenya, once a confidant of President Obama, abruptly announced on Friday — days before the release of a stinging internal audit — that he was resigning, citing “differences with Washington.” His departure will leave the top embassy post vacant at a time when Kenya is increasingly being drawn into a battle with militant Islam. ', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/world/kenya/kenya-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 737, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/world/kenya/kenya-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1314, 'width': 946, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',