}, {'abstract': 'The actress of the television show “Castle” shares her beauty regimen.', 'web_url': 'https://tmagazine.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/face-time-stana-katic/', 'snippet': 'The actress of the television show “Castle” shares her beauty regimen.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I met up with Stana Katic recently at the Crosby Hotel, she was thrilled, having just learned that her show “Castle” (in which she plays a detective) had been renewed for a fifth season. Katic was getting ready to go on a few appointments, so a little makeup and a quick chat were in order. She filled me in on her future movie projects: “Big Sur” (about Jack Kerouac) and “CBGB” (about the rock club), and revealed how she keeps her skin glowing and her figure fit.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Face Time | Stana Katic', 'kicker': 'T Magazine', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T20:12:55+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tina Turnbow', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tina', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Turnbow', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b4dc2897-bf1f-5256-80d0-8e0327fa4db6', 'word_count': 1173, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4dc2897-bf1f-5256-80d0-8e0327fa4db6'}, {'abstract': 'Jennifer Weiner spoofs Jeffrey Eugenides in an ad for her new novel.', 'web_url': 'https://artsbeat.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/the-next-vest-thing-in-author-ads-2/', 'snippet': 'Jennifer Weiner spoofs Jeffrey Eugenides in an ad for her new novel.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One good vest deserves another. The novelist Jennifer Weiner has some good-natured fun at the expense of fellow best-selling author Jeffrey Eugenides in an online ad for her new novel, “The Next Best Thing.”', 'source': 'The 