': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Condiments', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T20:49:58+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Melissa Clark', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Clark', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2e71baf0-a995-5183-90f1-7f1d2fa6e5ff', 'word_count': 475, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2e71baf0-a995-5183-90f1-7f1d2fa6e5ff'}, {'abstract': 'Melissa Clark demonstrates how to cook a perfect burger indoors.', 'web_url': 'https://dinersjournal.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/how-to-pan-grill-a-burger/', 'snippet': 'Melissa Clark demonstrates how to cook a perfect burger indoors.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This week’s video about pan-grilling the perfect burger (though there are tips that apply to burgers on the regular grill, too) is a companion to my column about DIY condiments. Basically it’s my week to revel in burgers, toppings and all. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Pan-Grill a Burger', 'kicker': 'Diner&#039;s Journal', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T20:51:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Style', 'byline': {'original': 'By MELISSA CLARK', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Melissa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'CLARK', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3c20db76-46b7-536b-9710-802e002897d0', 'word_count': 158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3c20db76-46b7-536b-9710-802e002897d0'}, {'abstract': 'Qualifying for a mortgage interest rate beginning with a three is not impossible, but you will have to jump through more hoops than ever and you’ll have a story to tell at the end.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/your-money/mortgages/how-to-get-a-mortgage-rate-that-starts-with-a-3.html', 'snippet': 'Qualifying for a mortgage interest rate beginning with a three is not impossible, but you will have to jump through more hoops than ever and you’ll have a story to tell at the end.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Mortgage rates have never looked this good. They are at about 3.81 percent for a second week, a record low. But who gets that rate? What does it actually take to secure a mortgage rate that begins with the enviable number 3? ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/your-money/30money/30money-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 330, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/06/30/your-money/30money/30money-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 330}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/your-money/30money/30money-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 718, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/your-money/30money/30money-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1436, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/your-money/30money/30money-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/30/your-money/30money/30money-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/your-money/30money/30money-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Mortgage Rate Beginning With a 3', 'kicker': 'Your Money', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Mortgage Rate Beginning With a 3', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Housing Administration', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Personal Finances', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal National Mortgage Assn (Fannie Mae)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Credit Scores', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Interest Rates', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mortgages', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T20:51:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Your Money', 'subsection_name': 'Mortgages', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tara Siegel Bernard', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tara', 'middlename': 'Siegel', 'lastname': 'Bernard', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cd33f863-4562-54e7-9092-953250ad243e', 'word_count': 1551, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cd33f863-4562-54e7-9092-953250ad243e'}, {'abstract': 'When it comes to being a celebrity, Alec Baldwin brings a little bit of everything to the table.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/fashion/on-celebrities-good-and-bad-or-alec-baldwin.html', 'snippet': 'When it comes to being a celebrity, Alec Baldwin brings a little bit of everything to the table.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SOME years ago, I was standing behind Alec Baldwin at a party while talking with another writer, when the actor turned around and offered us a cigar with the most postmodern smile I have ever seen. “Have a petit robusto,” he said. He exaggerated the “eet” in “petit” ever so slightly, a delicate emphasis that had the effect of making comically explicit the absurdity of applying “petit” to “robusto.” When he got to the latter word, he pronounced “robusto” one syllable at a time — “Ro. Bus. Toe.” — with such ironic vigor that cigar, celebrity and offer collapsed into layers of self-parody. He was a famous actor playing a regular guy who was acknowledging the fatuity of being a celebrity even as he was savoring its every moment. You felt he really, genuinely, wanted to be liked, at the same time as he couldn’t have cared less whether you liked him or not.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/fashion/01BALDWIN1_SPAN/01BALDWIN1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/07/01/fashion/01BALDWIN1_SPAN/01BALDWIN1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/fashion/01BALDWIN1_SPAN/01BALDWIN1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 757, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/fashion/01BALDWIN1_SPAN/01BALDWIN1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1515, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/fashion/01BALDWIN1_SPAN/0