resigns/', 'snippet': 'Yahoo said on Friday that its general counsel, Michael Callahan, had resigned, in the latest executive change under the Internet company’s interim chief executive, Ross Levinsohn.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Yahoo said on Friday that its general counsel, Michael J. Callahan, had resigned, \xa0the latest executive change under the Internet company’s interim chief executive, Ross Levinsohn.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Yahoo’s General Counsel Resigns', 'kicker': 'DealBook', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Callahan, Michael J', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Levinsohn, Ross', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Yahoo! Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T22:22:49+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael J. de la Merced and Evelyn M. Rusli', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': 'J.', 'lastname': 'de la Merced', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Evelyn', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47a12b77-f978-5573-a8b2-2eb301fe37f1', 'word_count': 300, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47a12b77-f978-5573-a8b2-2eb301fe37f1'}, {'abstract': 'Subjects include karaoke among Albany legislators, the primary races in New York and the long-awaited reopening of McCarren Park pool.', 'web_url': 'https://cityroom.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/29/week-in-pictures-for-june-29/', 'snippet': 'Subjects include karaoke among Albany legislators, the primary races in New York and the long-awaited reopening of McCarren Park pool.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here is a slide show of photographs from the past week in New York City and the region. Subjects include karaoke among Albany legislators, the primary races in New York and the long-awaited reopening of McCarren Park pool.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Week in Pictures for June 29', 'kicker': 'City Room', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Photography', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'New York City', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T22:29:25+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'New York', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/34dc11bb-a56f-5ff0-b174-548565cd3cca', 'word_count': 144, 'uri': 'nyt://article/34dc11bb-a56f-5ff0-b174-548565cd3cca'}, {'abstract': 'For those who love white Burgundy but dread the cost, the Mâconnais region of France offers a wine that can be both lively and vivacious at a much lower price point.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/04/dining/reviews/rediscovering-maconnais-wines-like-white-burgundy-but-without-the-expense-wines-of-the-times.html', 'snippet': 'For those who love white Burgundy but dread the cost, the Mâconnais region of France offers a wine that can be both lively and vivacious at a much lower price point.', 'lead_paragraph': 'THE wines of the Mâconnais region of France are nobody’s idea of a new discovery. Back in the 1980s, when I began drinking a lot of wine, they were a reliable source for fresh, crisp, inexpensive whites, and they have remained so. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/04/dining/04WINE_SPAN/04WINE_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 380, 'widt