rch of the Nativity in Bethlehem was added to the World Heritage List, a move celebrated by Palestinians as a significant political and diplomatic achievement as much as a cultural one.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/world/middleeast/unesco-grants-heritage-status-to-nativity-church-in-diplomatic-victory-to-palestinians.html', 'snippet': 'The Church of the Nativity in Bethlehem was added to the World Heritage List, a move celebrated by Palestinians as a significant political and diplomatic achievement as much as a cultural one.', 'lead_paragraph': 'JERUSALEM — The Church of the Nativity in Bethlehem, along with the Pilgrimage Route, was added on Friday to Unesco’s World Heritage List, a move that was celebrated by Palestinians who hailed it as a significant political and diplomatic achievement as much as a cultural one.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Unesco Adds Nativity Church in Bethlehem to Heritage List', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Unesco Adds Nativity Site In Bethlehem To World List', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restoration and Renovation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States International Relations', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'West Bank', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Churches (Buildings)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ashrawi, Hanan', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Historic Buildings and Sites', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-29T22:49:31+0000', 'documen