': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/2864ee0d-4dcc-566a-9702-eec77cd133e8', 'word_count': 223, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2864ee0d-4dcc-566a-9702-eec77cd133e8'}, {'abstract': 'A settlement involving so-called Bird rights will allow the Knicks to exceed the N.B.A. salary cap to re-sign Jeremy Lin and Steve Novak.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/sports/basketball/bird-rights-settlement-gives-knicks-boost-in-effort-to-keep-lin.html', 'snippet': 'A settlement involving so-called Bird rights will allow the Knicks to exceed the N.B.A. salary cap to re-sign Jeremy Lin and Steve Novak.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jeremy Lin and Steve Novak will keep their so-called early Bird rights under a settlement reached Friday afternoon, giving the Knicks a huge boost on the eve of free agency.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/nba/nba-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 762, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/nba/nba-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1668, 'width': 1242, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/nba/nba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/nba/nba-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/nba/nba-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thu