“Light by the Water” is the latest exhibition from Plein Air Peconic, a group of Long Island painters and photographers affiliated with the nonprofit Peconic Land Trust.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/nyregion/light-by-the-water-by-plein-air-peconic-in-sag-harbor.html', 'snippet': '“Light by the Water” is the latest exhibition from Plein Air Peconic, a group of Long Island painters and photographers affiliated with the nonprofit Peconic Land Trust.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SOUTHAMPTON, N.Y. — One afternoon last month, Susan D’Alessio, a landscape painter, stood at her easel on a sandy spit of land overlooking Scallop Pond, in the Southampton hamlet of North Sea. “There’s two big babies in there,” she said, pointing to an osprey nest atop a tall pole in a salt marsh nearby. A couple of minutes later, as if on cue, a pair of swans glided by in the pond.', 'print_section': 'LI', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSLI3_SPAN/01ARTSLI3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSLI3_SPAN/01ARTSLI3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSLI3_SPAN/01ARTSLI3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 663, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSLI3_SPAN/01ARTSLI3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1277, 'width': 1972, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSLI3_SPAN/01ARTSLI3-thum