stion of neatness.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/nyregion/a-review-of-the-odd-couple-in-storrs.html', 'snippet': 'In Neil Simon’s comedy “The Odd Couple,” Felix is as morose and finicky as Oscar is cheerful and easygoing; when he moves in, he turns Oscar’s relaxed home into a bastion of neatness.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Pat Sajak is always so nice to the contestants on “Wheel of Fortune.” And you have to believe that he’s at least partly sincere, because you can tell when he thinks someone is an idiot. Considering that Mr. Sajak has become America’s sweetheart (not to mention rich and famous) mostly by telling strangers whether they have correctly guessed a letter of the alphabet, he is a strong candidate for most likable human being on earth.', 'print_section': 'CT', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSCT1_SPAN/01ARTSCT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 360, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSCT1_SPAN/01ARTSCT1_SPAN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 360}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSCT1_SPAN/01ARTSCT1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 594, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSCT1_SPAN/01ARTSCT1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1187, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01ARTSCT1_SPAN/01ARTSCT1_SPAN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard