n gallery, was sent back to New York from Europe and intercepted by postal inspectors at Kennedy Airport.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The way it was stolen was unusual. So was the way it was returned.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/nyregion/DALI/DALI-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 812, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/nyregion/DALI/DALI-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1624, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/nyregion/DALI/DALI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/30/nyregion/DALI/DALI-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/nyregion/DALI/DALI-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'After a Bizarre Journey, a Stolen Dalí Is Returned', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'After a Bizarre Journey, A Stolen Dalí Is Returned', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Robberies and Thefts', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dali, Salvador', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Kennedy International Airport (NYC)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Venus Over Manhattan (Manhattan, NY, Gallery