ance-exchanges.html', 'snippet': 'Republican-led states should stop stalling on implementing health care reform now that it is here to stay.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Now that the health care reform law has been ruled constitutional, it is imperative that as many states as possible move aggressively to establish a centerpiece of the reform structure: new insurance policy exchanges for people who lack affordable coverage through an employer. Federal subsidies will be available for those with low or moderate incomes.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'It’s Time to Set Up Exchanges', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It’s Time to Set Up Exchanges', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Patient Protection and Affordable Care Act (2010)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'States (US)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Federal Aid (US)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Health Insurance and Managed Care', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Reform and Reorganization', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Supreme Court', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Sebelius, Kathleen', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Obama, Barack', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-30T01:53:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b102fa3-cb96-5949-b853-5b46e184aa46', 'word_count': 488, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b102fa3-cb96-5949-b853-5b46e184aa46'}, {'abstract': 'New Yorkers turned to Twitter in the days after Nora Ephron’s death on Tuesday to say a thousand different ways: There was no one quite like her.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/nyregion/on-twitter-mourning-the-wit-and-the-wisdom-of-nora-ephron.html', 'snippet': 'New Yorkers turned to Twitter in the days after Nora Ephron’s death on Tuesday to say a thousand different ways: There was no one quite like her.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SHE could have mastered the medium if she had chosen to, tailored as it is to pithy turns of phrase and incisive observations.', 'print_section': 'MB', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01TRENDING/01TRENDING-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 795, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01TRENDING/01TRENDING-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1589, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01TRENDING/01TRENDING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01TRENDING/01TRENDING-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/nyregion/01TRENDING/01TRENDING-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Mourning the Wit and the Woman', 'kicker': '#trendingnyc', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Mourning the Wit And the Woman', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ephron, Nora', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N