4-5b6e8f595587'}, {'abstract': 'R.A. Dickey scattered three hits in eight more dominant innings for the Mets as they routed the Dodgers, 9-0.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/sports/baseball/dickey-earns-12th-win-as-mets-top-dodgers.html', 'snippet': 'R.A. Dickey scattered three hits in eight more dominant innings for the Mets as they routed the Dodgers, 9-0.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — R. A. Dickey on Friday returned some normalcy to his season. Though, of course, what has been normal for him this year has been anything but routine.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/baseball/30mets-dickey/30mets-dickey-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 755, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/baseball/30mets-dickey/30mets-dickey-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1509, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/baseball/30mets-dickey/30mets-dickey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/baseball/30mets-dickey/30mets-dickey-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/06/30/sports/baseball/30mets-dickey/30mets-dickey-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Dickey Earns 12th Win as Mets Top Dodgers', 'kicker': 'Mets 9, Dodgers 0', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dickey Earns 12th Win as Mets Top Dodgers', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Baseball', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'New York Mets', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Dickey, R A', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Los Angeles Dodgers', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-30T05:44:16+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Baseball', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/57453be7-ec16-5a13-9c61-818074fe3e20', 'word_count': 685, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57453be7-ec16-5a13-9c61-818074fe3e20'}, {'abstract': 'A round-up of news from across India.', 'web_url': 'https://india.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/newswallah-bharat-edition-45/', 'snippet': 'A round-up of news from across India.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Jammu and Kashmir: The army will court-martial five of its officers who are accused of involvement in the killing of five civilians in a fake encounter in Anantnag district of Kashmir in 2000, The Indian Express reported. The killings followed the massacre of 35 Sikhs in a village in Anantnag, and the army had labeled the five civilians as militants.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Newswallah: Bharat Edition', 'kicker': 'India Ink', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2012-06-30T06:42:31+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Asia Pacific', 'byline': {'original': 'By The New York Times', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The New York Times'}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/88d9181b-f1da-5c0a-b81f-6cfc28469e83', 'word_count': 460, 'uri': 'nyt://article/88d9181b-f1da-5c0a-b81f-6cfc28469e83'}, {'abstract': 'The “crazy busy” existence so many of us complain about is almost entirely self-imposed.', 'web_url': 'https://opinionator.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/the-busy-trap/', 'snippet': 'The “crazy busy” existence so many of us complain about is almost entirely self-imposed.', 'lead_paragraph': 'If you live in America in the 21st century you’ve probably had to listen to a lot of people tell you how busy they are. It’s become the default response when you ask anyone how they’re doing: “Busy!” “So busy.” “Crazy busy.” It is, pretty obviously, a boast disguised as a complaint. And the stock response is a kind of congratulation: “That’s a good problem to have,” or “Better than the opposite.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'The ‘Busy’ Trap', 'kicker': 'Anxiety', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Anxiety and Stress', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Social Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-30T07:15:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Tim Kreider', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Tim', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Kreider', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/7bc2ed88-cb53-5373-a01d-10509e717969', 'word_count': 1654, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7bc2ed88-cb53-5373-a01d-10509e717969'}, {'abstract': 'Political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at the president’s weekly address.', 'web_url': 'https://thecaucus.blogs.nytimes.com/2012/06/30/the-weekend-word-arm-wrestle/', 'snippet': 'Political news from today’s Times and around the Web, plus a look at the pres