th high-tech swimsuits out, only three American records fell while every world record remained standing.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/sports/olympics/at-us-olympic-trials-there-is-no-swimsuit-issue.html', 'snippet': 'In the first five days of the United States Olympic swimming trials, with high-tech swimsuits out, only three American records fell while every world record remained standing.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OMAHA — The waves of technology lapping the Olympic pool this year are ferrying space-age goggles and contoured caps that will never be confused with couture. It is fitting that the head and the eyes are the focal points. With the era of polyurethane racing suits receding, people can once again look at swimmers’ times and rationally assume that they are unaided. ', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/sports/dog-suit/dog-suit-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 611, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/sports/dog-suit/dog-suit-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1222, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/sports/dog-suit/dog-suit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/07/01/sports/dog-suit/dog-suit-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/sports/dog-suit/dog-suit-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'At U.S. Trials, There’s No Swimsuit Issue', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'At U.S. Trials, There’s No Swimsuit Issue', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2012)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Speedo', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'USA Swimming', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-30T15:35:43+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Karen Crouse', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Karen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Crouse', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b66d7a8c-f1c8-5c5f-80e4-c363f1e37c51', 'word_count': 977, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b66d7a8c-f1c8-5c5f-80e4-c363f1e37c51'}, {'abstract': 'As a teenager, Karen Crouse interviewed swimmer Mike Bruner in 1976, and her article encouraged Bruner at the Olympic trials.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/sports/olympics/swimmer-and-young-writer-inspired-each-other-in-1976.html', 'snippet': 'As a teenager, Karen Crouse interviewed swimmer Mike Bruner in 1976, and her article encouraged Bruner at the Olympic trials.', 'lead_paragraph': 'OMAHA — I’ve been the Forrest Gump of sportswriters, a witness to all kinds of history. I was there for the Mighty Ducks’ first N.H.L. game and Pete Sampras’s last major victory; for the Giants’ last-minute win over the Patriots in Super Bowl XLII and the Cubs’ playoff loss to the Marlins in the infamous Bartman game. ', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/sports/bruner1/bruner1-jumbo.jpg'