 it’s also being mixed to print lightweight circuits, sensors and switches. ', 'print_section': 'BU', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/business/01-novel-sub/01-novel-sub-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 632, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/business/01-novel-sub/01-novel-sub-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1265, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/business/01-novel-sub/01-novel-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2012/07/01/business/01-novel-sub/01-novel-sub-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2012/07/01/business/01-novel-sub/01-novel-sub-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Hot Off the Presses, Conductive Ink', 'kicker': 'Novelties', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Hot Off the Presses, Conductive Ink', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Electronics', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Automobiles', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Novalia Ltd', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'T-Ink Inc', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Printing and Allied Trades', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-30T19:39:38+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk