 economy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2012/07/01/opinion/sunday/immigrants-and-small-business.html', 'snippet': 'A new study paints a broad and detailed picture of immigrant entrepreneurship, affirming the centrality of immigration in the American economy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Immigrants are known as entrepreneurial people, for obvious reasons: those with the ambition and energy to uproot themselves and build new lives in a distant land are well equipped to build businesses and the economy, too. That is the common wisdom, anyway, which a new study from the Fiscal Policy Institute strikingly confirms. The study, based on census data, looks at owners of small businesses across the country and paints a broad and detailed picture of immigrant entrepreneurship.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Immigrants and Small Business', 'kicker': 'Editorial', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Immigrants and Small Business', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Fiscal Policy Institute', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Immigration and Emigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Small Business', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Entrepreneurship', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Editorials', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2012-06-30T22:02:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Editorial', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Editorial', '_id': 'nyt://article/3e68cc59-eb2a-5386-9567-4a35769aaf3c', 'word_count': 450, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3e68cc59-eb2a-5386-9567-4a35769aaf3c'}, {'abstract': 'Unthinkable, unimaginable and, for Irish 